rmek Ecu Kontrol \xdcnitesi Ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 Etkiler. Devam Etmek \u0130stiyor Musunuz?",confirmOk:"Devam Et",confirmCancel:"\u0130ptal",categoryLighting:"Ayd\u0131nlatma",categorySound:"Ses & Uyar\u0131lar",categoryDisplay:"G\xf6sterge Paneli",categoryDriving:"S\xfcr\xfc\u015f",featureDrl:"G\xfcnd\xfcz Farlar\u0131",featureRearFog:"Arka Sis Far\u0131 \u0130ptali",featureDoorChime:"Kap\u0131 Uyar\u0131 Sesini Kapat",featureParkingAlert:"El Freni Sesli Uyar\u0131s\u0131",featureRpmWarning:"Devir S\u0131n\u0131r\u0131 Uyar\u0131s\u0131",featureFuelSensitivity:"Yak\u0131t G\xf6stergesi Hassasiyeti",featureStartStop:"Start-Stop Varsay\u0131lan Kapal\u0131",featureSportMemory:"Sport Modu Haf\u0131zas\u0131",enabled:"Aktif",disabled:"Pasif",writeSuccess:"\xd6zellik ba\u015far\u0131yla g\xfcncellendi.",writeError:"Yazma hatas\u0131. L\xfctfen tekrar deneyin.",simulationBanner:"Sim\xfclasyon Modu \u2014 ECU'ya ger\xe7ek yazma hen\xfcz aktif de\u011fil",closeBtn:"Kapat",disclaimerTitle:"SORUMLULUK REDD\u0130 BEYANI",disclaimerFeature:"\xd6zellik",disclaimerBody:"Bu \xf6zelli\u011fi de\u011fi\u015ftirmek arac\u0131n\u0131z\u0131n fabrika ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 ve ECU yaz\u0131l\u0131m\u0131n\u0131 do\u011frudan etkiler. L\xfctfen a\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki riskleri dikkatlice okuyun: \u2022 Yanl\u0131\u015f uygulama ara\xe7 garantinizi ge\xe7ersiz k\u0131labilir.\n\u2022 Baz\u0131 de\u011fi\u015fiklikler kal\u0131c\u0131 ar\u0131zalara veya beklenmedik elektriksel hatalara neden olabilir.\n\u2022 \u0130\u015flem geri al\u0131nabilir olsa da baz\u0131 ECU mod\xfclleri fabrika ayarlar\u0131na s\u0131f\u0131rlama gerektirebilir.\n\u2022 Bu \xf6zelli\u011fin kullan\u0131m\u0131ndan do\u011facak her t\xfcrl\xfc maddi veya manevi zarardan tamamen kullan\u0131c\u0131 sorumludur.\n\u2022 Bu de\u011fi\u015fikliklerin neden olabilece\u011fi herhangi bir ar\u0131za veya hasardan Cortex OBD2 Diagnostic Scanner sorumlu tutulamaz. Bu uyar\u0131y\u0131 okudu\u011funuzu ve anlad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 onaylaman\u0131z gerekir.",checkboxTitle:"ONAY GEREKL\u0130",check1:"Bu uyar\u0131y\u0131 okudum ve arac\u0131m\u0131n garantisinin etkilenebilece\u011fini anl\u0131yorum.",check2:"Bu i\u015flemden kaynaklanan herhangi bir ar\u0131za veya hasardan Cortex OBD2 Diagnostic Scanner'in sorumlu olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 kabul ediyorum.",check3:"Bu de\u011fi\u015fikli\u011fi bilerek, kendi \xf6zg\xfcr irademle ve t\xfcm riskleri \xfcstlenerek yapmak istiyorum.",disclaimerCancel:"\u0130PTAL",disclaimerContinue:"DEVAM ET",unsupportedTitle:"Desteklenmiyor",unsupportedMsg:"Ba\u011fl\u0131 OBD2 cihaz\u0131 hen\xfcz bu \xf6zelli\u011fi desteklemiyor. Gizli \xf6zellik yazmak i\xe7in uyumlu bir ELM327 v2.1+ adapt\xf6r gereklidir. Klon veya standart adapt\xf6rler bu komutlar\u0131 i\u015fleyemez.",unsupportedOk:"Tamam"},secretDebug:{title:"MOTO CORTEX GEL\u0130\u015eT\u0130RME PANEL\u0130",logFileSize:"Kara Kutu / Dosya Boyutu:",dtcCloudSync:"DTC BULUT SENKRON\u0130ZASYONU",lastSync:"Son E\u015fitleme",syncNow:"\u015eimdi E\u015fitle",developerTools:"GEL\u0130\u015eT\u0130R\u0130C\u0130 ARA\xc7LARI",trialResetSuccess:"Free Trial sayac\u0131 s\u0131f\u0131rland\u0131!",crashTestTitle:"\xc7arp\u0131\u015fma Testi",crashTestDesc:"Uygulama \u015fimdi kasten \xe7\xf6kecektir. Crashlytics entegrasyonunu do\u011frulamak i\xe7in bunu onaylay\u0131n.",crashButton:"\xc7\xf6kert",crashTest:"\xc7arp\u0131\u015fma Testi"},features:{headerCategory:"Gizli \xd6zellik & Kodlama",title:"G\u0130ZL\u0130 \xd6ZELL\u0130K A\xc7 & UDS KODLAMA",subTitle:"ISO 14229 UDS Long Coding & Adaptasyon Motoru",batteryVoltage:"AK\xdc VOLTAJI",voltageReady:"G\xfcvenli",voltageLocked:"D\xfc\u015f\xfck Voltaj",locked:"K\u0130L\u0130TL\u0130",ready:"HAZIR",vehicleMatched:"{{make}} \u2014 E\u015eLE\u015eT\u0130",demoModeVehicle:"DEMO MODU: {{make}}",waitingVehicle:"BA\u011eLI ARA\xc7 BEKLEN\u0130YOR",activeFeaturesCount:"{{count}} adet araca \xf6zel OEM gizli \xf6zellik aktif",demoFeaturesCount:"