ini geri \xe7eker."},bmw_epb_pad_change:{name:"EPB Fren Servis Konumu",desc:"Arka balata de\u011fi\u015fimi i\xe7in park freni motorlar\u0131n\u0131 servis konumuna getirir."},mb_epb_pad_change:{name:"EPB Balata Takma Servis Modu",desc:"Fren servisi i\xe7in park freni milini at\xf6lye konumuna serbest b\u0131rak\u0131r."},vag_dpf_regen:{name:"DPF Servis Rejenerasyon Tetikleme",desc:"Sabit konumda Dizel Partik\xfcl Filtresi kurum yakma s\xfcrecini ba\u015flat\u0131r."},bmw_dpf_regen:{name:"DPF Zorunlu Rejenerasyon Tetikleme",desc:"DDE motor beynine aktif partik\xfcl filtre temizlik rutinini ba\u015flatma iste\u011fi g\xf6nderir."},psa_dpf_regen:{name:"DPF Rejenerasyon \u0130ste\u011fi",desc:"HDi dizel ara\xe7larda ara\xe7 durur halde DPF rejenerasyonunu ba\u015flat\u0131r."},bmw_bms_battery_register:{name:"BMS Ak\xfc De\u011fi\u015fimi Kayd\u0131",desc:"Yeni tak\u0131lan ak\xfcy\xfc Ak\u0131ll\u0131 Ak\xfc Sens\xf6r\xfc ve DME/DDE beynine tan\u0131mlar."},mb_bms_battery_register:{name:"Ak\xfc Kayd\u0131 ve Ya\u015flanma Sayac\u0131 S\u0131f\u0131rlama",desc:"Ak\xfc de\u011fi\u015fimi sonras\u0131 SAM mod\xfcl\xfcndeki ak\xfc ya\u015flanma sayac\u0131n\u0131 s\u0131f\u0131rlar."},vag_sas_calibrate:{name:"Direksiyon A\xe7\u0131s\u0131 Sens\xf6r\xfc Kalibrasyonu",desc:"ABS/ESP beyni i\xe7in G85 direksiyon a\xe7\u0131 sens\xf6r\xfcn\xfcn s\u0131f\u0131r noktas\u0131n\u0131 kalibre eder."},toyota_sas_calibrate:{name:"Direksiyon A\xe7\u0131 Sens\xf6r\xfc S\u0131f\u0131rlama",desc:"Kayma Kontrol ECU'sunda direksiyon a\xe7\u0131 sens\xf6r\xfc s\u0131f\u0131r nokta kalibrasyonunu yapar."},generic_tba_adapt:{name:"Gaz Kelebe\u011fi Hizalama ve Adaptasyonu",desc:"Motor beyninde elektronik gaz kelebe\u011fi durma noktas\u0131 \xf6\u011frenme rutinini \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r."},epb_service_reset:{name:"Evrensel EPB Bak\u0131m S\u0131f\u0131rlama",desc:"Elektronik park freni balata a\u015f\u0131nma sayac\u0131n\u0131 ve hava aral\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 s\u0131f\u0131rlar."},vag_dsg_reset:{name:"DSG \u015eanz\u0131man Temel Ayar S\u0131f\u0131rlama",desc:"DSG/S-Tronic \u015fanz\u0131manda debriyaj kavrama ve valf adaptasyonlar\u0131n\u0131 s\u0131f\u0131rlar."},bmw_zf_reset:{name:"ZF 8HP \u015eanz\u0131man Adaptasyon S\u0131f\u0131rlama",desc:"EGS \u015fanz\u0131man vites ge\xe7i\u015f s\xfcreleri ve bas\u0131n\xe7 adaptasyon de\u011ferlerini temizler."},bmw_brake_fluid_reset:{name:"Fren Hidrolik Servis Sayac\u0131 S\u0131f\u0131rlama",desc:"Condition Based Service 2 y\u0131ll\u0131k fren hidroli\u011fi de\u011fi\u015fim zamanlay\u0131c\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 s\u0131f\u0131rlar."},ford_injector_code:{name:"Enjekt\xf6r D\xfczeltme Fakt\xf6r\xfc Kodlama",desc:"Dizel enjekt\xf6rler i\xe7in 16 haneli IQA kodlar\u0131n\u0131 PCM motor beynine kaydeder."},bmw_injector_code:{name:"Yak\u0131t Enjekt\xf6r\xfc Debisi Kodlama",desc:"De\u011fi\u015ftirilen yak\u0131t enjekt\xf6rlerinin kalibrasyon kodlar\u0131n\u0131 DME beynine yazar."},generic_headlight_aim:{name:"Otomatik Far Seviye Kalibrasyonu",desc:"Adaptif far y\xfckseklik motorlar\u0131 i\xe7in referans s\u0131f\u0131r noktas\u0131n\u0131 ayarlar."},bmw_12v_battery_reg:{name:"12V Yedek Ak\xfc Kayd\u0131",desc:"PCU \xfcnitesine yedek AGM mar\u015f/destek ak\xfcs\xfc de\u011fi\u015fimini tan\u0131mlar."},vag_comfort_turn_signal:{name:"Konfor Sinyal Fla\u015f Say\u0131s\u0131",desc:"\u015eerit de\u011fi\u015ftirme sinyali vuru\u015f say\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 3, 4 veya 5 olarak ayarlar."},vag_coming_home_duration:{name:"Coming/Leaving Home Far S\xfcresi",desc:"Arac\u0131 kilitledikten sonra farlar\u0131n a\xe7\u0131k kalma s\xfcresini belirler."},vag_remote_windows:{name:"Kumandadan Konfor Cam A\xe7ma/Kapatma",desc:"Uzaktan kumanda tu\u015funa uzun basarak camlar\u0131n a\xe7\u0131l\u0131p kapanmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},vag_auto_lock_15kmh:{name:"15 km/h H\u0131zda Otomatik Kap\u0131 Kilitleme",desc:"Ara\xe7 h\u0131z\u0131 15 km/saate ula\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131nda t\xfcm kap\u0131lar\u0131 otomatik kilitler."},vag_sfd_unlock_prep:{name:"SFD Gateway Kilit Durumu Haz\u0131rl\u0131\u011f\u0131",desc:"MQB-evo platformunda SFD korumal\u0131 ECU'lara yazma yapmak i\xe7in oturum a\xe7ar."},bmw_asd_deactivate:{name:"Active Sound Design Motor Sesi \u0130ptali",desc:"Hoparl\xf6rlerden i\xe7eri verilen yapay motor sesini tamamen kapat\u0131r."},bmw_comfort_turn_signal:{name:"Konfor Sinyal Vuru\u015f Say\u0131s\u0131",desc:"Tek dokunu\u015fta sinyal lambas\u0131n\u0131n yan\u0131p s\xf6nme say\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ayarlar."},bmw_mirror_fold_lock:{name:"Kilitlemede Yan Aynalar\u0131 Otomatik Katlama",desc:"Ara\xe7 kilitlendi\u011finde katlan\u0131r aynalar\u0131n an\u0131nda kapanmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},toyota_coming_home_duration:{name:"Gecikmeli Far Kapanma / Refakat Ayd\u0131nlatmas\u0131",desc:"Kontak kapat\u0131ld\u0131ktan sonra farlar\u0131n a\xe7\u0131k kalma s\xfcresini ayarlar."},toyota_lane_change_flash:{name:"\u015eerit De\u011fi\u015ftirme Sinyal Say\u0131s\u0131",desc:"Sinyal koluna dokunuldu\u011funda lamban\u0131n yanma say\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 belirler."},toyota_remote_window_close:{name:"Kumandadan Cam Kapatma",desc:"Uzaktan kumanda kilit tu\u015funa uzun basarak t\xfcm camlar\u0131 kapatmay\u0131 aktif eder."},toyota_autolock_behavior:{name:"Otomatik Kap\u0131 Kilitleme/Kilit A\xe7ma Ayarlar\u0131",desc:"Kap\u0131 kilitleme tetikleyicisini belirler."},toyota_approach_welcome_lights:{name:"Ak\u0131ll\u0131 Anahtar Yakla\u015fma Kar\u015f\u0131lama I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131",desc:"Ak\u0131ll\u0131 anahtar araca yakla\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131nda taban ve kabin ayd\u0131nlatmalar\u0131n\u0131 otomatik yakar."},hyundai_autolock_behavior:{name:"Otomatik Kap\u0131 Kilitlenme Modu",desc:"Vitese tak\u0131nca veya h\u0131za ba\u011fl\u0131 otomatik kilitlenme ve P'ye al\u0131nca a\xe7\u0131lma modunu ayarlar."},hyundai_window_remote:{name:"Kumandadan Uzaktan Cam Kontrol\xfc",desc:"Ak\u0131ll\u0131 anahtar tu\u015flar\u0131yla camlar\u0131n uzakta