ate control and seat heating touchscreen menu to SYNC display."},stellantis_power_windows_remote:{name:"Key Fob Remote Window Roll Up/Down",desc:"Rolls up or down all power windows when holding lock/unlock buttons."},stellantis_cornering_fogs:{name:"Cornering Fog Lights Enable",desc:"Illuminates cornering fog lamp during low-speed turns."},vag_traffic_sign_recognition:{name:"Traffic Sign Recognition",desc:"Displays camera-detected speed signs in instrument cluster and HUD."},vag_ambient_color_palette_30:{name:"30-Color Ambient Lighting Palette",desc:"Unlocks 30 RGB interior lighting color picker in MIB infotainment menu."},vag_seatbelt_warning_mute:{name:"Seatbelt Chime Deactivation",desc:"Disables unbuckled seatbelt acoustic chime in instrument cluster."},bmw_alpina_cluster_theme:{name:"Alpina Digital Dash Layout",desc:"Applies blue Alpina signature theme to digital instrument cluster."},bmw_video_in_motion:{name:"Video In Motion",desc:"Unlocks USB video playback on iDrive screen while driving."},bmw_sport_plus_mode_unlock:{name:"Sport+ Driving Mode Enable",desc:"Enables Sport+ high-performance dynamic driving mode in DEC selector."},mercedes_amg_menu_unlock:{name:"AMG Performance Telemetry Menu",desc:"Displays AMG oil temp, transmission temp, lap timer, and G-meter."},mercedes_agility_mode_enable:{name:"Agility Transmission Mode",desc:"Unlocks ultra-responsive Agility shift program in 7G/9G-Tronic transmission."},mercedes_drl_brightness_boost:{name:"Daytime Running Lights 100% Intensity",desc:"Increases LED daytime running lights output to 100% full brightness."},mercedes_alarm_lock_chirp:{name:"Acoustic Locking Horn Chirp",desc:"Emits short horn chirp notification when central locking is engaged."},mercedes_dpf_adblue_gauge:{name:"DPF Soot & AdBlue Level Gauge",desc:"Displays exact DPF soot mass percentage and remaining AdBlue range in IC."},renault_rs_monitor_enable:{name:"Renault Sport RS Monitor Telemetry",desc:"Enables live G-force, turbo boost, and oil temp 