g current limiter to prevent home circuit overload."},toyota_hybrid_ev_mode_override:{name:"Toyota / Lexus EV Mode Throttle Override Suppression",desc:"Prevents gasoline engine from forced start during acceleration when EV mode button is active."},toyota_hybrid_battery_fan_speed_boost:{name:"Toyota / Lexus High-Voltage Battery Cooling Fan Boost",desc:"Increases hybrid traction battery cooling fan speed by +30% to prevent thermal degradation in hot climates."},tesla_sentry_high_bitrate_video:{name:"Tesla Sentry Mode High-Bitrate Continuous Dashcam Recording",desc:"Increases Sentry Mode camera video recording bitrate for crystal-clear license plate visibility."},tesla_cabin_overheat_threshold_30c:{name:"Tesla Cabin Overheat Protection Temperature Threshold",desc:"Lowers cabin overheat protection climate trigger temperature from 40\xb0C to 30\xb0C for interior preservation."},bmwmotorrad_quickshifter_pro_readapt:{name:"Shift Assistant Pro Re-Adaptation",desc:"Resets shift sensor learning parameters and initiates quickshifter recalibration."},bmwmotorrad_esa_zero_point_calib:{name:"Dynamic ESA Suspension Zero-Point Calibration",desc:"Calibrates electronic suspension load and travel sensors to factory zero."},bmwmotorrad_abs_pro_cornering_toggle:{name:"ABS Pro Cornering Mode Intervention Threshold",desc:"Adjusts lean-angle dependent ABS intervention sensitivity for track use."},bmwmotorrad_service_interval_reset:{name:"Annual & Distance Service Reminder Reset",desc:"Resets instrument cluster service indicator and sets custom interval."},bmwmotorrad_headlight_pro_cornering:{name:"Headlight Pro Adaptive Cornering Light Sensitivity",desc:"Adjusts lean angle threshold for adaptive cornering headlight activation."},bmwmotorrad_keyless_ride_range_extend:{name:"Keyless Ride Fob Detection Range Extension",desc:"Optimizes transponder signal range for keyless ignition sensing."},bmwmotorrad_reverse_assist_sensitivity:{name:"Electric Reverse Assist Motor Sensitivity",desc:"Fine-tun