art",desc:"Sweeps central analog tachometer needle to redline on ignition power up."},porsche_sport_exhaust_valve_manual_mode:{name:"PSE Sport Exhaust Flaps Permanently Open",desc:"Keeps dual active exhaust valves 100% open across all RPM ranges when PSE button is active."},porsche_rear_spoiler_manual_speed_threshold:{name:"Active Rear Aerodynamic Wing Deployment Speed",desc:"Adjusts automatic rear spoiler deployment speed threshold."},porsche_matrix_highbeam_unlock:{name:"PDLS+ Matrix LED Adaptive Anti-Glare High Beam",desc:"Enables European-spec variable anti-glare high beam light distribution."},porsche_acoustic_chirp_lock:{name:"Acoustic Siren Beep on Central Lock",desc:"Gives a quick chirp confirmation when locking with Porsche smart key."},actros_rsl_fleet_speed_limit:{name:"Road Speed Limiter",desc:"Configures maximum vehicle road speed limiter calibration for fleet operation policy."},actros_idle_shutdown_timer:{name:"Automatic Engine Idle Shutdown Timer",desc:"Automatically shuts down engine after specified idle time while stationary with parking brake set."},volvo_pto_engine_rpm_preset:{name:"PTO Engine RPM Preset",desc:"Sets predefined constant engine idle speed when PTO is engaged for hydraulic pump and tipper operation."},volvo_ppc_eco_roll_hysteresis:{name:"I-See / PPC Topographical Speed Tolerance",desc:"Adjusts GPS predictive cruise control speed hysteresis tolerance window for maximum rolling fuel economy."},scania_retarder_jake_brake_aggressiveness:{name:"Retarder & Jake Brake Downshift Aggressiveness",desc:"Adjusts retarder torque blending curve and automatic transmission downshifting response under braking."},man_ecas_dock_level_memory:{name:"ECAS Air Suspension Loading Dock Height Memory",desc:"Stores and recalls customized pneumatic air suspension height level presets for loading docks."},daf_stationary_dpf_regen_trigger:{name:"Stationary DPF Forced Soot Regeneration",desc:"Initiates stationary diesel particulate filter thermal soot burn routin