IL Hidup",dtcTitle:"KODE KERUSAKAN",dtcClean:"TIDAK ADA KODE KERUSAKAN \u2014 BERSIH",extraActions:"T\u0130NDAKAN EKSTRA",garageTitle:"GARA\u015e & CATATAN LAMA",share:"BAGIKAN",saveVehicle:"SIMPAN KENDARAAN INI",noRecords:"Belum ada kendaraan yang disimpan.",clean:"BERSIH",faults:"KERUSAKAN",vinRequired:"VIN Diperlukan",vinRequiredDesc:"VIN harus terdeteksi secara otomatis atau dimasukkan secara manual untuk menyimpan catatan.",missingInfo:"Info Kurang",missingInfoDesc:"Silakan isi kolom Merek dan Model.",saved:"Disimpan",savedDesc:"Hasil diagnostik ditambahkan ke garasi.",connRequired:"Koneksi Diperlukan",connRequiredDesc:"Harap hubungkan ke kendaraan terlebih dahulu untuk memulai operasi ini.",chronicFaultsTitle:"Kesalahan Kronis Statistik",chronicFaultsObs:"{{code}} (Observation: {{days}} Unique Days / Total: {{total}} Times)",chronicFaultsPending:"Mengumpulkan Kumpulan Data / Menganalisis Statistik",notScanned:"Tidak Dipindai",notScannedDesc:"Silakan tekan tombol pindai di kanan atas untuk membaca kode diagnostik.",scanFailed:"PEMINDAIAN GAGAL",errTimeout:"Error: Connection Timeout\nECU not responding, connection slow or disconnected.",errConnectionLost:"Error: Connection Lost\nCommunication with the adapter was lost.",errHardwareFatal:"ERROR: HARDWARE CRITICAL LOCK\nRecovery attempts failed. Please unplug and re-insert the adapter.",errUnableToRead:"Error: Read Error\nECU trouble codes could not be read.",scannedSystems:"SISTEM YANG DIPINDAI",moduleEngine:"Unit Kontrol Mesin",moduleAbs:"Sistem Pengereman Anti-lock",moduleTcm:"Modul Kontrol Transmisi",moduleBcm:"Modul Kontrol Tubuh",simSaveBlocked:"Sim Save Blocked",scannedModules:"Scanned Modules"},service:{safetyWarning:"PERINGATAN KESELAMATAN",safetyWarningDesc:"Selama operasi ini: \u2022 Kunci kontak harus ON\n\u2022 Mesin harus MATI\n\u2022 Jangan hidupkan kendaraan Apakah Anda ingin melanjutkan?",step1:"Langkah 1: Hapus Kode Kerusakan",step1Desc:"Semua Kode Kerusakan yang tersimpan dan lampu Check Engine akan dihapus. Nilai trim bahan bakar akan disetel ulang. Tindakan ini tidak dapat dibatalkan!",step2:"Langkah 2: Hard Reset ECU",step2Desc:"Reset listrik akan dikirim ke otak mesin. Berfungsi seperti lepas/pasang aki. Tidak efektif pada ECU yang tidak mendukung. Tidak akan menyebabkan kerusakan.",clearCodes:"Hapus Kode",ecuReset:"Lakukan Reset ECU",finish:"Lewati",completed:"Selesai",completedDesc:"Operasi servis berhasil diselesaikan. Anda dapat menghidupkan kembali kendaraan.",hardResetDesc:"Semua operasi servis berhasil diselesaikan. \u2022 Kode kerusakan dihapus\n\u2022 Trim bahan bakar disetel ulang\n\u2022 ECU direset Anda dapat menghidupkan kembali kendaraan."},info:{desc:"Aplikasi diagnostik sepeda motor dan kendaraan profesional.\nKompatibel dengan t\xfcm kendaraan.",upgrade:"Tingkatkan ke Cortex OBD2 Diagnostic Scanner PRO",upgradeAlert:"Akses Awal",upgradeAlertDesc:"Cortex OBD2 Diagnostic Scanner sedang dalam pengembangan. Sebagai pengguna awal, semua fitur pro terbuka untuk Anda. Umpan balik Anda sangat berharga!",helpGuide:"BANTUAN & PANDUAN",support:"PUSAT DUKUNGAN",supportSubject:"Cortex OBD2 Diagnostic Scanner Dukungan & Umpan Balik",thanks:"Terima Kasih!",thanksDesc:"Terima kasih atas umpan balik Anda. Anda dapat memberi kami ulasan di Play Store.",sections:{live:{title:"SENSOR PEMANTAUAN LANGSUNG",content:"Pantau RPM, Kecepatan, Suhu Mesin, Posisi Gas, Tegangan Aki, Beban Mesin, Suhu Udara Masuk, dan Tekanan Manifold secara real-time. Nilai disegarkan 1-5 kali per detik tergantung pada kecepatan Bluetooth. Anda dapat berinteraksi langsung dengan kendaraan melalui perintah UDS / OBD di terminal."},expertise:{title:"DIAGNOST\u0130K & GARANS\u0130",content:"Aplikasi menggunakan kode ECU untuk mendeteksi kerusakan. VIN dan jarak tempuh yang tercatat diambil. Selain itu, jarak yang ditempuh dengan lampu Check Engine dihitung untuk menentukan kerusakan historis. Laporan dapat dibagikan via PDF atau platform perpesanan."},tests:{title:"TES AKI / PERFORMA",content:"Tes aki terdiri dari 3 tahap: Tes Istirahat, Starter, dan Pengisian Idle untuk mengukur kesehatan aki/regulator. Tes performa mengukur nilai akselerasi 0-60 dan 0-100 km/jam dengan margin kesalahan 50ms menggunakan prosesor ponsel dan data kecepatan langsung kendaraan."},hardware:{title:"KOMPATIBILITAS PERANGKAT KERAS",content:"ELM327 Bluetooth direkomendasikan. Beberapa kode canggih mungkin tidak berfungsi dengan perangkat keras klon v2.1 berkualitas rendah. Dapatkan kecepatan tertinggi dengan adaptor premium seperti vLinker dan OBDLink."},warnings:{title:"PERINGATAN PENTING",content:"\u2022 Kunci kontak harus ON, Mesin harus MATI selama penghapusan kode kerusakan atau Reset ECU.\n\u2022 Jangan kirim Reset ke kendaraan yang sedang berjalan.\n\u2022 Tidak semua kendaraan mungkin mendukung semua sensor, sensor yang tidak didukung menunjukkan \"--\"."},onboarding:{title:"IZIN HUKUM & TELEMETRI ANONIM",content:"Untuk meningkatkan kualitas aplikasi dan kompatibilitas kendaraan, parameter mesin dan kode masalah diagnostik yang sepenuhnya dianonimkan yang diambil selama diagnostik dapat dianalisis di server aman kami. Dengan melanjutkan, Anda menyetujui ketentuan telemetri anonim ini. Izin Bluetooth dan Lokasi diperlukan untuk membuat koneksi dengan ECU sepeda motor Anda."},featureCoding:{title:"BUKA FITUR TERSEMBUNYI & KODE UDS",content:"Didukung oleh Mesin Protokol UDS ISO 14229 kami, beralih dengan aman fitur seperti Lampu Parkir AS, Sapu Jarum, Kunci Horn Ack, Jendela Nyaman, dan pengaturan DRL untuk kendaraan VAG, BMW, Renault, dan Dacia."},multiEcu:{title:"PEMINDAIAN SEMUA MODUL MULTI-ECU",content:"Pindai dan hapus kode kesalahan di luar ECU Mesin \u2014 termasuk ABS, Airbag, Transmisi Otomatis, Cluster Instrumen, Kontrol Iklim, dan Modul Kontrol Tubuh."},advancedDiagnostics:{title:"ADAPTASI DCT, DPF & PENGUKUR DAYA HP",content:"\u2022 Pembelajaran & Adaptasi Reset Titik Ciuman Kopling DCT / DSG\n\u2022 Beban Jelaga DPF & Pemantauan Suhu Regenerasi Knalpot\n\u2022 Pemangkasan Bahan Bakar Jangka Pendek/Panjang & Analisis Lambda secara Real-time\n\u2022 Grafik Telemetri Langsung Tenaga Kuda Dinamis & Torsi."},demoMode:{title:"MODE DEMO",content:"Uji dan jelajahi aplikasi tanpa perangkat keras OBD2 fisik. Rasakan fitur diagnostik CAN-Bus dan UDS lengkap dengan simulasi telemetri real-time yang realistis."}},reconfigurePermissions:"Jalankan Kembali Onboarding & Ketentuan Hukum",language:"Dil / Bahasa / Bahasa",shareWithFriend:"BAGIKAN KE TEMAN",shareMessageText:"Temukan kode kesalahan ECU kendaraan & telemetri sensor langsung dengan Cortex OBD2 Diagnostic Scanner! Unduh Sekarang: iOS: https://apps.apple.com/app/id6764052240 Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.ismail.motocortexv2 Web Portal: https://motocortex-telemetry.vercel.app/"},report:{title:"\u2550\u2550\u2550 LAPORAN DIAGNOSTIK CORTEX OBD2 \u2550\u2550\u2550",vehicleIdentity:"IDENTITAS KENDARAAN",vin:"Nomor Rangka",odometer:"Jarak",milDist:"Jarak MIL",distSinceCleared:"Jarak Sejak Dihapus",dtcCount:"FAULT CODES ({{count}})",sensorData:"DATA SENSOR LANGSUNG",noData:"Data tidak tersedia",proApp:"Dipindai dengan Cortex OBD2 Diagnostic Scanner v7 PRO.",date:"Tanggal",vinNotFound:"Tidak Terdeteksi",noDtcs:"TIDAK ADA KODE KERUSAKAN \u2014 BERSIH",speed:"Kecepatan",coolant:"Suhu Mesin",throttle:"Gas",engineLoad:"Beban Mesin",intakeAir:"Udara Masuk",voltage:"Tegangan Aki",shareMessage:"Pantau kesehatan sepeda motor Anda dari saku dengan Aplikasi Diagnostik OBD2 Cortex OBD2 Diagnostic Scanner! Unduh: https://cortexobd2.app",manifold:"Manifold",subtitle:"Inspeksi Diagnostik & Telemetri Bekas yang Komprehensif",vehicleInfo:"Identifikasi Kendaraan & Metadata ECU",healthScore:"Skor Kesehatan ECU secara keseluruhan",dtcSection:"Kode Masalah Diagnostik",telemetrySection:"Telemetri Langsung & Cuplikan Sensor",maintenanceSection:"Riwayat Servis & Pemeliharaan Ak\u0131ll\u0131 Garaj",aiSection:"Analisis Kondisi Keseluruhan Dokter AI",noFaults:"Tidak ada kode kesalahan aktif atau historis yang disimpan dalam memori ECU.",noMaintenance:"Tidak ada entri layanan yang tercatat di Ak\u0131ll\u0131 Garaj.",disclaimer:"Penafian: Laporan ini dihasilkan oleh perangkat lunak diagnostik MotoCortex. Inspeksi fisik oleh teknisi bersertifikat dianjurkan sebelum pembelian kendaraan.",shareTitle:"Bagikan Laporan Penilaian MotoCortex"},battery:{title:"UJI AKI & STARTER",ready:"Siap untuk memulai pengujian.",restingStatus:"Kontak aktif, mesin mati... Membaca tegangan aki...",crankingStatus:"NYALAKAN MESIN SEKARANG!",chargingStatus:"Mesin stasioner... Membaca tegangan pengisian...",doneStatus:"Pengujian selesai!",voltageError:"Tegangan tidak terbaca. Periksa koneksi.",start:"MULAI UJI",retry:"ULANGI UJI",procedure:"PROSEDUR PENGUJIAN",steps:{1:"1. Kontak aktif, mesin mati \u2192 Tegangan istirahat diukur",2:"2. Nyalakan mesin saat \"NYALAKAN MESIN\" muncul",3:"3. Tegangan terendah saat start dicatat",4:"Mesin hidup \u2192 Tegangan pengisian/regulator diukur"},warning:"Jangan putuskan Bluetooth selama pengujian.",resting:"ISTIRAHAT",cranking:"START",charging:"PENGISIAN",instantV:"TEGANGAN SAAT INI",evaluation:"EVALUASI",verdicts:{full:"Aki: Terisi penuh",good:"Aki: Kondisi baik",weak:"Aki: Mulai lemah",empty:"Aki: Lemah / Habis",crankNormal:"Starter: Penurunan normal",crankLow:"Starter: Tegangan rendah",crankCritical:"Starter: Penurunan kritis",regNormal:"Pengisian: Regulator normal",regLow:"Pengisian: Pengisian rendah",regHigh:"Pengisian: Pengisian berlebih",regFail:"Pengisian: Regulator rusak"},verdictLocked:"Tingkatkan ke PRO untuk melihat laporan penilaian baterai terperinci dan grafik analisis pengengkolan."},freeze:{snapshot:"DATA SAAT KEGAGALAN",desc:"Membaca parameter mesin saat lampu Check Engine menyala. Data ini memberikan info kritis untuk diagnosis.",noDtcs:"Tidak ada kode kerusakan. Data Freeze Frame mungkin tidak tersedia.",read:"BACA FREEZE FRAME",loading:"Menanyakan Mode 02...",noData:"Data freeze frame tidak ditemukan. Kendaraan mungkin tidak mendukung fitur ini.",error:"Kesalahan pembacaan data",values:"NILAI DICATAT SAAT TERJADI KERUSAKAN",retry:"BACA LAGI",techInfo:"INFO TEKNIS",techDesc:"\u2022 OBD-II Mode 02: Freeze Frame Data\n\u2022 PID 020C00: RPM saat kerusakan\n\u2022 PID 020D00: Kecepatan saat kerusakan\n\u2022 PID 020500: Suhu pendingin saat kerusakan Data ini milik kode kerusakan terakhir. Menghapus kode juga akan menghapus data freeze frame.",title:"BINGKAI BEKU",throttle:"Throttle",mapPressure:"Map Pressure",stft:"Stft",trimUnit:"Trim Unit"},perf:{title:"UJI PERFORMA",seconds:"DETIK",speed:"KM/H",idle:"Tekan tombol dan bersiap untuk bergerak.",ready:"SIAP! Mulai berkendara...",readyDesc:"Timer dimulai saat kecepatan > 0.",measuring:"MENGUKUR...",done:"PENGUJIAN SELESAI",start:"MULAI UJI",stop:"BERHENTI",reset:"SETEL ULANG",howItWorks:"CARA KERJA",howDesc:"1. Tekan tombol \"Mulai Uji\"\n2. Kendaraan harus berhenti\n3. Timer dimulai otomatis saat Anda bergerak\n4. Waktu 0-60 km/jam dan 0-100 km/jam dicatat Lakukan pengujian ini di area yang aman!",sec:"detik"},dtc:{P0102:"Sensor Aliran Udara Massa - Masukan Rendah",P0113:"Sensor Suhu Udara Masuk - Tegangan Tinggi",P0171:"Sistem Terlalu Ramping",P0300:"Misfire Silinder Acak/Ganda Terdeteksi",P0420:"Efisiensi Sistem Katalis di Bawah Ambang Batas",P0700:"Sistem Kontrol Transmisi - Kerusakan",P0715:"Sensor Kecepatan Turbin/Input - Kerusakan Sirkuit",P0560:"Tegangan Sistem - Kerusakan",P0562:"Tegangan Sistem - Rendah",U0100:"Komunikasi Hilang Dengan Modul Kontrol Mesin",U0121:"Kehilangan Komunikasi Dengan Modul Anti-Lock Brake System.",C0035:"Kerusakan Sirkuit Sensor Kecepatan Roda Depan Kiri",B0001:"Sirkuit Kontrol Penerapan Tahap Depan Pengemudi",P0750:"Pergeseran Solenoid A Kerusakan",P0814:"Kerusakan Sirkuit Tampilan Jangkauan Transmisi",U0140:"Kehilangan Komunikasi Dengan Modul Kontrol Tubuh",C0040:"Kerusakan Sirkuit Sensor Kecepatan Roda Depan Kanan",C0110:"Kerusakan Rangkaian Motor Pompa ABS",C0121:"Kerusakan Sirkuit Sensor Tekanan Rem",B0010:"Kontrol Penempatan Tahap 1 Depan Penumpang",B0020:"Kontrol Pengebaran Airbag Sisi Kiri",B1000:"Kesalahan Perangkat Keras Modul Kontrol Tubuh.",B1325:"Rangkaian Catu Daya Perangkat Tegangan Rendah",generalFault:"General Fault"},vehicleSelect:{title:"PILIH KENDARAAN ANDA UNTUK AKURASI DIAGNOSIS",subtitle:"Harap berikan detail kendaraan untuk identifikasi kesalahan yang benar dan kecocokan protokol.",brand:"MEREK",selectBrand:"Pilih Merek...",searchBrand:"Cari Merek...",searchLanguage:"Cari Bahasa...",customBrandPlaceholder:"Misal: Triumph, CFMoto, Kia...",model:"MODEL",selectModel:"Pilih Model...",searchModel:"Cari Model...",customModelPlaceholder:"Misal: CBR600, Golf, Focus...",year:"TAHUN MODEL",selectYear:"Pilih Tahun...",customYearPlaceholder:"Misal: 2018",disconnect:"PUTUSKAN",confirm:"LANJUTKAN",errorBrand:"Silakan pilih atau ketik merek.",errorModel:"Silakan pilih atau ketik model.",errorYear:"Silakan pilih atau ketik tahun yang valid.",noResults:"Hasil tidak ditemukan",selectVehiclePrompt:"SILAKAN PILIH KENDARAAN TERLEBIH DAHULU",selectedVehicle:"KENDARAAN TERPILIH",changeVehicle:"UBAH",newVehicle:"Tambah Kendaraan Baru",titleMenu:"Kendaraan & Koneksi",registeredVehiclesLabel:"KENDARAAN TERDAFTAR",viewRegisteredList:"Lihat Kendaraan Terdaftar",registeredVehicles:"KENDARAAN TERDAFTAR SAYA",deleteConfirm:"Apakah Anda yakin ingin menghapus kendaraan ini dari kendaraan terdaftar?",noRegisteredVehicles:"Tidak ada kendaraan terdaftar yang ditemukan.",selectVehicle:"PILIH",mismatchTitle:"Ketidaksesuaian Kendaraan",mismatchDesc:"Produsen kendaraan yang terhubung terdeteksi sebagai \"{{make}}\" dari VIN. Namun, kendaraan yang Anda pilih adalah \"{{selected}}\". Apakah Anda ingin membatalkan pilihan saat ini dan menentukan ulang dengan merek yang benar?",operations:{clearDtc:"Kode Kesalahan Dihapus",fuelAdaptation:"Reset Adaptasi Bahan Bakar",ecuReset:"Reset ECU"},connectionSection:"Koneksi Perangkat OBD",noVehicleTitle:"DETEKSI KENDARAAN DIPERLUKAN",noVehicleDesc:"Identitas kendaraan akan otomatis ditemukan melalui koneksi OBD-II. Silakan pasangkan dan sambungkan ke perangkat Anda di bawah ini.",registeredVehiclesButton:"KENDARAAN TERDAFTAR SAYA",connectDevice:"HUBUNGKAN KE PERANGKAT OBD2"},brands:{audi:"Audi",bajaj:"Bajaj",bmw_car:"BMW",bmw_moto:"BMW",chery:"Chery",cupra:"Cupra",dacia:"Dacia",fiat:"perintah",ford:"mengarungi",hero:"Pahlawan",honda_car:"Honda",honda_moto:"Honda",jeep:"Jip",kia:"Kia",ktm:"KTM",kuba:"Kuba",kymco:"Kymco",lexus:"Lexus",mazda:"Mazda",mg:"MG",opel:"opel",peugeot_car:"Peugeot",peugeot_moto:"Peugeot",rks:"RKS",seat:"Kursi",skoda:"Skoda",suzuki_car:"Suzuki",suzuki_moto:"Suzuki",sym:"Sim",tesla:"Tesla",togg:"Beralih",tvs:"televisi",vespa:"Vespa",volvo:"Volvo",yuki:"Yuki",other:"Lainnya",alfa_romeo:"Alfa Romeo",aprilia:"Aprilia",aston_martin:"Aston Martin",benelli:"Benelli",cfmoto:"CFMoto",chevrolet:"Chevrolet",citroen:"Citro\xebn",ducati:"ducati",harley:"Harley-Davidson",husqvarna:"Husqvarna",hyundai:"Hyundai",indian:"India",kawasaki:"Kawasaki",land_rover:"penjelajah darat",mercedes:"Mercedes-Benz",mitsubishi:"mitsubishi",mondial:"Mondial",mv_agusta:"MV Agusta",nissan:"Nissan",peugeot:"peugeot",porsche:"Porsche",renault:"Renault",subaru:"Subaru",toyota:"Toyota",triumph:"Kemenangan",volkswagen:"Volkswagen",bmw:"bmw/mini",gm:"GM/Chevrolet/GMC",dodge:"Menghindar / RAM / Jip",byd:"BYD EV",stellantis:"Stellantis / Fiat"},permissions:{headerSubtitle:"GERBANG IZIN",cardTitle:"Akses Perangkat Keras Diperlukan",cardDesc:"Untuk meningkatkan kualitas aplikasi dan kompatibilitas kendaraan, parameter mesin dan kode kesalahan yang sepenuhnya dianonimkan yang dikumpulkan selama diagnostik dapat dianalisis di server aman kami. Dengan melanjutkan, Anda menyetujui ketentuan telemetri anonim ini.",btSub:"Digunakan secara eksklusif untuk memasangkan dan mengalirkan metrik langsung CAN-bus/K-Line dari adaptor ELM327/OBD2 Anda.",locLabel:"Lokasi Akurat",locSub:"Diperlukan oleh arsitektur sistem Android untuk menemukan suar Bluetooth berenergi rendah di sekitar. Kami tidak melacak perjalanan Anda.",grantBtn:"IZINKAN & LANJUTKAN",skipBtn:"Lewati untuk sekarang",deniedDesc:"Beberapa izin ditolak. Cortex OBD2 Diagnostic Scanner mungkin tidak dapat memindai atau terhubung ke perangkat OBD2 dengan sukses.",proceedAnyway:"Lanjutkan Saja",openSettings:"Buka Pengaturan",btLabel:"Bluetooth",langTitle:"Pilih Bahasa",nextBtn:"LANJUTKAN",langDesc:"Silakan pilih bahasa yang Anda inginkan untuk menyesuaikan pengalaman diagnosis Anda.",langSelectSub:"GERBANG BAHASA",telemetryLabel:"Telemetri Diagnostik",telemetrySub:"Bagikan protokol anonim dan log kesalahan untuk meningkatkan kompatibilitas kendaraan.",restartOnboarding:"Mulai Ulang Pengaturan Awal"},disclaimer:{subtitle:"Read carefully before writing configuration to vehicle ECU.",p1:"ECU coding and parameter writing directly modifies your vehicle's Electronic Control Unit configuration memory. MotoCortex executes multi-stage journal backups, but failure to comply with safety rules can risk module lockouts.",check1:"I confirm that the vehicle battery is stable (>= 12.4V) and ignition is ON.",check2:"I understand that incorrect coding may require a factory reset and accept all liability.",proceed:"WRITE PARAMETERS"},hiddenFeatures:{title:"FITUR TERSEMBUNYI",btnLabel:"BUKA KUNCI FITUR TERSEMBUNYI",unsupported:"Adaptor OBD2 ini tidak mendukung pembukaan fitur tersembunyi.",unsupportedDesc:"Diperlukan ELM327 asli v2.1 atau lebih tinggi. Adaptor klon tidak didukung.",notConnected:"Harap sambungkan ke kendaraan terlebih dahulu.",notConnectedDesc:"Perangkat OBD2 harus terhubung.",warning:"Perubahan ini dapat mempengaruhi garansi kendaraan Anda.",confirmTitle:"Konfirmasi diperlukan",confirmMsg:"Mengubah fitur ini mempengaruhi pengaturan ECU. Lanjutkan?",confirmOk:"Lanjutkan",confirmCancel:"Batal",categoryLighting:"PENCAHAYAAN",categorySound:"SUARA & PERINGATAN",categoryDisplay:"PANEL INSTRUMEN",categoryDriving:"MENGEMUDI",featureDrl:"Lampu Siang Hari",featureRearFog:"Override Lampu Kabut Belakang",featureDoorChime:"Nonaktifkan Suara Pintu",featureParkingAlert:"Peringatan Suara Rem Tangan",featureRpmWarning:"Peringatan Batas RPM",featureFuelSensitivity:"Sensitivitas Indikator Bahan Bakar",featureStartStop:"Start-Stop Default Nonaktif",featureSportMemory:"Memori Mode Sport",enabled:"AKTIF",disabled:"NONAKTIF",writeSuccess:"Fitur berhasil diperbarui.",writeError:"Kesalahan penulisan. Coba lagi.",simulationBanner:"MODE SIMULASI \u2014 Penulisan ECU nyata belum aktif",closeBtn:"TUTUP",unsupportedOk:"OK",disclaimerTitle:"PENAFIAN TANGGUNG JAWAB",disclaimerFeature:"Fitur",disclaimerBody:"Mengubah fitur ini secara langsung mempengaruhi pengaturan pabrik kendaraan Anda dan perangkat lunak ECU. Harap baca risiko berikut dengan cermat: \u2022 Penerapan yang salah dapat membatalkan garansi kendaraan Anda.\n\u2022 Beberapa perubahan dapat menyebabkan gangguan permanen atau kesalahan listrik yang tidak terduga.\n\u2022 Meskipun pengoperasiannya dapat dibalik, beberapa modul ECU mungkin memerlukan reset pabrik.\n\u2022 Pengguna bertanggung jawab penuh atas segala kerugian materiil atau immateriil akibat penggunaan fitur ini.\n\u2022 Pemindai Diagnostik Cortex OBD2 tidak bertanggung jawab atas kegagalan fungsi atau kerusakan apa pun yang disebabkan oleh perubahan ini. Anda harus mengonfirmasi bahwa Anda telah membaca dan memahami peringatan ini.",checkboxTitle:"DIPERLUKAN KONFIRMASI",check1:"Saya telah membaca peringatan ini dan memahami bahwa garansi kendaraan saya mungkin terpengaruh.",check2:"Saya mengakui bahwa Pemindai Diagnostik Cortex OBD2 tidak bertanggung jawab atas kesalahan atau kerusakan apa pun yang diakibatkan oleh operasi ini.",check3:"Saya ingin melakukan perubahan ini dengan sadar dan atas kemauan saya sendiri, dan menerima segala risiko.",disclaimerCancel:"BATAL",disclaimerContinue:"LANJUTKAN",unsupportedTitle:"Tidak Didukung",unsupportedMsg:"Perangkat OBD2 yang terhubung belum mendukung fitur ini. Adaptor ELM327 v2.1+ yang kompatibel diperlukan untuk penulisan fitur tersembunyi. Adaptor klon atau standar tidak dapat memproses perintah ini."},disconnectShort:"PUTUS",obdTerminal:{title:"KESEHATAN & TERMINAL OBD",terminalTitle:"TERMINALOBD",terminalPlaceholder:"Ketik perintah di bawah ini untuk mengirim ke ECU",inputPlaceholder:"Masukkan perintah...",sendButton:"KIRIM",statsTitle:"STATISTIK KESEHATAN OBD",connectionProtocol:"Protokol Koneksi:",none:"Tidak ada",hardwareQualityScore:"Skor Kualitas Perangkat Keras:",original:"Asli",clone:"Klon",requestResponseCount:"Jumlah Permintaan/Tanggapan:",timeoutCount:"Jumlah Batas Waktu:",recoveryCount:"Jumlah Pemulihan:",diagnosticLogTitle:"LOG DIAGNOSTIK",clearButton:"JELAS",shareButton:"BERBAGI",noLogs:"Tidak ada log diagnostik yang ditemukan.",noShareSupport:"Fitur berbagi tidak tersedia di perangkat ini."},dtcContext:{powertrain:"Kesalahan ini dapat mempengaruhi penghematan bahan bakar dan kinerja mesin. Buka kunci diagnosis lengkap",cooling:"Bahaya pendinginan kritis terdeteksi. Lihat langkah perbaikan terperinci",ignition:"Masalah sistem pengapian terdeteksi. Lihat langkah perbaikan terperinci",chassis:"Peringatan sistem keselamatan sasis. Buka kunci PRO untuk analisis lengkap",body:"Kesalahan elektronik tubuh ditemukan. Tingkatkan versi untuk diagnostik lengkap",network:"Kesalahan jaringan komunikasi. PRO membuka pemecahan masalah penuh",fallback:"Buka analisis kesalahan terperinci, biaya perbaikan & penilaian risiko"},perfTeaser:{limitTitle:"Batas Harian Tercapai",limitDesc:"Anda telah mencapai batas harian 3 tes gratis 0-60 km/jam. Tingkatkan ke PRO untuk pengujian tanpa batas dan pengukuran 0-100 km/jam."},sandbox:{title:"Kontrol Telemetri Kotak Pasir",connectionStatus:"Status Koneksi:",ecuStatus:"Status ECU:",fps:"Performa UI: {{fps}} FPS",stressBtnStart:"Mulai Stres 20Hz",stressBtnStop:"Hentikan Lingkaran Telemetri",stopDisconnect:"Hentikan / Putuskan sambungan",discoveredDevices:"PERANGKAT YANG DITEMUKAN",connect:"HUBUNGKAN",scanning:"Memindai...",scan:"Pindai Perangkat",rpm:"RPM mesin",speed:"Kecepatan Kendaraan",coolant:"Suhu Pendingin",throttle:"Posisi Throttle",notConnected:"Tidak Terhubung",connected:"Terhubung",connecting:"Menghubungkan...",error:"Kesalahan",openSandbox:"DIAG",advancedTerminal:"Terminal Koneksi Tingkat Lanjut",terminalTitle:"Terminal Langsung & Monitor Bus",pause:"JEDA",resume:"LANJUTKAN",share:"BERBAGI",clear:"JELAS",clearDtcs:"HAPUS DTC",dtcTitle:"DIAGNOSTIK DTC & KODE KERUSAKAN",noDtcs:"TIDAK ADA KODE DTC YANG DITEMUKAN DI ECU",readDtcs:"BACA DTC",sendDtcs:"KIRIM"},health:{titleMenu:"KESEHATAN & KEMAMPUAN OBD2",adapterQuality:"KUALITAS & PERFORMA ADAPTOR",excellent:"SANGAT BAIK",good:"BAIK",clone:"TIDAK KOMPATIBEL / KLON",firmware:"Versi Firmware:",capScore:"Skor Kemampuan",latency:"Latensi",protocol:"Protokol Aktif",featureSupport:"MATRIKS FITUR APLIKASI",matrixReadCodes:"Baca & Hapus Kode Kesalahan",matrixLiveSensors:"Pemantauan Sensor Langsung",matrixBattery:"Uji Baterai / Tegangan",matrixHighSpeed:"Telemetri Kecepatan Tinggi",matrixCoding:"Pengodean & Adaptasi ECU",active:"Aktif",degraded:"Terdegradasi",locked:"Dikunci",warning:"KUNCI KEAMANAN:",lockExplain:"Adaptor Anda telah ditandai sebagai chip klon/palsu. Karena adaptor klon kurang presisi waktu dan dapat merusak kendaraan selama operasi penulisan, fitur pengodean dan adaptasi dikunci. Dapatkan perangkat ELM327 v2.1 atau vLinker asli untuk pengodean yang aman.",vehiclePids:"DAFTAR PERIKSA SENSOR KENDARAAN",checklistPrompt:"Parameter sensor standar yang didukung oleh ECU kendaraan Anda tercantum di bawah. Sensor tanpa tanda centang tidak dilaporkan oleh kendaraan Anda.",supportedBadge:"DIDUKUNG",unsupportedBadge:"TIDAK DIDUKUNG",backToExpertise:"BACK TO DIAGNOSTICS",tabHardware:"HARDWARE",tabModes:"MODES",tabTopology:"ECU NETWORK",tabReadiness:"I/M READINESS",tabVehicles:"VEHICLES",chipType:"Detected Chipset:",atCommands:"AT Command Set Benchmark",mode01:"Mode 01: Live Sensor Stream",mode02:"Mode 02: Freeze Frame Snapshot",mode03:"Mode 03 & 07: Fault Codes",mode04:"Mode 04: Clear DTCs & Reset MIL",mode06:"Mode 06: On-Board & Misfire Tests",mode08:"Mode 08: Bi-Directional Actuator Control",mode09:"Mode 09: Vehicle Identity",mode0A:"Mode 0A: Permanent Emission DTCs",modulePcm:"Powertrain / Engine",moduleTcm:"Transmission Control",moduleAbs:"ABS / ESP Brake Control Module",moduleBcm:"Body Control Module",moduleSrs:"Airbag & Safety System",moduleIpc:"Instrument Panel & Gateway",readinessStatus:"I/M Emission & Inspection Readiness",readinessReady:"READY FOR INSPECTION",readinessComplete:"COMPLETE",readinessIncomplete:"INCOMPLETE",monMisfire:"Misfire Monitor",monFuel:"Fuel System Monitor",monComponent:"Comprehensive Components",monCatalyst:"Catalyst Monitor",monEvap:"EVAP System Monitor",monO2:"Oxygen Sensors",monO2Heater:"O2 Sensor Heaters",monEgr:"EGR & VVT Variable Timing",catPassenger:"Passenger & Light Commercial",catMotorcycle:"Motorcycle",catTruck:"Heavy-Duty Commercial & Truck",catEv:"Electric & Hybrid Vehicles"},sensor:{oilTemp:"Suhu Oli Mesin",boost:"Tekanan Peningkatan Turbo",widebandAfr:"Rasio O2 / AFR Pita Lebar",transTemp:"Suhu Transmisi",catalystTemp:"Suhu Katalis",ethanol:"% Bahan Bakar Etanol",timingAdvance:"Waktu Pengapian Maju",baro:"Tekanan Barometrik",rpm:"RPM Mesin",speed:"Kecepatan Kendaraan",coolant:"Suhu Cairan Pendingin",throttle:"Posisi Katup Gas",voltage:"Tegangan Modul Kontrol",maf:"Laju Aliran Udara MAF",iat:"Suhu Udara Masuk",load:"Beban Mesin yang Dihitung",fuel:"Level Bahan Bakar"},secretDebug:{title:"PANEL PENGEMBANGAN MOTO CORTEX",logFileSize:"Kotak Hitam / Ukuran File:",dtcCloudSync:"SINKRONISASI CLOUD DTC",lastSync:"Sinkronisasi Terakhir",syncNow:"Sinkronkan Sekarang",developerTools:"ALAT PENGEMBANG",trialResetSuccess:"Reset penghitung Uji Coba Gratis berhasil!",crashTestTitle:"Tes Kecelakaan",crashTestDesc:"Aplikasi sekarang akan mogok dengan sengaja. Konfirmasikan untuk memverifikasi integrasi Crashlytics.",crashButton:"Kecelakaan",crashTest:"Tes Kecelakaan"},features:{title:"UNLOCK HIDDEN FEATURES & UDS CODING",subTitle:"ISO 14229 UDS Long Coding & Adaptation Engine",batteryVoltage:"BATTERY VOLTAGE",voltageReady:"Safe",voltageLocked:"Low Voltage",locked:"LOCKED",ready:"READY",allMarks:"ALL MARKS",writeBtn:"WRITE",catLighting:"LIGHTING",catSound:"SOUND & ALERTS",catDisplay:"INSTRUMENTS",catComfort:"COMFORT",catSafety:"SAFETY",safetyAlertTitle:"Low Battery Voltage Alert",safetyAlertMsg:"Minimum 12.2V battery voltage required for coding.\nPlease connect a charger or start the engine.",items:{vag_staging_needle_sweep:{name:"Gauge Staging / Needle Sweep",desc:"Sweeps instrument needles to maximum upon ignition start."},vag_acoustic_lock_confirmation:{name:"Acoustic Lock Confirmation Chirp",desc:"Emits a short horn confirmation chirp upon key fob locking."},vag_american_parking_lights:{name:"US Style Parking Lights",desc:"Illuminates front turn signals continuously at 20% dimming with parking lights."},vag_drl_menu_toggle:{name:"Daytime Running Lights Menu Toggle",desc:"Enables DRL ON/OFF checkbox in infotainment vehicle settings menu."},vag_tear_wiping:{name:"Windshield Tear Wiping",desc:"Executes an additional final wipe 5 seconds after windshield washer use."},vag_emergency_brake_flashing:{name:"Emergency Brake Hazard Flashing",desc:"Rapidly flashes brake lights and hazards under heavy emergency braking."},vag_cornering_lights:{name:"Cornering Fog Lights",desc:"Illuminates cornering fog light on steering wheel rotation side."},vag_comfort_mirror_folding:{name:"Key Fob Comfort Mirror Folding",desc:"Automatically folds side mirrors when lock button is held on key fob."},vag_lap_timer:{name:"Instrument Cluster Lap Timer",desc:"Unlocks track lap timer display tab in instrument cluster screen."},vag_refuel_quantity:{name:"Refuel Quantity Display",desc:"Displays exact volume in liters required for a full fuel refuel."},bmw_start_stop_memory:{name:"Auto Start-Stop Memory Mode",desc:"Remembers last Auto Start-Stop state across vehicle restarts."},bmw_digital_speedometer:{name:"Digital Speedometer Display",desc:"Adds instant digital speed numerical display option to cluster screen."},bmw_sport_displays:{name:"Sport Displays",desc:"Enables live horsepower and torque dynamic dials in iDrive screen."},bmw_acoustic_lock_sound:{name:"Acoustic Lock/Unlock Sound",desc:"Emits alarm system chirps when locking or unlocking the vehicle."},bmw_mirror_fold_delay_zero:{name:"Instant Mirror Folding",desc:"Folds side mirrors instantly upon lock button press without holding delay."},bmw_tpms_tire_temperature:{name:"Tire Pressure & Temperature Display",desc:"Displays real-time tire temperature alongside pressure in TPMS screen."},renault_trip_computer_enable:{name:"On-Board Trip Computer Enable",desc:"Unlocks average fuel consumption and range trip computer displays."},renault_external_temp_display:{name:"External Temperature Display",desc:"Enables ambient outdoor temperature reading in instrument cluster."},renault_automatic_tailgate:{name:"Key Fob Trunk Release",desc:"Fully pops trunk latch mechanism upon holding key fob trunk button."},renault_alarm_chirp:{name:"Alarm Lock Confirmation Chirp",desc:"Sounds horn confirmation chirp upon vehicle door locking."},renault_shift_indicator:{name:"Gear Shift Indicator",desc:"Activates eco-driving shift UP/DOWN arrows in instrument cluster."},ford_double_horn_honk_disable:{name:"Disable Double Horn Honk on Door Close",desc:"Disables double horn honk when closing door with engine running."},ford_auto_door_locking:{name:"Auto Door Locking at 20 km/h",desc:"Automatically locks all doors when vehicle speed exceeds 20 km/h."},ford_tpms_psi_display:{name:"Numerical Tire Pressure Display",desc:"Displays exact numerical PSI/BAR pressure per tire in instrument screen."},ford_sync_climate_screen:{name:"SYNC Screen Climate Controls",desc:"Adds climate control and seat heating touchscreen menu to SYNC display."},stellantis_power_windows_remote:{name:"Key Fob Remote Window Roll Up/Down",desc:"Rolls up or down all power windows when holding lock/unlock buttons."},stellantis_cornering_fogs:{name:"Cornering Fog Lights Enable",desc:"Illuminates cornering fog lamp during low-speed turns."},vag_traffic_sign_recognition:{name:"Traffic Sign Recognition",desc:"Displays camera-detected speed signs in instrument cluster and HUD."},vag_ambient_color_palette_30:{name:"30-Color Ambient Lighting Palette",desc:"Unlocks 30 RGB interior lighting color picker in MIB infotainment menu."},vag_seatbelt_warning_mute:{name:"Seatbelt Chime Deactivation",desc:"Disables unbuckled seatbelt acoustic chime in instrument cluster."},bmw_alpina_cluster_theme:{name:"Alpina Digital Dash Layout",desc:"Applies blue Alpina signature theme to digital instrument cluster."},bmw_video_in_motion:{name:"Video In Motion",desc:"Unlocks USB video playback on iDrive screen while driving."},bmw_sport_plus_mode_unlock:{name:"Sport+ Driving Mode Enable",desc:"Enables Sport+ high-performance dynamic driving mode in DEC selector."},mercedes_amg_menu_unlock:{name:"AMG Performance Telemetry Menu",desc:"Displays AMG oil temp, transmission temp, lap timer, and G-meter."},mercedes_agility_mode_enable:{name:"Agility Transmission Mode",desc:"Unlocks ultra-responsive Agility shift program in 7G/9G-Tronic transmission."},mercedes_drl_brightness_boost:{name:"Daytime Running Lights 100% Intensity",desc:"Increases LED daytime running lights output to 100% full brightness."},mercedes_alarm_lock_chirp:{name:"Acoustic Locking Horn Chirp",desc:"Emits short horn chirp notification when central locking is engaged."},mercedes_dpf_adblue_gauge:{name:"DPF Soot & AdBlue Level Gauge",desc:"Displays exact DPF soot mass percentage and remaining AdBlue range in IC."},renault_rs_monitor_enable:{name:"Renault Sport RS Monitor Telemetry",desc:"Enables live G-force, turbo boost, and oil temp telemetry on R-Link."},renault_duster_mirror_fold:{name:"Duster Auto Mirror Folding on Lock",desc:"Folds side mirrors automatically via BCM central locking command."},ford_bambi_mode_fog_light:{name:"Bambi Mode",desc:"Allows fog lights to remain ON when high beam headlights are activated."},ford_st_rs_boot_animation:{name:"ST/RS Performance SYNC Boot Screen",desc:"Changes SYNC touchscreen startup splash animation to ST / RS logo."},toyota_reverse_beep_mute:{name:"Reverse Gear Continuous Cabin Beep Mute",desc:"Mutes continuous reverse gear chime inside cabin to a single beep."},toyota_remote_window_drop:{name:"Key Fob Remote Window Roll Down",desc:"Rolls down all power windows when holding key fob unlock button."},toyota_auto_lock_shift_p:{name:"Auto Lock Doors on Gear Shift",desc:"Automatically locks all doors when shifting out of Park position."},peugeot_icockpit_theme_unlock:{name:"Peugeot 3D i-Cockpit Performance Theme",desc:"Unlocks Copper and Track Red color display themes on 3D digital cluster."},jeep_offroad_pages_enable:{name:"Jeep Uconnect Off-Road Pages",desc:"Enables pitch/roll angle gauges, wheel articulation, and 4x4 lock status."},hyundai_smart_welcome_mirror:{name:"Smart Key Approach Welcome Mirror Unfold",desc:"Automatically unfolds side mirrors when approaching vehicle with smart key."},hyundai_one_touch_turn_7_flashes:{name:"One-Touch Lane Change Signal",desc:"Sets one-touch lane change blinker duration to 7 flashes."},hyundai_svm_camera_speed_extend:{name:"360\xb0 Surround Camera Speed Extension",desc:"Keeps 360-degree parking camera active up to 20 km/h forward speed."},hyundai_n_performance_exhaust_flap:{name:"N-Performance Exhaust Flap Default OPEN",desc:"Sets active exhaust valve default position to OPEN on engine start."},vag_rain_closing_sunroof:{name:"Rain Closing",desc:"Automatically closes sunroof and windows when rain is detected while parked."},bmw_launch_control_unlock:{name:"Launch Control Unlock",desc:"Unlocks factory launch control acceleration program in transmission ECU."},mercedes_ambient_64_multi_zone:{name:"64-Color Multi-Zone Ambient Profile",desc:"Unlocks dynamic multi-zone color cycle animation in MBUX interior lighting."},ford_trailer_brake_activation:{name:"Trailer Brake Controller Enable",desc:"Enables integrated trailer brake controller menu in instrument cluster."},gm_afm_dfm_cylinder_deactivation_disable:{name:"AFM/DFM V8 Cylinder Lock",desc:"Locks engine in 8-cylinder mode permanently to prevent V4 vibration."},gm_remote_start_time_extend:{name:"Remote Start Duration Extension",desc:"Extends factory key fob remote engine start run time from 10 to 20 minutes."},dodge_srt_performance_pages:{name:"SRT Performance Pages & Drive Modes",desc:"Unlocks Uconnect 0-100 acceleration timers, G-force meter, and launch control."},ram_bambi_mode_fog:{name:"RAM Truck Fog Lights with High Beam",desc:"Allows RAM fog lights to remain active alongside high beam headlights."},byd_avas_pedestrian_siren_mute:{name:"AVAS EV Low-Speed Siren Mute",desc:"Mutes low-speed artificial electric motor siren below 30 km/h."},chery_isa_overspeed_chime_mute:{name:"ISA Overspeed Warning Chime Deactivation",desc:"Disables continuous 80/120 km/h overspeed warning beep on Tiggo/MG models."},mg_ev_battery_preconditioning_toggle:{name:"EV Fast-Charge Battery Pre-Heating Manual Switch",desc:"Enables manual battery pre-heating switch before DC fast charging."},chery_dms_fatigue_camera_mute:{name:"Driver Monitoring Camera Sensitivity Reduction",desc:"Reduces over-sensitive eye-tracking fatigue warnings on steering column."},honda_walk_away_auto_lock:{name:"Walk-Away Auto Door Lock",desc:"Automatically locks all doors when driver steps 2 meters away with key fob."},subaru_avh_auto_hold_memory:{name:"Auto Vehicle Hold Memory Mode",desc:"Remembers AVH brake hold ON/OFF state across ignition cycles."},volvo_start_stop_default_off:{name:"Auto Start-Stop Default OFF Mode",desc:"Sets Start-Stop engine shutoff system default state to OFF upon vehicle start."},volvo_polestar_digital_theme:{name:"Polestar Blue Digital Cluster Theme",desc:"Unlocks Polestar signature blue dynamic gauge theme in Volvo driver display."},vag_virtual_cockpit_r_theme:{name:"Virtual Cockpit R / S / Cupra Performance Themes",desc:"Unlocks R-Line, S-Line, and Cupra central tachometer performance themes in digital cockpit."},vag_sound_symposer_mute:{name:"Sound Symposer Fake Engine Noise Deactivation",desc:"Deactivates cabin speaker fake engine sound generator for pure exhaust note."},vag_wireless_carplay_enable:{name:"Wireless Apple CarPlay & Android Auto Activation",desc:"Enables 5GHz Wi-Fi wireless Apple CarPlay and Android Auto on MIB2.5/MIB3 units."},vag_offroad_telemetry_menu:{name:"MIB Offroad Telemetry & Gauge Display",desc:"Displays steering angle, oil temp, coolant temp, and altitude gauges on MIB screen."},vag_easy_entry_driver_seat:{name:"Automatic Easy Entry Power Seat Back-step",desc:"Moves electric driver seat back 5 cm upon door opening for easy vehicle entry."},vag_hba_memory_state:{name:"High-Beam Assist Memory Retention",desc:"Remembers High-Beam Assist ON status across ignition restart cycles."},vag_battery_soc_display:{name:"Battery State of Charge Display",desc:"Shows exact battery charge percentage on instrument cluster when trip button is held."},bmw_idrive7_m_animation:{name:"iDrive 7 / 8 M-Performance Startup Animation",desc:"Changes iDrive screen boot graphic to M-Performance or M-GmbH logo animation."},bmw_bowers_wilkins_audio_profiles:{name:"Bowers & Wilkins 3D Sound Engine Unlock",desc:"Unlocks Bowers & Wilkins Concert, Studio, and Stage DSP audio profiles on HiFi systems."},bmw_hitch_zoom_camera:{name:"Reverse Camera Trailer Hitch Zoom Mode",desc:"Unlocks top-down trailer hitch alignment zoom mode on reverse camera view."},bmw_secure_idle_protection:{name:"Secure Idle Engine Shift-Lock Protection",desc:"Locks transmission in Park if driver leaves running vehicle with key fob."},bmw_seatbelt_handover_mute:{name:"Coupe Electric Seatbelt Handover Arm Deactivation",desc:"Disables motorized seatbelt extender arm on 4 Series and 2 Series Coupes."},bmw_auto_heat_threshold_5c:{name:"Automatic Seat & Steering Wheel Heating Temperature",desc:"Triggers automatic seat and steering wheel heating when ambient temp drops below 5\xb0C."},mercedes_amg_track_pace_unlock:{name:"MBUX AMG Track Pace Telemetry & Lap Timer",desc:"Unlocks lap timing, acceleration telemetry, and G-force graphs on MBUX screen."},mercedes_drive_mode_last_memory:{name:"Dynamic Select Last Drive Mode Memory",desc:"Remembers last selected Drive Mode across vehicle restart."},mercedes_proximity_360_camera_auto:{name:"Proximity Sensor Auto 360\xb0 Camera View",desc:"Automatically switches screen to 360 camera when front sensors detect obstacle < 50 cm."},ford_sync_climate_screen_unlock:{name:"SYNC3 / SYNC4 Touchscreen Climate Control Page",desc:"Enables climate control, heated seat, and airflow direction touchscreen page."},ford_turn_signal_5_flashes:{name:"One-Touch Lane Change Signal",desc:"Increases one-touch lane change turn signal duration from 3 to 5 flashes."},ford_auto_engine_shutdown_disable:{name:"30-Minute Idle Auto Engine Shutdown Override",desc:"Prevents automatic engine shutoff after 30 minutes idle."},ev_battery_preheat_manual_switch:{name:"EV Battery Pre-Heating Manual Switch",desc:"Allows manual battery pre-heating to 25\xb0C before DC fast charging without navigation route."},ev_v2l_power_output_expand:{name:"V2L 220V Outlet Power Expansion",desc:"Expands V2L external 220V AC household power outlet limit from 2.2 kW to 3.6 kW."},ev_one_pedal_regen_force_level3:{name:"One-Pedal Drive Maximum Regenerative Braking Default",desc:"Sets maximum regenerative braking as default on vehicle start."},byd_soc_max_charge_target_limit:{name:"BYD Battery Health Protection Max Charge Limit",desc:"Sets max AC/DC charge cutoff limit to 80% or 90% to extend Blade Battery lifespan."},byd_dmi_forced_pure_ev_speed_override:{name:"BYD DM-i Pure EV Mode Gasoline Engine Override",desc:"Inhibits gasoline engine start in EV mode up to 130 km/h even during full throttle acceleration."},byd_vtol_v2v_rescue_charge_mode:{name:"BYD VTOL Rescue Charge Mode",desc:"Unlocks external AC power output to charge stranded electric vehicles on road."},hyundai_ipedal_memory_lock:{name:"Hyundai / Kia i-PEDAL One-Pedal Drive Memory Lock",desc:"Prevents i-PEDAL one-pedal stop mode from dropping back to Level 3 after shifting to Reverse."},hyundai_utility_mode_12v_saver:{name:"Utility Camping Mode High-Voltage 12V Saver",desc:"Powers 220V V2L outlet directly from HV traction battery to prevent auxiliary 12V battery drain."},hyundai_phev_no_ice_climate_start:{name:"PHEV EV Mode Climate Heating Gasoline Engine Suppression",desc:"Forces heat pump / PTC electric heater for cabin climate without starting gasoline engine."},vag_taycan_ess_sound_profile_swap:{name:"Electric Sport Sound Taycan / RS e-tron Profile",desc:"Changes electric driving sound profile to Porsche Taycan GTS or Audi RS e-tron GT sound generator."},vag_meb_daily_charge_target_menu:{name:"MEB Battery Daily 80% / Trip 100% Quick Charge Bar",desc:"Adds quick toggle bar on MIB screen to switch between 80% daily battery care and 100% trip charge."},vag_gte_generator_charge_reserve:{name:"GTE / E-Mode Engine Generator Battery Force Charge",desc:"Forces combustion engine to act as generator to recharge high-voltage battery up to 80% while driving."},bmw_hans_zimmer_iconic_sounds_m:{name:"Hans Zimmer IconicSounds Electric M-Performance Sound Engine",desc:"Unlocks Hans Zimmer acoustic M-Performance electric acceleration sound profiles on i4 and iX."},bmw_phev_max_edrive_140kmh:{name:"PHEV MAX eDrive Pure Electric Speed Ceiling",desc:"Increases max pure electric speed ceiling on 330e / 530e Plug-in hybrids to 140 km/h."},bmw_ac_charging_current_limit_menu:{name:"AC Home Charger Maximum Current Limit Selector",desc:"Adds AC home charging current limiter to prevent home circuit overload."},toyota_hybrid_ev_mode_override:{name:"Toyota / Lexus EV Mode Throttle Override Suppression",desc:"Prevents gasoline engine from forced start during acceleration when EV mode button is active."},toyota_hybrid_battery_fan_speed_boost:{name:"Toyota / Lexus High-Voltage Battery Cooling Fan Boost",desc:"Increases hybrid traction battery cooling fan speed by +30% to prevent thermal degradation in hot climates."},tesla_sentry_high_bitrate_video:{name:"Tesla Sentry Mode High-Bitrate Continuous Dashcam Recording",desc:"Increases Sentry Mode camera video recording bitrate for crystal-clear license plate visibility."},tesla_cabin_overheat_threshold_30c:{name:"Tesla Cabin Overheat Protection Temperature Threshold",desc:"Lowers cabin overheat protection climate trigger temperature from 40\xb0C to 30\xb0C for interior preservation."},bmwmotorrad_quickshifter_pro_readapt:{name:"Shift Assistant Pro Re-Adaptation",desc:"Resets shift sensor learning parameters and initiates quickshifter recalibration."},bmwmotorrad_esa_zero_point_calib:{name:"Dynamic ESA Suspension Zero-Point Calibration",desc:"Calibrates electronic suspension load and travel sensors to factory zero."},bmwmotorrad_abs_pro_cornering_toggle:{name:"ABS Pro Cornering Mode Intervention Threshold",desc:"Adjusts lean-angle dependent ABS intervention sensitivity for track use."},bmwmotorrad_service_interval_reset:{name:"Annual & Distance Service Reminder Reset",desc:"Resets instrument cluster service indicator and sets custom interval."},bmwmotorrad_headlight_pro_cornering:{name:"Headlight Pro Adaptive Cornering Light Sensitivity",desc:"Adjusts lean angle threshold for adaptive cornering headlight activation."},bmwmotorrad_keyless_ride_range_extend:{name:"Keyless Ride Fob Detection Range Extension",desc:"Optimizes transponder signal range for keyless ignition sensing."},bmwmotorrad_reverse_assist_sensitivity:{name:"Electric Reverse Assist Motor Sensitivity",desc:"Fine-tunes reverse drive electric starter motor speed and torque limit."},ducati_riding_mo