ance, M2, M3, M5, or Alpina."},bmw_tpms_temperature_display:{name:"Tire Pressure & Temperature Live Display",desc:"Adds real-time individual tire temperature readouts alongside tire pressure on iDrive screen."},bmw_rear_drl_scandinavian:{name:"Rear Tail Lights Active with Daytime Running Lights",desc:"Keeps rear LED neon rings illuminated when daytime running lights are active in position 0/Auto."},bmw_sport_automatic_transmission_2tb:{name:"Sport Automatic Transmission & Launch Control",desc:"Unlocks faster shifting times, rev-matching downshifts, and factory Launch Control mode."},merc_needle_sweep_staging:{name:"Instrument Needle Sweep",desc:"Sweeps gauge needles to maximum upon turning on the ignition."},merc_highbeam_memory:{name:"High-Beam Assist State Memory",desc:"Remembers the last active state of Adaptive Highbeam Assist across ignition cycles."},merc_acoustic_lock_chirp:{name:"Acoustic Alarm Lock Chirp",desc:"Emits a short acoustic confirmation beep via alarm siren when vehicle is locked."},merc_amg_cluster_menu_unlock:{name:"AMG Performance Cluster Menu & Oil Temp",desc:"Unlocks AMG performance screen displaying engine oil & gearbox temperature, lap timer, and G-meter."},merc_ambient_lighting_64_colors:{name:"64-Color Dynamic Ambient Lighting Unlock",desc:"Expands ambient lighting color palette from standard colors to 64 multi-color dynamic themes in MBUX."},merc_start_stop_last_state_memory:{name:"ECO Start-Stop Last State Memory",desc:"Remembers ECO Start/Stop button status instead of defaulting to ON on every ignition restart."},merc_auto_mirror_fold_lock:{name:"Automatic Mirror Folding on Key Lock",desc:"Automatically folds side mirrors when locking with key fob and unfolds upon driver door open."},merc_rear_drl_scandinavian:{name:"Rear Tail Lights as Daytime Running Lights",desc:"Keeps rear LED tail lamps illuminated together with front DRLs during daytime driving."},merc_seatbelt_warning_chime_mute:{name:"Seatbelt Acoustic Warning Chime Mute",desc: