ull 7-color ambient lighting palette slider in SYNC touchscreen interface."},ford_lincoln_auto_fold_mirrors:{name:"Lincoln Style Auto-Fold Mirrors on Lock",desc:"Folds power mirrors when locking vehicle and automatically unfolds upon closing driver door."},ford_bambi_mode_fog_with_highbeam:{name:"Bambi Mode",desc:"Prevents fog lights from turning off automatically when high beams are activated."},ford_double_honk_disable:{name:"Disable Double Horn Honk on Keyless Exit",desc:"Disables loud double horn honk when driver exits running vehicle with key fob in pocket."},ford_global_windows_remote_open_close:{name:"Global Window Roll Up & Down via Key Fob",desc:"Opens or closes all power windows by holding unlock or lock button on factory key fob."},ford_cluster_digital_tpms_readout:{name:"Individual Tire Pressure Bar/PSI Display",desc:"Displays exact individual tire pressure numerical readouts on the instrument cluster screen."},ford_sync_boot_splash_st_raptor:{name:"SYNC Performance Boot Splash Theme",desc:"Changes SYNC infotainment boot logo animation to Ford Performance / ST / Raptor styling."},renault_rlink_video_in_motion:{name:"Video in Motion Playback Unlock",desc:"Allows USB/video playback on R-Link 2 / EasyLink touchscreen while vehicle is in motion."},renault_rs_monitor_telemetry_unlock:{name:"RS Monitor Performance Telemetry App",desc:"Enables Renault Sport Monitor app displaying live turbo boost, torque, oil temp, and G-force meters."},renault_acoustic_lock_chirp:{name:"Acoustic Horn Chirp on Hands-Free Walkaway Lock",desc:"Emits a brief beep when vehicle automatically locks upon walking away with key card."},renault_rear_scandinavian_drl:{name:"Scandinavian Daytime Running Tail Lights",desc:"Keeps rear 3D LED signature tail lamps active simultaneously with front DRL strips."},renault_cornering_fog_lamps:{name:"Static Cornering Fog Light Illumination",desc:"Lights up the relevant front fog light during turning maneuvers below 40 km/h."},renault_seatbelt_buzzer_mute:{name:"Seatbelt Warning Buzzer Sound Mute",desc:"Mutes acoustic beeping for unfastened seatbelts."},hyundai_ev_charge_limit_ui_unlock:{name:"Manual EV AC/DC Charge Limit Setting UI",desc:"Unlocks 50% to 100% target SoC slider controls in infotainment for battery longevity."},hyundai_isg_start_stop_memory:{name:"ISG Last State Memory",desc:"Retains the last selected state of the Start-Stop button across vehicle restarts."},hyundai_approach_auto_unlock_distance:{name:"Smart Key Approach Auto-Unlock Sensitivity",desc:"Adjusts proximity radar detection sensitivity for automatic welcome door unlocking."},hyundai_lead_vehicle_departure_alert:{name:"Lead Vehicle Departure Notification Sensitivity",desc:"Enhances front camera sensitivity when alerting that the front vehicle has started moving in traffic."},hyundai_welcome_escort_lighting_timer:{name:"Headlamp Escort / Follow-Me-Home Delay Timer",desc:"Extends headlamp illumination duration from 15s to 30s or 60s after locking vehicle."},byd_battery_preconditioning_manual_toggle:{name:"Blade Battery Manual Pre-Heating / Pre-Conditioning",desc:"Enables manual battery thermal pre-heating before DC fast charging in cold weather."},byd_vess_pedestrian_sound_customization:{name:"VESS Low-Speed Pedestrian Acoustic Warning Themes",desc:"Unlocks alternative synthesized engine / futuristic tone profiles for low-speed pedestrian alert."},byd_ambient_sound_rhythm_sync:{name:"Music Rhythm Pulse Ambient Lighting Sync",desc:"Synchronizes cabin ambient LED brightness and color shifting with music bass rhythm."},chery_auto_window_rain_close:{name:"Automatic Window & Sunroof Rain Closing",desc:"Closes all open windows and panoramic sunroof when rain sensor detects rainfall while parked."},mg_ev_one_pedal_drive_memory:{name:"One-Pedal Driving Mode Retention",desc:"Remembers the last selected regenerative braking intensity across starts."},porsche_needle_sweep_staging:{name:"Porsche Tachometer Needle Sweep on Start",desc:"Sweeps central 