imer & Turbo Bar Pressure Gauge Overlay",desc:"Displays track lap timer and real-time turbo boost gauge on Virtual Cockpit."},audi_needle_sweep_gauge:{name:"Sport Gauge Needle Sweep Verification",desc:"Performs full tachometer and speedometer needle sweep test on start."},skoda_coming_home_lights:{name:"Leaving Home / Coming Home Lighting Timer",desc:"Configures headlight illumination timer after vehicle exit."},skoda_comfort_turn_signal:{name:"Comfort Indicator Pulse Count Adjustment",desc:"Sets one-touch turn signal blink count between 3 and 5 flashes."},cupra_sport_display_menu:{name:"Cupra Performance Instrument & G-Meter Menu",desc:"Unlocks G-force meter, kW power gauge, and oil temp display."},cupra_virtual_cockpit_copper:{name:"Copper Theme Dashboard Accent Graphics",desc:"Applies signature Cupra copper metallic accent theme to gauge cluster."},vag_brake_disc_drying:{name:"Brake Disc Wiping / Drying Function in Rain",desc:"Periodically applies minimal pad pressure in wet weather to dry rotors."},vag_tourist_mode_lights:{name:"Tourist Mode Headlight Beam Pattern",desc:"Switches headlight beam pattern between LHD and RHD for driving abroad."},vag_hood_warning_mute:{name:"Bonnet Open Instrument Chime Mute",desc:"Suppresses persistent instrument warning chime when hood is unlatched."},vag_emergency_brake_hazard:{name:"Emergency Braking Automatic Hazard Flasher",desc:"Flashes hazard lights rapidly during hard ABS emergency stops."},vag_sunroof_comfort_open:{name:"Sunroof Tilt / Open Remote Comfort Key Fob Logic",desc:"Configures remote key hold action to either tilt or fully open sunroof."},bmw_ecopro_display_variant:{name:"ECO PRO Instrument Cluster Gauge Styling",desc:"Customizes blue ECO PRO efficiency gauge graphic theme."},bmw_volume_bar_hud:{name:"Head-Up Display Audio Volume Level Bar Overlay",desc:"Shows volume change bar directly on HUD projection."},bmw_anti_dazzle_mirror:{name:"Electrochromic Anti-Dazzle Mirror Dimming Sensitivity",desc:"Adjusts automatic rearview mirror dimming photo-sensor threshold."},bmw_camera_pdc_warning_mute:{name:"PDC & Surround View Speed Cut-off Speed Adjustment",desc:"Adjusts vehicle speed threshold at which parking cameras turn off."},toyota_pcs_distance_preset:{name:"Pre-Collision System Default Alert Distance",desc:"Sets initial radar forward collision warning distance sensitivity."},toyota_bsm_timing:{name:"Blind Spot Monitor Warning Warning Timing",desc:"Adjusts blind spot side mirror warning light illumination timing."},toyota_ac_noise_reduction:{name:"A/C Compressor Blower Noise Reduction Mode",desc:"Limits maximum air conditioning blower fan speed for cabin quietness."},toyota_sflow_control:{name:"S-Flow Smart Climate Single-Occupant Mode",desc:"Directs A/C airflow exclusively to occupied seats based on weight sensors."},toyota_relock_timeout:{name:"Automatic Re-Lock Delay Timer after Remote Unlock",desc:"Adjusts seconds before doors auto-relock if no door is opened."},lexus_mark_levinson_audio_profile:{name:"Mark Levinson Surround Sound DSP Audio Profile",desc:"Optimizes 3D spatial acoustic tuning for Mark Levinson premium speakers."},lexus_ev_mode_beeper_mute:{name:"Low-Speed Pedestrian EV Acoustic Alert Beeper Mute",desc:"Suppresses low speed electric mode synthetic exterior chime."},lexus_easy_access_seat:{name:"Easy Access Steering Wheel & Power Seat Slide-Back",desc:"Slides driver seat back and tilts steering wheel away for easy entry/exit."},nissan_epower_regen_mode:{name:"e-POWER One-Pedal Regenerative Braking Mode",desc:"Sets default e-Pedal regenerative braking deceleration level."},nissan_propilot_assist_timing:{name:"ProPILOT Lane Centering Assist Steering Sensitivity",desc:"Configures ProPILOT steering intervention sharpness."},nissan_intelligent_around_view:{name:"Around View Monitor Auto-Pop-Up at Low Speed",desc:"Triggers 360-degree camera display when front parking sensors detect obstacles."},mazda_g_vectoring_display:{name:"G-Vectoring Control Plus Dynamic Visualizer",desc:"Displays real-time GVC+ cornering torque vectoring graph on instrument panel."},mazda_ieloop_capacitor_monitor:{name:"i-ELOOP Brake Energy Recovery Capacitor Meter",desc:"Shows electric capacitor charge & discharge status on central screen."},mazda_smart_city_brake_sens:{name:"Smart City Brake Support Sensitivity",desc:"Sets low-speed automatic emergency braking sensor range."},subaru_eyesight_distance_preset:{name:"EyeSight Adaptive Cruise Control Default Distance",desc:"Configures stereo camera default cruise gap profile on startup."},subaru_xmode_auto_engage:{name:"X-Mode Off-Road Traction Auto-Engage Threshold",desc:"Sets wheel slip threshold for automatic dual-function X-Mode activation."},subaru_steering_responsive_headlights:{name:"Steering Responsive Headlights Toggle",desc:"Enables or disables directional adaptive headlight swivel."},genesis_sport_plus_mode:{name:"Sport+ Powertrain & Electronic Suspension Mode",desc:"Unlocks track-oriented ESC OFF and stiffened damper mapping."},genesis_ambient_active_light:{name:"Active Ambient Lighting Drive Mode Sync",desc:"Changes interior ambient lighting color dynamically based on drive mode."},volvo_city_safety_warning:{name:"City Safety Autonomous Emergency Warning Sensitivity",desc:"Configures radar and lidar collision warning alert timing."},chery_ar_navigation_hud:{name:"AR Navigation Projection Overlay on HUD",desc:"Projects 3D augmented reality navigation arrows onto windshield."},jlr_terrain_response_preset:{name:"Terrain Response Auto Off-Road Mode Preset",desc:"Remembers last Terrain Response surface profile."},jlr_adaptive_dynamics_firm:{name:"Adaptive Dynamics Damper Firmness Profile",desc:"Sets default electronic shock absorber damping stiffness."},jlr_wading_sensor_alert:{name:"Wade Sensing Depth Warning Chime Threshold",desc:"Configures ultrasonic water depth warning chime sensitivity."},alfa_dna_dynamic_memory:{name:"Alfa DNA Selector Dynamic Mode Startup Memory",desc:"Retains Dynamic mode throttle response after restart."},alfa_q4_torque_split:{name:"Q4 All-Wheel Drive Real-Time Torque Split Graph",desc:"Shows AWD front/rear power split percentage on instrument display."},li_auto_range_extender_mode:{name:"REV Generator Battery Charge Retention Level",desc:"Adjusts internal combustion engine generator start threshold."},li_auto_cinema_seat_position:{name:"Theater / Cinema Mode Ergonomic Seat Position",desc:"Reclines rear seats and unfolds leg rests when cinema mode is active."},zeekr_drift_mode_torque:{name:"Dual Motor Performance Drift Mode Rear Bias",desc:"Sends 100% torque to rear electric motor for controlled drifting."},zeekr_ambient_beat_sync:{name:"Ambient Lighting Music Rhythm Beat Sync",desc:"Pulsates interior cabin lighting in sync with played music beats."},tata_drive_mode_voice:{name:"Drive Mode Switch Voice Announcement",desc:"Enables audio voice confirmation when switching drive modes."},mahindra_zip_zap_zoom_custom:{name:"Zip/Zap/Zoom Powertrain Throttle Response Profile",desc:"Customizes acceleration curve for Zip, Zap, and Zoom driving modes."},fun_cyberpunk_cluster_theme:{name:"Cyberpunk 2077 Neon Graphic Cockpit Theme",desc:"Applies futuristic neon cyan & amber digital dashboard gauge styling."},fun_exhaust_flame_sound_effect:{name:"Stereo System Pop & Bang Exhaust Sound FX",desc:"Plays realistic V8 exhaust pop & bang audio effects through cabin speakers."},fun_matrix_light_show_welcome:{name:"Custom Headlight Matrix LED Dance Welcome",desc:"Plays rhythmic Light Show choreography using headlights & indicators."},fun_stealth_fighter_display:{name:"Stealth Fighter Night Driving Minimalist Cluster Mode",desc:"Turns off all cluster lights except speedometer for pitch-black night driving."},vag_lap_timer_oil_temp:{name:"Lap Timer & Oil Temperature in Gauge Cluster",desc:"Unlocks racetrack lap timer stopwatch and real-time engine oil temperature readout."},vag_rear_scandinavian_drl:{name:"Scandinavian DRL",desc:"Illuminates rear LED tail lights constantly when front daytime running lights are active."},vag_drl_handbrake_off:{name:"Turn OFF DRL when Handbrake is Engaged",desc:"Automatically turns off daytime running lights whenever parking brake is pulled up."},vag_drl_menu_in_mib:{name:"DRL ON/OFF Toggle Switch in Touchscreen Menu",desc:"Adds Daytime Running Lights toggle checkbox under Vehicle Lights settings in MIB screen."},vag_rain_closing_windows:{name:"Rain Closing",desc:"Closes all open windows and panoramic sunroof if parked vehicle detects rain on windshield."},vag_audi_dynamic_throttle:{name:"Audi Linear Direct Throttle Response",desc:"Removes electronic pedal lag by switching from time-gradient to direct linear throttle mapping."},vag_xds_differential_sensitivity:{name:"XDS Electronic Differential Lock Sensitivity",desc:"Increases cornering traction and reduces understeer by applying higher inner-wheel brake torque."},vag_offroad_display_mib:{name:"Off-Road Display & Compass in Infotainment",desc:"Unlocks Off-Road telemetry screen displaying steering angle, compass, and oil/coolant temperatures."},vag_highbeam_assist_memory:{name:"High-Beam Assist State Memory",desc:"Maintains Auto High-Beam Assist active across ignition cycles so driver does not have to re-arm it."},vag_comfort_turn_signals_count:{name:"Comfort Turn Signal Flash Cycles",desc:"Changes number of highway lane-change blinker pulses from standard 3 to 4 or 5."},bmw_video_in_motion_speedlock:{name:"Video in Motion Speedlock Removal",desc:"Allows USB and DVD video playback on iDrive screen while vehicle is moving."},bmw_digital_speedo_kombi:{name:"Digital Speedometer in Instrument Cluster",desc:"Adds real-time digital speed numerical readout on the onboard computer screen."},bmw_acoustic_lock_chirp:{name:"Acoustic Alarm Chirp on Lock / Unlock",desc:"Adds acoustic confirmation chirp via alarm siren with volume setting in iDrive menu."},bmw_auto_mirror_fold_comfort_close:{name:"Fold Mirrors Instantly with 1-Click Lock",desc:"Eliminates the 1.5s delay requirement for folding mirrors when pressing key lock."},bmw_rolls_royce_warning_chimes:{name:"Rolls-Royce / BMW i / MINI Warning Chime Tones",desc:"Changes the system warning chimes to luxury Rolls-Royce tones."},bmw_m_performance_boot_animation:{name:"M Performance / Alpina Cluster Boot Logo",desc:"Sets startup logo on digital instrument cluster to M Performance, M2, M3, M5, or Alpina."},bmw_tpms_temperature_display:{name:"Tire Pressure & Temperature Live Display",desc:"Adds real-time individual tire temperature readouts alongside tire pressure on iDrive screen."},bmw_rear_drl_scandinavian:{name:"Rear Tail Lights Active with Daytime Running Lights",desc:"Keeps rear LED neon rings illuminated when daytime running lights are active in position 0/Auto."},bmw_sport_automatic_transmission_2tb:{name:"Sport Automatic Transmission & Launch Control",desc:"Unlocks faster shifting times, rev-matching downshifts, and factory Launch Control mode."},merc_needle_sweep_staging:{name:"Instrument Needle Sweep",desc:"Sweeps gauge needles to maximum upon turning on the ignition."},merc_highbeam_memory:{name:"High-Beam Assist State Memory",desc:"Remembers the last active state of Adaptive Highbeam Assist across ignition cycles."},merc_acoustic_lock_chirp:{name:"Acoustic Alarm Lock Chirp",desc:"Emits a short acoustic confirmation beep via alarm siren when vehicle is locked."},merc_amg_cluster_menu_unlock:{name:"AMG Performance Cluster Menu & Oil Temp",desc:"Unlocks AMG performance screen displaying engine oil & gearbox temperature, lap timer, and G-meter."},merc_ambient_lighting_64_colors:{name:"64-Color Dynamic Ambient Lighting Unlock",desc:"Expands ambient lighting color palette from standard colors to 64 multi-color dynamic themes in MBUX."},merc_start_stop_last_state_memory:{name:"ECO Start-Stop Last State Memory",desc:"Remembers ECO Start/Stop button status instead of defaulting to ON on every ignition restart."},merc_auto_mirror_fold_lock:{name:"Automatic Mirror Folding on Key Lock",desc:"Automatically folds side mirrors when locking with key fob and unfolds upon driver door open."},merc_rear_drl_scandinavian:{name:"Rear Tail Lights as Daytime Running Lights",desc:"Keeps rear LED tail lamps illuminated together with front DRLs during daytime driving."},merc_seatbelt_warning_chime_mute:{name:"Seatbelt Acoustic Warning Chime Mute",desc:"Disables the continuous chime sound for unbuckled seatbelts."},merc_agility_manual_mode_unlock:{name:"Agility & Manual Transmission Mode",desc:"Enables hidden Agility and True Manual driving transmission profiles in Dynamic Select."},merc_esp_sport_threshold_tuning:{name:"ESP Sport Dynamic Slip Angle Adjustment",desc:"Allows increased wheel slip angle before ESP torque intervention for track driving."},merc_flashing_emergency_brake_light:{name:"Adaptive Emergency Flashing Brake Lights",desc:"Flashes stop lamps at high frequency during hard emergency braking."},stell_auto_mirror_fold_lock:{name:"Automatic Mirror Folding on Key Lock",desc:"Folds side mirrors automatically upon pressing lock button on key fob."},stell_cornering_fog_lights:{name:"Cornering Fog Light Illumination",desc:"Activates corresponding front fog lamp when turn signal is on or steering angle > 30\xb0 below 40 km/h."},stell_needle_sweep_cluster:{name:"Instrument Needle Sweep",desc:"Performs gauge sweep on startup for analog/hybrid instrument clusters."},stell_acoustic_lock_chirp:{name:"Acoustic Horn Chirp on Remote Lock",desc:"Gives a short horn tap confirmation when vehicle doors successfully lock."},stell_rear_scandinavian_drl:{name:"Rear Scandinavian DRL Tail Lights",desc:"Illuminates rear tail lamps in conjunction with daytime running lights in Auto/0 mode."},stell_lane_assist_memory_default:{name:"Lane Keeping Assist Last State Memory",desc:"Remembers the last ON/OFF state of Lane Keeping Assist instead of re-activating at every start."},stell_sport_steering_weight_calibration:{name:"Dynamic Electric Power Steering Weight Curve",desc:"Increases steering wheel resistance and centering feel for a firmer, sportier feedback."},stell_digital_speedo_unit_toggle:{name:"Digital Speedometer km/h & mph Dual Display",desc:"Shows numeric speed readout in both km/h and mph simultaneously in the center LCD."},ford_apim_ambient_multi_colors:{name:"SYNC 3/4 Multi-Color Ambient Lighting Theme",desc:"Unlocks full 7-color ambient lighting palette slider in SYNC touchscreen interface."},ford_lincoln_auto_fold_mirrors:{name:"Lincoln Style Auto-Fold Mirrors on Lock",desc:"Folds power mirrors when locking vehicle and automatically unfolds upon closing driver door."},ford_bambi_mode_fog_with_highbeam:{name:"Bambi Mode",desc:"Prevents fog lights from turning off automatically when high beams are activated."},ford_double_honk_disable:{name:"Disable Double Horn Honk on Keyless Exit",desc:"Disables loud double horn honk when driver exits running vehicle with key fob in pocket."},ford_global_windows_remote_open_close:{name:"Global Window Roll Up & Down via Key Fob",desc:"Opens or closes all power windows by holding unlock or lock button on factory key fob."},ford_cluster_digital_tpms_readout:{name:"Individual Tire Pressure Bar/PSI Display",desc:"Displays exact individual tire pressure numerical readouts on the instrument cluster screen."},ford_sync_boot_splash_st_raptor:{name:"SYNC Performance Boot Splash Theme",desc:"Changes SYNC infotainment boot logo animation to Ford Performance / ST / Raptor styling."},renault_rlink_video_in_motion:{name:"Video in Motion Playback Unlock",desc:"Allows USB/video playback on R-Link 2 / EasyLink touchscreen while vehicle is in motion."},renault_rs_monitor_telemetry_unlock:{name:"RS Monitor Performance Telemetry App",desc:"Enables Renault Sport Monitor app displaying live turbo boost, torque, oil temp, and G-force meters."},renault_acoustic_lock_chirp:{name:"Acoustic Horn Chirp on Hands-Free Walkaway Lock",desc:"Emits a brief beep when vehicle automatically locks upon walking away with key card."},renault_rear_scandinavian_drl:{name:"Scandinavian Daytime Running Tail Lights",desc:"Keeps rear 3D LED signature tail lamps active simultaneously with front DRL strips."},renault_cornering_fog_lamps:{name:"Static Cornering Fog Light Illumination",desc:"Lights up the relevant front fog light during turning maneuvers below 40 km/h."},renault_seatbelt_buzzer_mute:{name:"Seatbelt Warning Buzzer Sound Mute",desc:"Mutes acoustic beeping for unfastened seatbelts."},hyundai_ev_charge_limit_ui_unlock:{name:"Manual EV AC/DC Charge Limit Setting UI",desc:"Unlocks 50% to 100% target SoC slider controls in infotainment for battery longevity."},hyundai_isg_start_stop_memory:{name:"ISG Last State Memory",desc:"Retains the last selected state of the Start-Stop button across vehicle restarts."},hyundai_approach_auto_unlock_distance:{name:"Smart Key Approach Auto-Unlock Sensitivity",desc:"Adjusts proximity radar detection sensitivity for automatic welcome door unlocking."},hyundai_lead_vehicle_departure_alert:{name:"Lead Vehicle Departure Notification Sensitivity",desc:"Enhances front camera sensitivity when alerting that the front vehicle has started moving in traffic."},hyundai_welcome_escort_lighting_timer:{name:"Headlamp Escort / Follow-Me-Home Delay Timer",desc:"Extends headlamp illumination duration from 15s to 30s or 60s after locking vehicle."},byd_battery_preconditioning_manual_toggle:{name:"Blade Battery Manual Pre-Heating / Pre-Conditioning",desc:"Enables manual battery thermal pre-heating before DC fast charging in cold weather."},byd_vess_pedestrian_sound_customization:{name:"VESS Low-Speed Pedestrian Acoustic Warning Themes",desc:"Unlocks alternative synthesized engine / futuristic tone profiles for low-speed pedestrian alert."},byd_ambient_sound_rhythm_sync:{name:"Music Rhythm Pulse Ambient Lighting Sync",desc:"Synchronizes cabin ambient LED brightness and color shifting with music bass rhythm."},chery_auto_window_rain_close:{name:"Automa