dividual tire pressure numerical readouts on the instrument cluster screen."},ford_sync_boot_splash_st_raptor:{name:"SYNC Performance Boot Splash Theme",desc:"Changes SYNC infotainment boot logo animation to Ford Performance / ST / Raptor styling."},renault_rlink_video_in_motion:{name:"Video in Motion Playback Unlock",desc:"Allows USB/video playback on R-Link 2 / EasyLink touchscreen while vehicle is in motion."},renault_rs_monitor_telemetry_unlock:{name:"RS Monitor Performance Telemetry App",desc:"Enables Renault Sport Monitor app displaying live turbo boost, torque, oil temp, and G-force meters."},renault_acoustic_lock_chirp:{name:"Acoustic Horn Chirp on Hands-Free Walkaway Lock",desc:"Emits a brief beep when vehicle automatically locks upon walking away with key card."},renault_rear_scandinavian_drl:{name:"Scandinavian Daytime Running Tail Lights",desc:"Keeps rear 3D LED signature tail lamps active simultaneously with front DRL strips."},renault_cornering_fog_lamps:{name:"Static Cornering Fog Light Illumination",desc:"Lights up the relevant front fog light during turning maneuvers below 40 km/h."},renault_seatbelt_buzzer_mute:{name:"Seatbelt Warning Buzzer Sound Mute",desc:"Mutes acoustic beeping for unfastened seatbelts."},hyundai_ev_charge_limit_ui_unlock:{name:"Manual EV AC/DC Charge Limit Setting UI",desc:"Unlocks 50% to 100% target SoC slider controls in infotainment for battery longevity."},hyundai_isg_start_stop_memory:{name:"ISG Last State Memory",desc:"Retains the last selected state of the Start-Stop button across vehicle restarts."},hyundai_approach_auto_unlock_distance:{name:"Smart Key Approach Auto-Unlock Sensitivity",desc:"Adjusts proximity radar detection sensitivity for automatic welcome door unlocking."},hyundai_lead_vehicle_departure_alert:{name:"Lead Vehicle Departure Notification Sensitivity",desc:"Enhances front camera sensitivity when alerting that the front vehicle has started moving in traffic."},hyundai_welcome_escort_lighting_timer:{name