ated Windshield Element Coding",desc:"Enables windshield defrost heater relay output and climatronic screen button."},retrofit_wireless_charger_module_coding:{name:"Retrofit Qi Wireless Smartphone Charging Pad Integration",desc:"Enables wireless charger status LED and phone left behind reminder popup."},retrofit_acc_radar_module_coding:{name:"Retrofit Adaptive Cruise Control Front Radar Module",desc:"Encodes retrofitted front distance radar unit into CAN bus vehicle network."},retrofit_traffic_sign_camera_activation:{name:"Retrofit Traffic Sign Recognition Windshield Camera Coding",desc:"Enables VZE sign recognition processing on retrofitted windshield camera."},retrofit_heated_steering_wheel_coding:{name:"Retrofit Heated Steering Wheel Module Activation",desc:"Enables steering wheel heating element output and auto-on temperature triggers."},retrofit_fatigue_camera_calibration:{name:"Retrofit Driver Fatigue Monitoring Camera Integration",desc:"Calibrates driver monitoring infrared camera sensor after steering column install."},retrofit_trailer_hitch_module_coding:{name:"Retrofit Tow Bar & Trailer Electrical Module Integration",desc:"Encodes trailer module into ESP stability system for trailer sway mitigation."},retrofit_power_tailgate_trunk_kit_coding:{name:"Retrofit Power Tailgate & Foot Gesture Sensor Integration",desc:"Enables electric trunk drive motors and bumper kick sensor coding."},easteregg_urban_joke_light_show:{name:"Urban Joke Alternating Rear Light Show",desc:"Configures tail lights and turn signals to flash alternately when locking vehicle."},easteregg_custom_boot_greeting_text:{name:"Custom Boot Greeting Text on Digital Cluster",desc:"Displays custom welcome message on instrument cluster screen upon ignition on."},easteregg_cluster_mini_game_mode:{name:"Instrument Cluster Hidden Mini-Game Menu",desc:"Unlocks steering-wheel button controlled retro mini-game on display when parked."},easteregg_custom_horn_melody_package:{name:"Custom Acoustic Horn Welco