el slip threshold for automatic dual-function X-Mode activation."},subaru_steering_responsive_headlights:{name:"Steering Responsive Headlights Toggle",desc:"Enables or disables directional adaptive headlight swivel."},genesis_sport_plus_mode:{name:"Sport+ Powertrain & Electronic Suspension Mode",desc:"Unlocks track-oriented ESC OFF and stiffened damper mapping."},genesis_ambient_active_light:{name:"Active Ambient Lighting Drive Mode Sync",desc:"Changes interior ambient lighting color dynamically based on drive mode."},volvo_city_safety_warning:{name:"City Safety Autonomous Emergency Warning Sensitivity",desc:"Configures radar and lidar collision warning alert timing."},chery_ar_navigation_hud:{name:"AR Navigation Projection Overlay on HUD",desc:"Projects 3D augmented reality navigation arrows onto windshield."},jlr_terrain_response_preset:{name:"Terrain Response Auto Off-Road Mode Preset",desc:"Remembers last Terrain Response surface profile."},jlr_adaptive_dynamics_firm:{name:"Adaptive Dynamics Damper Firmness Profile",desc:"Sets default electronic shock absorber damping stiffness."},jlr_wading_sensor_alert:{name:"Wade Sensing Depth Warning Chime Threshold",desc:"Configures ultrasonic water depth warning chime sensitivity."},alfa_dna_dynamic_memory:{name:"Alfa DNA Selector Dynamic Mode Startup Memory",desc:"Retains Dynamic mode throttle response after restart."},alfa_q4_torque_split:{name:"Q4 All-Wheel Drive Real-Time Torque Split Graph",desc:"Shows AWD front/rear power split percentage on instrument display."},li_auto_range_extender_mode:{name:"REV Generator Battery Charge Retention Level",desc:"Adjusts internal combustion engine generator start threshold."},li_auto_cinema_seat_position:{name:"Theater / Cinema Mode Ergonomic Seat Position",desc:"Reclines rear seats and unfolds leg rests when cinema mode is active."},zeekr_drift_mode_torque:{name:"Dual Motor Performance Drift Mode Rear Bias",desc:"Sends 100% torque to rear electric motor for controlled drifting."},