rs High-Beam Assist ON status across ignition restart cycles."},vag_battery_soc_display:{name:"Battery State of Charge Display",desc:"Shows exact battery charge percentage on instrument cluster when trip button is held."},bmw_idrive7_m_animation:{name:"iDrive 7 / 8 M-Performance Startup Animation",desc:"Changes iDrive screen boot graphic to M-Performance or M-GmbH logo animation."},bmw_bowers_wilkins_audio_profiles:{name:"Bowers & Wilkins 3D Sound Engine Unlock",desc:"Unlocks Bowers & Wilkins Concert, Studio, and Stage DSP audio profiles on HiFi systems."},bmw_hitch_zoom_camera:{name:"Reverse Camera Trailer Hitch Zoom Mode",desc:"Unlocks top-down trailer hitch alignment zoom mode on reverse camera view."},bmw_secure_idle_protection:{name:"Secure Idle Engine Shift-Lock Protection",desc:"Locks transmission in Park if driver leaves running vehicle with key fob."},bmw_seatbelt_handover_mute:{name:"Coupe Electric Seatbelt Handover Arm Deactivation",desc:"Disables motorized seatbelt extender arm on 4 Series and 2 Series Coupes."},bmw_auto_heat_threshold_5c:{name:"Automatic Seat & Steering Wheel Heating Temperature",desc:"Triggers automatic seat and steering wheel heating when ambient temp drops below 5\xb0C."},mercedes_amg_track_pace_unlock:{name:"MBUX AMG Track Pace Telemetry & Lap Timer",desc:"Unlocks lap timing, acceleration telemetry, and G-force graphs on MBUX screen."},mercedes_drive_mode_last_memory:{name:"Dynamic Select Last Drive Mode Memory",desc:"Remembers last selected Drive Mode across vehicle restart."},mercedes_proximity_360_camera_auto:{name:"Proximity Sensor Auto 360\xb0 Camera View",desc:"Automatically switches screen to 360 camera when front sensors detect obstacle < 50 cm."},ford_sync_climate_screen_unlock:{name:"SYNC3 / SYNC4 Touchscreen Climate Control Page",desc:"Enables climate control, heated seat, and airflow direction touchscreen page."},ford_turn_signal_5_flashes:{name:"One-Touch Lane Change Signal",desc:"Increases one-touch lane change turn signal duration from 3 to 5 flashes."},ford_auto_engine_shutdown_disable:{name:"30-Minute Idle Auto Engine Shutdown Override",desc:"Prevents automatic engine shutoff after 30 minutes idle."},ev_battery_preheat_manual_switch:{name:"EV Battery Pre-Heating Manual Switch",desc:"Allows manual battery pre-heating to 25\xb0C before DC fast charging without navigation route."},ev_v2l_power_output_expand:{name:"V2L 220V Outlet Power Expansion",desc:"Expands V2L external 220V AC household power outlet limit from 2.2 kW to 3.6 kW."},ev_one_pedal_regen_force_level3:{name:"One-Pedal Drive Maximum Regenerative Braking Default",desc:"Sets maximum regenerative braking as default on vehicle start."},byd_soc_max_charge_target_limit:{name:"BYD Battery Health Protection Max Charge Limit",desc:"Sets max AC/DC charge cutoff limit to 80% or 90% to extend Blade Battery lifespan."},byd_dmi_forced_pure_ev_speed_override:{name:"BYD DM-i Pure EV Mode Gasoline Engine Override",desc:"Inhibits gasoline engine start in EV mode up to 130 km/h even during full throttle acceleration."},byd_vtol_v2v_rescue_charge_mode:{name:"BYD VTOL Rescue Charge Mode",desc:"Unlocks external AC power output to charge stranded electric vehicles on road."},hyundai_ipedal_memory_lock:{name:"Hyundai / Kia i-PEDAL One-Pedal Drive Memory Lock",desc:"Prevents i-PEDAL one-pedal stop mode from dropping back to Level 3 after shifting to Reverse."},hyundai_utility_mode_12v_saver:{name:"Utility Camping Mode High-Voltage 12V Saver",desc:"Powers 220V V2L outlet directly from HV traction battery to prevent auxiliary 12V battery drain."},hyundai_phev_no_ice_climate_start:{name:"PHEV EV Mode Climate Heating Gasoline Engine Suppression",desc:"Forces heat pump / PTC electric heater for cabin climate without starting gasoline engine."},vag_taycan_ess_sound_profile_swap:{name:"Electric Sport Sound Taycan / RS e-tron Profile",desc:"Changes electric driving sound profile to Porsche Taycan GTS or Audi RS e-tron GT sound generator."},vag_meb_d