on Zero-Point Calibration",desc:"Calibrates electronic suspension load and travel sensors to factory zero."},bmwmotorrad_abs_pro_cornering_toggle:{name:"ABS Pro Cornering Mode Intervention Threshold",desc:"Adjusts lean-angle dependent ABS intervention sensitivity for track use."},bmwmotorrad_service_interval_reset:{name:"Annual & Distance Service Reminder Reset",desc:"Resets instrument cluster service indicator and sets custom interval."},bmwmotorrad_headlight_pro_cornering:{name:"Headlight Pro Adaptive Cornering Light Sensitivity",desc:"Adjusts lean angle threshold for adaptive cornering headlight activation."},bmwmotorrad_keyless_ride_range_extend:{name:"Keyless Ride Fob Detection Range Extension",desc:"Optimizes transponder signal range for keyless ignition sensing."},bmwmotorrad_reverse_assist_sensitivity:{name:"Electric Reverse Assist Motor Sensitivity",desc:"Fine-tunes reverse drive electric starter motor speed and torque limit."},ducati_riding_mode_custom_profile:{name:"Riding Mode Custom Profile Creator",desc:"Unlocks custom combinations for Race, Sport, Touring, and Urban profiles."},ducati_ohlins_suspension_mapping:{name:"\xd6hlins Smart EC 2.0 Semi-Active Suspension Mapping",desc:"Fine-tunes damping curve and stiffness presets for electronic suspension."},ducati_dashboard_lap_timer_gps:{name:"TFT Dashboard Lap Timer & GPS Sector Splits",desc:"Unlocks track lap timer and sector split display on instrument cluster."},ducati_engine_brake_control_ebc:{name:"Engine Brake Control Level Adjustment",desc:"Adjusts rear wheel deceleration torque during hard corner entry braking."},ducati_cruise_control_retrofit_enable:{name:"Cruise Control Retrofit Activation",desc:"Enables ECU software flag for retrofitted electronic cruise control switches."},ducati_exhaust_valve_sound_map:{name:"Exhaust Servo Valve Opening RPM Map",desc:"Adjusts acoustic exhaust valve opening threshold for enhanced exhaust note."},ducati_pit_lane_limiter_config:{name:"Pit Lane Speed Limiter Thre