es 100% motor torque to rear axle with traction control disengaged."},chery_isa_overspeed_warning_chime_off:{name:"ISA Intelligent Speed Assist Warning Chime Mute",desc:"Disables persistent acoustic chime when exceeding detected speed limit."},chery_driver_monitoring_camera_sensitivity:{name:"DMS Driver Fatigue Monitoring Camera Sensitivity",desc:"Reduces false-positive distraction alerts from interior monitoring camera."},retrofit_parking_sensor_coding:{name:"Retrofit Front/Rear Parking Distance Control Coding",desc:"Registers aftermarket or OEM parking sensor module in Gateway installation list."},retrofit_360_camera_activation:{name:"Retrofit 360\xb0 Area View Surround Camera System",desc:"Activates surround view camera controller and adds camera view to infotainment."},retrofit_led_license_plate_light_coding:{name:"Retrofit LED License Plate & Tail Light Error Cancel",desc:"Disables cold bulb check monitoring to prevent false lamp out warnings with LEDs."},retrofit_dash_cam_sentry_integration:{name:"Retrofit Dash Cam Continuous Ignition Power & Sentry Mode",desc:"Configures Body Control Module terminal 30 power line for continuous parking recording."},retrofit_heated_windshield_activation:{name:"Retrofit Heated Windshield Element Coding",desc:"Enables windshield defrost heater relay output and climatronic screen button."},retrofit_wireless_charger_module_coding:{name:"Retrofit Qi Wireless Smartphone Charging Pad Integration",desc:"Enables wireless charger status LED and phone left behind reminder popup."},retrofit_acc_radar_module_coding:{name:"Retrofit Adaptive Cruise Control Front Radar Module",desc:"Encodes retrofitted front distance radar unit into CAN bus vehicle network."},retrofit_traffic_sign_camera_activation:{name:"Retrofit Traffic Sign Recognition Windshield Camera Coding",desc:"Enables VZE sign recognition processing on retrofitted windshield camera."},retrofit_heated_steering_wheel_coding:{name:"Retrofit Heated Steering Wheel Module Activation",desc