d FX",desc:"Plays realistic V8 exhaust pop & bang audio effects through cabin speakers."},fun_matrix_light_show_welcome:{name:"Custom Headlight Matrix LED Dance Welcome",desc:"Plays rhythmic Light Show choreography using headlights & indicators."},fun_stealth_fighter_display:{name:"Stealth Fighter Night Driving Minimalist Cluster Mode",desc:"Turns off all cluster lights except speedometer for pitch-black night driving."},vag_lap_timer_oil_temp:{name:"Lap Timer & Oil Temperature in Gauge Cluster",desc:"Unlocks racetrack lap timer stopwatch and real-time engine oil temperature readout."},vag_rear_scandinavian_drl:{name:"Scandinavian DRL",desc:"Illuminates rear LED tail lights constantly when front daytime running lights are active."},vag_drl_handbrake_off:{name:"Turn OFF DRL when Handbrake is Engaged",desc:"Automatically turns off daytime running lights whenever parking brake is pulled up."},vag_drl_menu_in_mib:{name:"DRL ON/OFF Toggle Switch in Touchscreen Menu",desc:"Adds Daytime Running Lights toggle checkbox under Vehicle Lights settings in MIB screen."},vag_rain_closing_windows:{name:"Rain Closing",desc:"Closes all open windows and panoramic sunroof if parked vehicle detects rain on windshield."},vag_audi_dynamic_throttle:{name:"Audi Linear Direct Throttle Response",desc:"Removes electronic pedal lag by switching from time-gradient to direct linear throttle mapping."},vag_xds_differential_sensitivity:{name:"XDS Electronic Differential Lock Sensitivity",desc:"Increases cornering traction and reduces understeer by applying higher inner-wheel brake torque."},vag_offroad_display_mib:{name:"Off-Road Display & Compass in Infotainment",desc:"Unlocks Off-Road telemetry screen displaying steering angle, compass, and oil/coolant temperatures."},vag_highbeam_assist_memory:{name:"High-Beam Assist State Memory",desc:"Maintains Auto High-Beam Assist active across ignition cycles so driver does not have to re-arm it."},vag_comfort_turn_signals_count:{name:"Comfort Turn Signal Flash Cycles",desc:"Changes number of highway lane-change blinker pulses from standard 3 to 4 or 5."},bmw_video_in_motion_speedlock:{name:"Video in Motion Speedlock Removal",desc:"Allows USB and DVD video playback on iDrive screen while vehicle is moving."},bmw_digital_speedo_kombi:{name:"Digital Speedometer in Instrument Cluster",desc:"Adds real-time digital speed numerical readout on the onboard computer screen."},bmw_acoustic_lock_chirp:{name:"Acoustic Alarm Chirp on Lock / Unlock",desc:"Adds acoustic confirmation chirp via alarm siren with volume setting in iDrive menu."},bmw_auto_mirror_fold_comfort_close:{name:"Fold Mirrors Instantly with 1-Click Lock",desc:"Eliminates the 1.5s delay requirement for folding mirrors when pressing key lock."},bmw_rolls_royce_warning_chimes:{name:"Rolls-Royce / BMW i / MINI Warning Chime Tones",desc:"Changes the system warning chimes to luxury Rolls-Royce tones."},bmw_m_performance_boot_animation:{name:"M Performance / Alpina Cluster Boot Logo",desc:"Sets startup logo on digital instrument cluster to M Performance, M2, M3, M5, or Alpina."},bmw_tpms_temperature_display:{name:"Tire Pressure & Temperature Live Display",desc:"Adds real-time individual tire temperature readouts alongside tire pressure on iDrive screen."},bmw_rear_drl_scandinavian:{name:"Rear Tail Lights Active with Daytime Running Lights",desc:"Keeps rear LED neon rings illuminated when daytime running lights are active in position 0/Auto."},bmw_sport_automatic_transmission_2tb:{name:"Sport Automatic Transmission & Launch Control",desc:"Unlocks faster shifting times, rev-matching downshifts, and factory Launch Control mode."},merc_needle_sweep_staging:{name:"Instrument Needle Sweep",desc:"Sweeps gauge needles to maximum upon turning on the ignition."},merc_highbeam_memory:{name:"High-Beam Assist State Memory",desc:"Remembers the last active state of Adaptive Highbeam Assist across ignition cycles."},merc_acoustic_lock_chirp:{name:"Acoustic Alarm Lock Chirp",desc:"Emits