hythm Ambient Lighting",desc:"Synchronizes cabin LED ambient lighting pulses with audio system bass beats."},xpeng_rear_camera_trailer_hitch_view:{name:"360\xb0 Camera Hitch & Ground Overlay Mode",desc:"Adds high-resolution hitch alignment grid overlay to backup camera."},nio_battery_swap_interval_reminder:{name:"Power Swap Station Pre-Conditioning Mode",desc:"Automatically lowers battery lock pins and pre-conditions packs prior to swap."},nio_nomi_assistant_custom_voice_phrases:{name:"NOMI AI Companion Personalization & Wake Words",desc:"Unlocks custom avatar animations and personalized greeting phrases for NOMI."},nio_sentry_watchdog_continuous_recording:{name:"NIO Sentry Mode 4K Camera Buffer Recording",desc:"Enables high-bitrate surround camera recording to USB drive when parked."},xiaomi_su7_hyperos_driver_profile_sync:{name:"Xiaomi SU7 HyperOS Driver Profile Ecosystem Sync",desc:"Synchronizes seat, mirror, and climate presets automatically via Xiaomi phone Bluetooth."},xiaomi_su7_boost_mode_throttle_curve:{name:"Boost Mode 20-Second Overboost Power Unlock",desc:"Extends maximum electric motor overboost duration during full throttle acceleration."},xiaomi_su7_drift_mode_torque_vectoring:{name:"Drift Mode RWD Torque Vectoring Allocation",desc:"Allocates 100% motor torque to rear axle with traction control disengaged."},chery_isa_overspeed_warning_chime_off:{name:"ISA Intelligent Speed Assist Warning Chime Mute",desc:"Disables persistent acoustic chime when exceeding detected speed limit."},chery_driver_monitoring_camera_sensitivity:{name:"DMS Driver Fatigue Monitoring Camera Sensitivity",desc:"Reduces false-positive distraction alerts from interior monitoring camera."},retrofit_parking_sensor_coding:{name:"Retrofit Front/Rear Parking Distance Control Coding",desc:"Registers aftermarket or OEM parking sensor module in Gateway installation list."},retrofit_360_camera_activation:{name:"Retrofit 360\xb0 Area View Surround Camera System",desc:"Activates surround view