star signature blue dynamic gauge theme in Volvo driver display."},vag_virtual_cockpit_r_theme:{name:"Virtual Cockpit R / S / Cupra Performance Themes",desc:"Unlocks R-Line, S-Line, and Cupra central tachometer performance themes in digital cockpit."},vag_sound_symposer_mute:{name:"Sound Symposer Fake Engine Noise Deactivation",desc:"Deactivates cabin speaker fake engine sound generator for pure exhaust note."},vag_wireless_carplay_enable:{name:"Wireless Apple CarPlay & Android Auto Activation",desc:"Enables 5GHz Wi-Fi wireless Apple CarPlay and Android Auto on MIB2.5/MIB3 units."},vag_offroad_telemetry_menu:{name:"MIB Offroad Telemetry & Gauge Display",desc:"Displays steering angle, oil temp, coolant temp, and altitude gauges on MIB screen."},vag_easy_entry_driver_seat:{name:"Automatic Easy Entry Power Seat Back-step",desc:"Moves electric driver seat back 5 cm upon door opening for easy vehicle entry."},vag_hba_memory_state:{name:"High-Beam Assist Memory Retention",desc:"Remembers High-Beam Assist ON status across ignition restart cycles."},vag_battery_soc_display:{name:"Battery State of Charge Display",desc:"Shows exact battery charge percentage on instrument cluster when trip button is held."},bmw_idrive7_m_animation:{name:"iDrive 7 / 8 M-Performance Startup Animation",desc:"Changes iDrive screen boot graphic to M-Performance or M-GmbH logo animation."},bmw_bowers_wilkins_audio_profiles:{name:"Bowers & Wilkins 3D Sound Engine Unlock",desc:"Unlocks Bowers & Wilkins Concert, Studio, and Stage DSP audio profiles on HiFi systems."},bmw_hitch_zoom_camera:{name:"Reverse Camera Trailer Hitch Zoom Mode",desc:"Unlocks top-down trailer hitch alignment zoom mode on reverse camera view."},bmw_secure_idle_protection:{name:"Secure Idle Engine Shift-Lock Protection",desc:"Locks transmission in Park if driver leaves running vehicle with key fob."},bmw_seatbelt_handover_mute:{name:"Coupe Electric Seatbelt Handover Arm Deactivation",desc:"Disables motorized seatbelt extender arm on 4 Series and 2 Series Coupes."},bmw_auto_heat_threshold_5c:{name:"Automatic Seat & Steering Wheel Heating Temperature",desc:"Triggers automatic seat and steering wheel heating when ambient temp drops below 5\xb0C."},mercedes_amg_track_pace_unlock:{name:"MBUX AMG Track Pace Telemetry & Lap Timer",desc:"Unlocks lap timing, acceleration telemetry, and G-force graphs on MBUX screen."},mercedes_drive_mode_last_memory:{name:"Dynamic Select Last Drive Mode Memory",desc:"Remembers last selected Drive Mode across vehicle restart."},mercedes_proximity_360_camera_auto:{name:"Proximity Sensor Auto 360\xb0 Camera View",desc:"Automatically switches screen to 360 camera when front sensors detect obstacle < 50 cm."},ford_sync_climate_screen_unlock:{name:"SYNC3 / SYNC4 Touchscreen Climate Control Page",desc:"Enables climate control, heated seat, and airflow direction touchscreen page."},ford_turn_signal_5_flashes:{name:"One-Touch Lane Change Signal",desc:"Increases one-touch lane change turn signal duration from 3 to 5 flashes."},ford_auto_engine_shutdown_disable:{name:"30-Minute Idle Auto Engine Shutdown Override",desc:"Prevents automatic engine shutoff after 30 minutes idle."},ev_battery_preheat_manual_switch:{name:"EV Battery Pre-Heating Manual Switch",desc:"Allows manual battery pre-heating to 25\xb0C before DC fast charging without navigation route."},ev_v2l_power_output_expand:{name:"V2L 220V Outlet Power Expansion",desc:"Expands V2L external 220V AC household power outlet limit from 2.2 kW to 3.6 kW."},ev_one_pedal_regen_force_level3:{name:"One-Pedal Drive Maximum Regenerative Braking Default",desc:"Sets maximum regenerative braking as default on vehicle start."},byd_soc_max_charge_target_limit:{name:"BYD Battery Health Protection Max Charge Limit",desc:"Sets max AC/DC charge cutoff limit to 80% or 90% to extend Blade Battery lifespan."},byd_dmi_forced_pure_ev_speed_override:{name:"BYD DM-i Pure EV Mode Gasoline Engine Override",desc:"Inhibits gasoline engine start in EV mode up to 130 km/h even during full throttle acceleration."},byd_vtol_v2v_rescue_charge_mode:{name:"BYD VTOL Rescue Charge Mode",desc:"Unlocks external AC power output to charge stranded electric vehicles on road."},hyundai_ipedal_memory_lock:{name:"Hyundai / Kia i-PEDAL One-Pedal Drive Memory Lock",desc:"Prevents i-PEDAL one-pedal stop mode from dropping back to Level 3 after shifting to Reverse."},hyundai_utility_mode_12v_saver:{name:"Utility Camping Mode High-Voltage 12V Saver",desc:"Powers 220V V2L outlet directly from HV traction battery to prevent auxiliary 12V battery drain."},hyundai_phev_no_ice_climate_start:{name:"PHEV EV Mode Climate Heating Gasoline Engine Suppression",desc:"Forces heat pump / PTC electric heater for cabin climate without starting gasoline engine."},vag_taycan_ess_sound_profile_swap:{name:"Electric Sport Sound Taycan / RS e-tron Profile",desc:"Changes electric driving sound profile to Porsche Taycan GTS or Audi RS e-tron GT sound generator."},vag_meb_daily_charge_target_menu:{name:"MEB Battery Daily 80% / Trip 100% Quick Charge Bar",desc:"Adds quick toggle bar on MIB screen to switch between 80% daily battery care and 100% trip charge."},vag_gte_generator_charge_reserve:{name:"GTE / E-Mode Engine Generator Battery Force Charge",desc:"Forces combustion engine to act as generator to recharge high-voltage battery up to 80% while driving."},bmw_hans_zimmer_iconic_sounds_m:{name:"Hans Zimmer IconicSounds Electric M-Performance Sound Engine",desc:"Unlocks Hans Zimmer acoustic M-Performance electric acceleration sound profiles on i4 and iX."},bmw_phev_max_edrive_140kmh:{name:"PHEV MAX eDrive Pure Electric Speed Ceiling",desc:"Increases max pure electric speed ceiling on 330e / 530e Plug-in hybrids to 140 km/h."},bmw_ac_charging_current_limit_menu:{name:"AC Home Charger Maximum Current Limit Selector",desc:"Adds AC home charging current limiter to prevent home circuit overload."},toyota_hybrid_ev_mode_override:{name:"Toyota / Lexus EV Mode Throttle Override Suppression",desc:"Prevents gasoline engine from forced start during acceleration when EV mode button is active."},toyota_hybrid_battery_fan_speed_boost:{name:"Toyota / Lexus High-Voltage Battery Cooling Fan Boost",desc:"Increases hybrid traction battery cooling fan speed by +30% to prevent thermal degradation in hot climates."},tesla_sentry_high_bitrate_video:{name:"Tesla Sentry Mode High-Bitrate Continuous Dashcam Recording",desc:"Increases Sentry Mode camera video recording bitrate for crystal-clear license plate visibility."},tesla_cabin_overheat_threshold_30c:{name:"Tesla Cabin Overheat Protection Temperature Threshold",desc:"Lowers cabin overheat protection climate trigger temperature from 40\xb0C to 30\xb0C for interior preservation."},bmwmotorrad_quickshifter_pro_readapt:{name:"Shift Assistant Pro Re-Adaptation",desc:"Resets shift sensor learning parameters and initiates quickshifter recalibration."},bmwmotorrad_esa_zero_point_calib:{name:"Dynamic ESA Suspension Zero-Point Calibration",desc:"Calibrates electronic suspension load and travel sensors to factory zero."},bmwmotorrad_abs_pro_cornering_toggle:{name:"ABS Pro Cornering Mode Intervention Threshold",desc:"Adjusts lean-angle dependent ABS intervention sensitivity for track use."},bmwmotorrad_service_interval_reset:{name:"Annual & Distance Service Reminder Reset",desc:"Resets instrument cluster service indicator and sets custom interval."},bmwmotorrad_headlight_pro_cornering:{name:"Headlight Pro Adaptive Cornering Light Sensitivity",desc:"Adjusts lean angle threshold for adaptive cornering headlight activation."},bmwmotorrad_keyless_ride_range_extend:{name:"Keyless Ride Fob Detection Range Extension",desc:"Optimizes transponder signal range for keyless ignition sensing."},bmwmotorrad_reverse_assist_sensitivity:{name:"Electric Reverse Assist Motor Sensitivity",desc:"Fine-tunes reverse drive electric starter motor speed and torque limit."},ducati_riding_mode_custom_profile:{name:"Riding Mode Custom Profile Creator",desc:"Unlocks custom combinations for Race, Sport, Touring, and Urban profiles."},ducati_ohlins_suspension_mapping:{name:"\xd6hlins Smart EC 2.0 Semi-Active Suspension Mapping",desc:"Fine-tunes damping curve and stiffness presets for electronic suspension."},ducati_dashboard_lap_timer_gps:{name:"TFT Dashboard Lap Timer & GPS Sector Splits",desc:"Unlocks track lap timer and sector split display on instrument cluster."},ducati_engine_brake_control_ebc:{name:"Engine Brake Control Level Adjustment",desc:"Adjusts rear wheel deceleration torque during hard corner entry braking."},ducati_cruise_control_retrofit_enable:{name:"Cruise Control Retrofit Activation",desc:"Enables ECU software flag for retrofitted electronic cruise control switches."},ducati_exhaust_valve_sound_map:{name:"Exhaust Servo Valve Opening RPM Map",desc:"Adjusts acoustic exhaust valve opening threshold for enhanced exhaust note."},ducati_pit_lane_limiter_config:{name:"Pit Lane Speed Limiter Threshold",desc:"Enables 60 km/h pit lane speed limiter toggle on handlebar switches."},ducati_desmo_service_light_reset:{name:"Oil & Desmo Valve Service Light Reset",desc:"Clears Desmodromic valve service reminder warning on instrument cluster."},ktm_quickshifter_plus_delay_tuning:{name:"Quickshifter+ Shift Cut Time & Delay Fine-Tuning",desc:"Customizes ignition cut duration per gear for seamless up/down shifts."},ktm_rally_offroad_abs_tc_unlock:{name:"Rally / Off-Road ABS & TC Mode Unlock",desc:"Disables rear ABS and unlocks 9-stage slip adjustment in Rally mode."},ktm_my_ktm_connectivity_unlock:{name:"My KTM / Husqvarna Connectivity Module Activation",desc:"Enables Bluetooth navigation and turn-by-turn routing on TFT display."},ktm_cruise_control_retrofit_enable:{name:"Cruise Control Retrofit Software Unlock",desc:"Activates cruise control function after installing handlebar switch kit."},ktm_clutch_pull_map_switch_gesture:{name:"Clutch-Pull Gesture Map Switching",desc:"Enables rapid map switching by executing clutch lever gesture on startup."},yamaha_quickshifter_cut_time_adjust:{name:"Quickshifter Ignition Cut-Time & Sensitivity",desc:"Adjusts quickshifter sensor load threshold and spark interruption delay."},yamaha_ride_by_wire_throttle_map:{name:"Ride-by-Wire Throttle Map Preset Selector",desc:"Switches between A-Mode, STD, and B-Mode throttle maps."},yamaha_tft_track_theme_unlock:{name:"TFT Track Display Layout & Shift Light Unlock",desc:"Unlocks R1/MT-09 SP track cluster layout and programmable shift RPM lights."},yamaha_launch_control_sensitivity:{name:"Launch Control System Rev Ceiling",desc:"Configures launch control holding RPM."},yamaha_heated_grips_accessory_enable:{name:"Genuine Heated Grips TFT Menu Integration",desc:"Enables heated grip controls and temperature gauge on TFT screen."},honda_hstc_wheelie_control_fine_tune:{name:"HSTC Traction & Wheelie Control Fine-Tuning",desc:"Adjusts Honda Selectable Torque Control slip ratio and front wheel lift tolerance."},honda_bi_directional_quickshifter_enable:{name:"Bi-Directional Quickshifter Retrofit Unlock",desc:"Enables auto-blipper and up/down quickshifter coding in ECU memory."},honda_service_reminder_custom_interval:{name:"Oil Service Reminder Distance Customizer",desc:"Sets custom oil change mileage interval on digital dash."},honda_track_abs_rear_disable:{name:"Track ABS Rear-Wheel Deactivation",desc:"Disables rear wheel ABS channel while retaining front cornering ABS for track days."},honda_cold_start_idle_enrichment:{name:"Cold-Start Fuel Enrichment & Idle Target RPM",desc:"Adjusts initial warm-up idle speed for aftermarket exhaust systems."},harley_custom_throttle_curve_editor:{name:"Custom Throttle Response Curve Editor",desc:"Adjusts Milwaukee-Eight / Revolution Max ride-by-wire throttle progression."},harley_security_alarm_sensitivity:{name:"Smart Security System Proximity & Tilt Sensitivity",desc:"Adjusts motion sensor sensitivity and hands-free fob arming delay."},harley_boom_box_