dden steering wheel tugs by applying progressive torque intervention."},adas_lka_last_state_memory_mode:{name:"Lane Keep Assist Last State Memory Lock",desc:"Prevents LKA from automatically turning back ON every time ignition is restarted."},adas_acc_default_follow_distance:{name:"Adaptive Cruise Control Default Distance Preset",desc:"Sets default gap setting whenever ACC is powered on."},adas_acc_speed_step_adjustment:{name:"ACC Cruise Speed Increment Step Selector",desc:"Changes short-press steering wheel speed button step from 1 km/h to 5 km/h."},adas_matrix_led_glare_free_high_beam_unlock:{name:"Matrix LED Glare-Free Adaptive High-Beam Glare Shield",desc:"Unlocks European-spec adaptive beam-forming high beams on North American cars."},adas_traffic_jam_assist_follow_fine_tune:{name:"Traffic Jam Assist Stop-and-Go Resume Delay",desc:"Extends automatic stop-and-go restart window from 3 seconds to 15 seconds."},adas_rear_radar_blind_spot_zero_point_reset:{name:"Rear Blind Spot Radar Zero-Point Angle Calibration",desc:"Recalibrates rear bumper radar azimuth angle after bumper removal or repair."},adas_surround_camera_stitching_recalib:{name:"Surround View Camera Dynamic Image Stitching Alignment",desc:"Executes dynamic camera image stitching calibration while driving on road."},adas_steering_angle_sensor_zero_point_reset:{name:"Steering Angle Sensor Zero-Point Calibration",desc:"Resets steering center angle to 0.0\xb0 following wheel alignment service."},adas_cross_traffic_alert_sensitivity_adjust:{name:"Rear Cross-Traffic Alert Detection Range",desc:"Increases side radar detection distance for vehicles approaching while backing out."},adas_aeb_emergency_braking_threshold_preview:{name:"Automatic Emergency Braking Warning Efficacy",desc:"Adjusts early vs late warning chime timing for forward collision alerts."},adas_night_vision_camera_alignment:{name:"Infrared Night Vision Thermal Camera Target Alignment",desc:"Initiates infrared camera pedestal alignment verificati