ally applies minimal pad pressure in wet weather to dry rotors."},vag_tourist_mode_lights:{name:"Tourist Mode Headlight Beam Pattern",desc:"Switches headlight beam pattern between LHD and RHD for driving abroad."},vag_hood_warning_mute:{name:"Bonnet Open Instrument Chime Mute",desc:"Suppresses persistent instrument warning chime when hood is unlatched."},vag_emergency_brake_hazard:{name:"Emergency Braking Automatic Hazard Flasher",desc:"Flashes hazard lights rapidly during hard ABS emergency stops."},vag_sunroof_comfort_open:{name:"Sunroof Tilt / Open Remote Comfort Key Fob Logic",desc:"Configures remote key hold action to either tilt or fully open sunroof."},bmw_ecopro_display_variant:{name:"ECO PRO Instrument Cluster Gauge Styling",desc:"Customizes blue ECO PRO efficiency gauge graphic theme."},bmw_volume_bar_hud:{name:"Head-Up Display Audio Volume Level Bar Overlay",desc:"Shows volume change bar directly on HUD projection."},bmw_anti_dazzle_mirror:{name:"Electrochromic Anti-Dazzle Mirror Dimming Sensitivity",desc:"Adjusts automatic rearview mirror dimming photo-sensor threshold."},bmw_camera_pdc_warning_mute:{name:"PDC & Surround View Speed Cut-off Speed Adjustment",desc:"Adjusts vehicle speed threshold at which parking cameras turn off."},toyota_pcs_distance_preset:{name:"Pre-Collision System Default Alert Distance",desc:"Sets initial radar forward collision warning distance sensitivity."},toyota_bsm_timing:{name:"Blind Spot Monitor Warning Warning Timing",desc:"Adjusts blind spot side mirror warning light illumination timing."},toyota_ac_noise_reduction:{name:"A/C Compressor Blower Noise Reduction Mode",desc:"Limits maximum air conditioning blower fan speed for cabin quietness."},toyota_sflow_control:{name:"S-Flow Smart Climate Single-Occupant Mode",desc:"Directs A/C airflow exclusively to occupied seats based on weight sensors."},toyota_relock_timeout:{name:"Automatic Re-Lock Delay Timer after Remote Unlock",desc:"Adjusts seconds before doors auto-relock if no