Last State Memory",desc:"Retains the last selected state of the Start-Stop button across vehicle restarts."},hyundai_approach_auto_unlock_distance:{name:"Smart Key Approach Auto-Unlock Sensitivity",desc:"Adjusts proximity radar detection sensitivity for automatic welcome door unlocking."},hyundai_lead_vehicle_departure_alert:{name:"Lead Vehicle Departure Notification Sensitivity",desc:"Enhances front camera sensitivity when alerting that the front vehicle has started moving in traffic."},hyundai_welcome_escort_lighting_timer:{name:"Headlamp Escort / Follow-Me-Home Delay Timer",desc:"Extends headlamp illumination duration from 15s to 30s or 60s after locking vehicle."},byd_battery_preconditioning_manual_toggle:{name:"Blade Battery Manual Pre-Heating / Pre-Conditioning",desc:"Enables manual battery thermal pre-heating before DC fast charging in cold weather."},byd_vess_pedestrian_sound_customization:{name:"VESS Low-Speed Pedestrian Acoustic Warning Themes",desc:"Unlocks alternative synthesized engine / futuristic tone profiles for low-speed pedestrian alert."},byd_ambient_sound_rhythm_sync:{name:"Music Rhythm Pulse Ambient Lighting Sync",desc:"Synchronizes cabin ambient LED brightness and color shifting with music bass rhythm."},chery_auto_window_rain_close:{name:"Automatic Window & Sunroof Rain Closing",desc:"Closes all open windows and panoramic sunroof when rain sensor detects rainfall while parked."},mg_ev_one_pedal_drive_memory:{name:"One-Pedal Driving Mode Retention",desc:"Remembers the last selected regenerative braking intensity across starts."},porsche_needle_sweep_staging:{name:"Porsche Tachometer Needle Sweep on Start",desc:"Sweeps central analog tachometer needle to redline on ignition power up."},porsche_sport_exhaust_valve_manual_mode:{name:"PSE Sport Exhaust Flaps Permanently Open",desc:"Keeps dual active exhaust valves 100% open across all RPM ranges when PSE button is active."},porsche_rear_spoiler_manual_speed_threshold:{name:"Active Rear Aerodynamic