ive particulate filter regeneration routine."},psa_dpf_regen:{name:"DPF Regeneration Request",desc:"Triggers stationary DPF regeneration for HDi diesel engine ECUs."},bmw_bms_battery_register:{name:"BMS Battery Replacement Registration",desc:"Registers new battery replacement with DME/DDE Intelligent Battery Sensor."},mb_bms_battery_register:{name:"Battery Registration & Reset",desc:"Resets battery aging counter in SAM module after new battery installation."},vag_sas_calibrate:{name:"Steering Angle Sensor Calibration",desc:"Calibrates G85 steering angle sensor zero-point position for ABS/ESP ECU."},toyota_sas_calibrate:{name:"Steering Angle Zero Point Calibration",desc:"Performs zero point calibration of steering angle sensor in Skid Control ECU."},generic_tba_adapt:{name:"Throttle Body Alignment & Adaptation",desc:"Executes electronic throttle body stop learning routine in engine ECU."},epb_service_reset:{name:"Universal EPB Maintenance Reset",desc:"Resets electronic park brake caliper wear counter and calibrates air gap."},vag_dsg_reset:{name:"DSG Transmission Basic Settings Reset",desc:"Resets clutch engagement points and shift valve adaptations for DSG/S-Tronic."},bmw_zf_reset:{name:"ZF 8HP Transmission Adaptation Reset",desc:"Clears EGS transmission shift time and pressure adaptation values."},bmw_brake_fluid_reset:{name:"Brake Fluid Service Interval Reset",desc:"Resets Condition Based Service 2-year brake fluid change timer."},ford_injector_code:{name:"Injector Correction Factor Coding",desc:"Programs 16-character IQA codes for diesel injectors into PCM."},bmw_injector_code:{name:"Fuel Injector Flow Rate Coding",desc:"Writes energy calibration values for replaced fuel injectors into DME."},generic_headlight_aim:{name:"Headlight Auto-Leveling Calibration",desc:"Sets reference zero position for adaptive auto-leveling headlight motors."},bmw_12v_battery_reg:{name:"12V Auxiliary Battery Registration",desc:"Registers auxiliary AGM starter/support battery replacemen