 acest lucru din set\u0103rile aplica\u021biei.",safeModeActive:"MOD SIGUR ACTIV: Clonarea sau adaptorul de calitate sc\u0103zut\u0103 a fost detectat.",iosBtManual:"Activa\u021bi Bluetooth din Centrul de control sau Set\u0103ri. Bluetooth nu poate fi activat automat pe dispozitivele iOS.",iosBleOnly:"Not\u0103: Dispozitivele iOS accept\u0103 doar adaptoare OBD2 BLE. Adaptoarele Bluetooth clasice nu pot fi scanate.",androidClassicHint:"Not\u0103: adaptoarele Bluetooth OBD2 standard trebuie s\u0103 fie asociate \xeen set\u0103rile Android Bluetooth \xeenainte de a putea ap\u0103rea \xeen scanare.",deviceNotPairedTitle:"Dispozitiv ne\xeemperecheat",deviceNotPairedDesc:"\xcenainte de a conecta adaptoarele Bluetooth OBD2 clasice, trebuie s\u0103 le asocia\u021bi din set\u0103rile Bluetooth ale telefonului. Sunte\u021bi direc\u021bionat c\u0103tre set\u0103rile sistemului.",unsupportedDeviceTitle:"Hardware incompatibil",unsupportedDeviceDesc:"Dispozitivul pe care \xeencerca\u021bi s\u0103 \xeel conecta\u021bi nu este un adaptor OBD2 compatibil sau nu accept\u0103 serviciile necesare.",sendButton:"TRIMITE",connectDevice:"CONECTARE LA DISPOZITIVUL OBD2",adapterApproved:"ADAPTATOR APROBAT. SE ANALIZ\u0102 CAPACIT\u0102\u021aI... [2/5]",protocolNegotiating:"PROTOCOL DE SCANARE \u0218I TREZIREA... [3/5]",ecuDetected:"ECU DETECTAT, SE VERIFICA... [4/5]",ecuResponding:"ECU R\u0102SPUNS, FINALIZAREA CONEXIUNII... [5/5]",protocolScanningHint:"Scanning vehicle protocols...",protocolFailed:"PROTOCOL COMPATIBIL NU A G\u0102SIT!",ecuNotFound:"ECU VEHICULUL NU R\u0102SPUNDE!",hardwareCapabilityScore:"Scorul de capacitate hardware al adaptorului: {{score}}/100",hardwareFatal:"Eroare critic\u0103: hardware-ul dvs. este o clon\u0103 fals\u0103 care nu accept\u0103 protocoale mai vechi pentru vehicule. Nu se poate conecta la ECU al vehiculului. V\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 ob\u021bine\u021bi un adaptor de calitate.",progressFormat:"{{progress}}%",btDisabled:"Bluetooth dezactivat",btDisabledDesc:"Activa\u021bi Bluetooth-ul pentru a c\u0103uta adaptoare OBD2.",btDescIos:"Conecta\u021bi prin adaptoare BLE OBD2.",btDescAndroid:"Conecta\u021bi prin adaptoare Classic Bluetooth sau BLE.",wifiDesc:"Conecta\u021bi la adaptoare Wi-Fi.",wifiGuide:"Pentru a v\u0103 conecta la adaptorul Wi-Fi, merge\u021bi la set\u0103rile Wi-Fi ale telefonului \u0219i alege\u021bi re\u021beaua adaptorului OBD. Apoi reveni\u021bi aici.",openWifiSettings:"DESCHIDE SET\u0102RILE WI-FI",connectWifi:"CONECTARE VIA WI-FI",pairRequired:"Asociere dispozitiv OBD2",pairRequiredDesc:"Android poate solicita asocierea deoarece v\u0103 conecta\u021bi pentru prima dat\u0103. PIN-ul de asociere este de obicei:",pairNow:"ASOCIAZ\u0102 \u0218I CONECTEAZ\u0102",pairingFailed:"Asocierea a e\u0219uat. Asocia\u021bi manual \xeen set\u0103rile Android.",successVin:"Conexiune stabilit\u0103. Profilul vehiculului a fost identificat cu succes.",cloneWarning:"Adaptor clon incompatibil detectat. Func\u021biile avansate de codare sunt blocate pentru siguran\u021ba dvs.",viewHealth:"MENIU S\u0102N\u0102TATE \u0218I CAPABILIT\u0102\u021aI OBD2",statusPrompt:"Selecta\u021bi interfa\u021ba de conexiune OBD2 preferat\u0103 mai jos.",scanHintIos:"Asigura\u021bi-v\u0103 c\u0103 adaptorul BLE OBD2 este pornit \u0219i aproape de dispozitivul iOS.",scanHintAndroid:"Asigura\u021bi-v\u0103 c\u0103 Bluetooth este activ \u0219i c\u0103 adaptorul este preg\u0103tit pentru asociere.",negotiating:"NEGOCIERE HANDSHAKE OBD2",failed:"TENTATIV\u0102 DE CONEXIUNE E\u0218UAT\u0102",errLayer1:"Depanare: Bluetooth este dezactivat. Activa\u021bi-l \xeen set\u0103rile dispozitivului.",errLayer2:"Depanare: Timeout conexiune. Asigura\u021bi-v\u0103 c\u0103 adaptorul este ferm introdus \xeen portul OBD2 \u0219i c\u0103 indicatorul de alimentare este aprins.",errLayer5:"Depanare: Negocierea protocolului OBD2 a e\u0219uat. Asigura\u021bi-v\u0103 c\u0103 cheia de contact a vehiculului este \xeen pozi\u021bia ON.",errLayer6:"Depanare: Adaptorul este conectat, dar ECU-ul vehiculului nu r\u0103spunde. Porni\u021bi contactul sau reporni\u021bi conexiunea.",errGeneric:"Depanare: Asigura\u021bi-v\u0103 c\u0103 adaptorul are alimentare, contactul este pornit \u0219i nicio alt\u0103 aplica\u021bie OBD nu este deschis\u0103.",stepAdapter:"Conexiune adaptor \u0219i scor capabilit\u0103\u021bi",stepProtocol:"Negociere protocol OBD2",stepHandshake:"Verificare comunicare ECU",stepStabilization:"Stabilizare bucl\u0103 telemetrie activ\u0103",cancel:"Anuleaz\u0103",online:"ONLINE",offline:"OFFLINE",terminalTitle:"TERMINAL OBD / COD PERSONALIZAT",terminalDesc:"Pute\u021bi trimite comenzi OBD-II sau AT/ST direct la ECU. De exemplu, \u201e010C\u201d sau \u201eATRV\u201d.",ecuResponseLabel:"R\u0102SPUNS ECU:",adapterConnected:"ADAPTATOR CONECTAT",lowQualityAdapterWarning:"Low Quality Adapter (Score: {{score}}/100): Your adapter is a low-grade clone. It lacks the timing precision required for older vehicle protocols. We highly recommend upgrading to a high-quality OBD2 adapter to connect successfully.",statusProfiling:"Se analizeaz\u0103 capabilit\u0103\u021bile adaptorului OBD2...",statusScanningCan:"Scanarea protocoalelor CAN-Bus moderne...",statusScanningKline:"Trezirea protocoalelor K-Line. Vehiculele vechi pot dura p\xe2n\u0103 la 15 secunde s\u0103 r\u0103spund\u0103...",statusHandshake:"Se verific\u0103 comunicarea ECU...",statusStabilization:"Se stabilizeaz\u0103 fluxul de date de telemetrie...",changeType:"Schimb\u0103 tipul de conexiune",errBluetoothUnavailable:"Bluetooth este indisponibil sau dezactivat",errDeviceNotFound:"Dispozitivul OBD2 nu a fost g\u0103sit",errTimeout:"Conexiunea a expirat",errProtocolFailed:"Negocierea protocolului OBD2 a e\u0219uat",errEcuHandshake:"ECU-ul vehiculului nu r\u0103spunde",requiredTitle:"Conexiune necesar\u0103",requiredDesc:"Pentru a utiliza aceast\u0103 caracteristic\u0103, v\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 v\u0103 conecta\u021bi la un dispozitiv OBD2 sau s\u0103 activa\u021bi Modul Demo.",connectBtn:"CONECTA\u021aI DISPOZITIVUL",noActiveTitle:"Nicio conexiune activ\u0103",noActiveDesc:"Nu exist\u0103 o conexiune OBD2 activ\u0103 de la care s\u0103 v\u0103 deconecta\u021bi.",scanningAdapter:"Se scaneaz\u0103 adaptorul...",scanningDevices:"Se caut\u0103 dispozitive Bluetooth OBD2...",quickConnectTitle:"Ultimul adaptor detectat",quickConnectDesc:"Conectare rapid\u0103 la ultimul adaptor folosit \u201e{{name}}\u201d?",quickConnectBtn:"CONECTA\u021aI-V\u0102 ACUM",signalStrong:"Semnal puternic",signalGood:"Semnal bun",signalFair:"Semnal corect",signalWeak:"Semnal slab",iosClassicWarning:"Not\u0103: Dispozitivele iOS accept\u0103 doar adaptoare OBD2 BLE. Adaptoarele Bluetooth clasice nu pot fi scanate.",wifiIpLabel:"Adres\u0103 IP Wi-Fi",wifiPortLabel:"Port Wi-Fi",cancelConnection:"BA\u011eLANTIYI \u0130PTAL ET",statusScanningProtocol:"OBD2 Otomatik Protokol Taramas\u0131 Yap\u0131l\u0131yor...",motorcycle:"Motociclet\u0103",heavyDutyTruck:"Camioane Grele \u0219i Autobuze",statusReadingVin:"Ara\xe7 \u015easi Numaras\u0131 Okunuyor & Profil Olu\u015fturuluyor...",selectCategory:"SELECTA\u021aI CATEGORIA VEHICULULUI",statusConnected:"ECU \u0130leti\u015fimi Ba\u015far\u0131yla Kuruldu",statusAdaptingHardware:"Adapt\xf6r Ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 ve Donan\u0131m Skoru Do\u011frulan\u0131yor...",passengerCar:"Autoturisme \u0219i Vehicule Comerciale U\u0219oare",changeCategory:"Schimb\u0103 categoria",passengerCarDesc:"Vehicule 12V de pasageri \u0219i comerciale u\u0219oare",motorcycleDesc:"Telemetrie pentru motociclete Euro 5 \u0219i tura\u021bii ridicate",heavyDutyTruckDesc:"Camioane Grele Comerciale \u0219i Autobuze 24V",ignitionWarningTitle:"VERIFICARE CONTACT",ignitionWarningDesc:"Adaptorul ELM327 este conectat, dar ECU-ul vehiculului nu r\u0103spunde. V\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 pune\u021bi contactul pe ON sau s\u0103 porni\u021bi motorul \u0219i s\u0103 \xeencerca\u021bi din nou.",goToDashboard:"MERGI LA BORD LIVE",connectRequired:"Connect Required",connectingECU:"Connecting E C U",pairingTipTitle:"GHID PENTRU PRIMA ASOCIERE \u0218I CONFIGURARE",pairingTipDesc:"Pentru adaptoarele Bluetooth Classic pe Android, asocia\u021bi \xeen set\u0103ri \xeenainte de conectare. Adaptoarele iOS \u0219i BLE se conecteaz\u0103 direct.",openBtSettings:"SET\u0102RI BLUETOOTH",firstTimeGuideTitle:"GHID PENTRU PRIMA ASOCIERE \u0218I CONFIGURARE",firstTimeGuideDescAndroid:"Asocia\u021bi adaptoarele Bluetooth Classic \xeen set\u0103rile Bluetooth ale telefonului \xeenainte de prima utilizare. Dispozitivele BLE \u0219i Wi-Fi se conecteaz\u0103 direct.",firstTimeGuideDescIos:"Adaptoarele BLE \u0219i Wi-Fi nu necesit\u0103 asociere \xeen set\u0103rile telefonului; sunt detectate \u0219i conectate direct \xeen aplica\u021bie."},dashboard:{selectDevice:"Atinge\u021bi pentru a SELECTA DISPOZITIVUL",connectedDevice:"DISPOZITIV CONECTAT",noConnection:"Nicio conexiune \xeenc\u0103",batteryLow:"TENSIUNEA BATERIEI E SCASA!",batteryLowDesc:"Tensiunea bateriei este la{{voltage}}. Porni\u021bi sau \xeenc\u0103rca\u021bi vehiculul. Comunicarea ECU poate fi \xeentrerupt\u0103 la tensiune joas\u0103.",batteryWarn:"BATERIA SE SLAB\u0102",batteryWarnDesc:"Tensiunea bateriei{{voltage}}. Ave\u021bi grij\u0103 \xeen timpul opera\u021biunilor pe termen lung.",rpm:"Tura\u021bie Motor",speed:"Vitez\u0103 Vehicul",temp:"TEMPERATURA",throttle:"Pozi\u021bie Clapet\u0103 Accelera\u021bie",status:"STARE TRANSFER",statusHigh:"\xceNALT\u0102",statusLow:"SC\u0102ZUT",battery:"BATERIE",load:"\xceNC\u0102RCARE",intake:"AER DE ADMISIE",manifold:"COLECTOR kPa",customizeTitle:"SET\u0102RI PANOU DE BORD",customizeSubtitle:"Selecta\u021bi senzorii pe care dori\u021bi s\u0103 \xeei vede\u021bi pe ecran.",layoutType:"Tip Aspect",layoutGrid:"GRIL\u0102",layoutList:"LIST\u0102",customizeButton:"PERSONALIZEAZ\u0102 BORDUL",coolant:"Temp. Lichid R\u0103cire",voltage:"Tensiune Baterie",engineLoad:"Sarcina Motorului",intakeAirTemp:"Temp. Aer Admisie",manifoldPressure:"Presiune Galerie",ambientTemp:"Temp. Exterioar\u0103",oilTemp:"Temp. Ulei Motor",mafFlow:"Debit Aer MAF",timingAdvance:"Avans Aprindere",fuelLevel:"Nivel Combustibil",catalystTemp:"Temp. Catalizator",layoutGauge:"INDICATOR",obdTerminalTitle:"OBD HEALTH & TERMINAL",adapterClone:"ADAPTOR CLONARE",adapterOriginal:"ORIGINAL",adapterCloneShort:"CLONARE",adapterOriginalShort:"ORIGINAL",pidLabel:"PID: {{pid}}",limitReached:"Limit\u0103 de selec\u021bie",limitReachedDesc:"Pute\u021bi selecta maximum {{limit}} senzori cu acest protocol.",customizeSubtitleKLine:"Protocolul K-Line conectat. Pute\u021bi selecta maximum {{limit}} senzori.",customizeSubtitleCAN:"Protocol CAN-Bus conectat. Pute\u021bi selecta maximum {{limit}} senzori.",unit:"unitate",statusNormal:"NORMAL",layoutChart:"HART\u0102",adblue:"Nivel AdBlue",egt:"Temperatura gazelor de e\u0219apament",nox:"Valoare senzor NOx",torque:"Cuplu motor",selectedSensorsCount:"{{count}} / {{max}} senzori selecta\u021bi",proSensorMsg:"Upgrade to PRO to unlock and monitor advanced live sensors."},expertise:{historyFound:"ISTORICUL VEHICULULUI G\u0102SIT!",historyFoundDesc:"\xcenregistr\u0103rile{{count}}ale acestui vehicul au fost create anterior. Pute\u021bi revizui mai jos istoricul.",viewHistory:"VEZI ISTORIA \u203a",manualVin:"NUM\u0102R DE \u0218ASIU",manualVinDesc:"Dac\u0103 computerul vehiculului nu \xeemp\u0103rt\u0103\u0219e\u0219te automat num\u0103rul \u0219asiului, \xeel pute\u021bi scrie aici.",vinPlaceholder:"Tip VIN...",startScan:"\xceNCEP\u021aI SCANAREA EXPERT",scanning:"Se scaneaz\u0103...",vehicleIdentity:"ID-UL \u0218I KILOMETRAJUL VEHICULULUI",vin:"Num\u0103r \u0219asiu",odometer:"KM original",distSinceCleared:"Eroare \u0219tears\u0103",milDist:"Lumina motorului aprins",dtcTitle:"Coduri de eroare",dtcClean:"F\u0102R\u0102 CODURI DE EROARE - CURAT",extraActions:"TRANZAC\u021aII EXTRA",garageTitle:"GARAJ \u0218I \xceNREGISTR\u0102RI ANTRECELE",share:"SHARE",saveVehicle:"SALVA\u021aI ACEST INSTRUMENT",noRecords:"Nu exist\u0103 \xeenc\u0103 vehicule \xeenmatriculate.",clean:"CURAT",faults:"E\u0219ec",vinRequired:"VIN necesar",vinRequiredDesc:"Pentru \xeenregistrare, num\u0103rul \u0219asiului trebuie s\u0103 apar\u0103 automat sau s\u0103 fie scris manual.",missingInfo:"Informa\u021bii lips\u0103",missingInfoDesc:"V\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 completa\u021bi c\xe2mpul Brand \u0219i Model.",saved:"Salvat",savedDesc:"A fost ad\u0103ugat\u0103 \xeen garaj ca urmare a expertizei.",connRequired:"Conexiune necesar\u0103",connRequiredDesc:"V\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 v\u0103 conecta\u021bi mai \xeent\xe2i la vehicul pentru a \xeencepe acest proces.",chronicFaultsTitle:"Probleme cronice statistice",chronicFaultsObs:"{{code}} (Observation: {{days}} Unique Days / Total: {{total}} Times)",chronicFaultsPending:"Colectarea grupului de date / analiza statisticilor",notScanned:"Nu a fost scanat",notScannedDesc:"V\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 ap\u0103sa\u021bi butonul de scanare din dreapta sus pentru a citi codurile de diagnosticare.",scanFailed:"SCANAREA EROUT\u0102",errTimeout:"Error: Connection Timeout\nECU not responding, connection slow or disconnected.",errConnectionLost:"Error: Connection Lost\nCommunication with the adapter was lost.",errHardwareFatal:"ERROR: HARDWARE CRITICAL LOCK\nRecovery attempts failed. Please unplug and re-insert the adapter.",errUnableToRead:"Error: Read Error\nECU trouble codes could not be read.",scannedSystems:"SISTEME SCANATE",moduleEngine:"Unitate de control al motorului",moduleAbs:"Sistem de fr\xe2nare antiblocare",moduleTcm:"Modulul de control al transmisiei",moduleBcm:"Modul de control al caroseriei",simSaveBlocked:"Sim Save Blocked",scannedModules:"Scanned Modules"},service:{safetyWarning:"AVERTISMENT DE SECURITATE",safetyWarningDesc:"\xcen timpul acestui proces: \u2022 Aprinderea trebuie s\u0103 fie PORNIT \u2022 Motorul trebuie s\u0103 fie OPRIT \u2022 Nu porni\u0163i vehiculul Vrei s\u0103 continui?",step1:"Pasul 1: \u0218terge\u021bi codurile de eroare",step1Desc:"Toate codurile de eroare stocate \u0219i ledul Check Engine vor fi \u0219terse. Valorile de reglare a combustibilului vor fi resetate. Aceast\u0103 ac\u021biune nu poate fi anulat\u0103!",step2:"Pasul 2: Resetare hardware ECU",step2Desc:"O resetare electric\u0103 va fi trimis\u0103 la computerul motorului. Func\u021bioneaz\u0103 ca demontarea \u0219i instalarea bateriei. Este ineficient \xeen ECU-uri care nu suport\u0103. Nu face r\u0103u.",clearCodes:"\u0218terge coduri",ecuReset:"\u0218terge\u021bi codurile de eroare",finish:"Omite",completed:"Finalizat",completedDesc:"Opera\u021biunile de service au fost finalizate cu succes. Pute\u021bi reporni vehiculul.",hardResetDesc:"Toate opera\u021biunile de service au fost finalizate cu succes. \u2022 Codurile de eroare au fost \u0219terse \u2022 Resetarea garniturii de combustibil \u2022 Resetare ECU Pute\u021bi reporni vehiculul."},info:{desc:"Aplica\u021bie profesional\u0103 de diagnosticare a motocicletelor \u0219i vehiculelor. Compatibil cu toate vehiculele.",upgrade:"Face\u021bi upgrade la Cortex OBD2 Diagnostic Scanner PRO",upgradeAlert:"Acces timpuriu",upgradeAlertDesc:"Cortex OBD2 Diagnostic Scanner este \xeen prezent \xeen dezvoltare. Deoarece sunte\u021bi utilizatorul nostru timpuriu, toate func\u021biile pro sunt disponibile pentru dvs. acum. Feedback-ul dumneavoastr\u0103 este foarte valoros pentru noi!",helpGuide:"AJUTOR \u0218I GHID",language:"Limb\u0103 / Limb\u0103 / Bahasa",support:"CENTRUL DE SUPORT",supportSubject:"Suport \u0219i feedback Cortex OBD2 Diagnostic Scanner",thanks:"Multumesc!",thanksDesc:"V\u0103 mul\u021bumim pentru feedback. Ne pute\u021bi l\u0103sa un comentariu pe Play Store.",sections:{live:{title:"SENSORI DE MONITORIZARE \xceN VIE",content:"Pute\u021bi monitoriza instantaneu RPM, viteza, temperatura motorului, pozi\u021bia clapetei de accelera\u021bie, tensiunea bateriei, sarcina motorului, temperatura aerului de admisie \u0219i presiunea \xeen galerie. Valorile sunt re\xeemprosp\u0103tate de 1-5 ori pe secund\u0103, \xeen func\u021bie de viteza Bluetooth. Pute\u021bi interveni direct \xeen vehicul cu comenzi UDS / OBD prin intermediul terminalului."},expertise:{title:"EXAMINARE \u0218I GARAN\u021aIE",content:"Aplica\u021bia folose\u0219te coduri ECU pentru a detecta erori. Sunt capturate num\u0103rul VIN \u0219i kilometrajul curent \xeenregistrat pe vehicul. \xcen plus, erorile anterioare sunt determinate prin calcularea c\xe2t de departe a parcurs vehiculul cu lumina Check Engine. Raportul rezultat poate fi partajat \xeen medii PDF \u0219i Mesaje."},tests:{title:"BATERIE / TESTE DE PERFORMAN\u021a\u0102",content:"Testarea bateriei are 3 etape: testele de repaus, de pornire \u0219i de \xeenc\u0103rcare \xeen gol m\u0103soar\u0103 starea bateriei/regulatorului. Testul de performan\u021b\u0103 m\u0103soar\u0103 valori de accelera\u021bie 0-60 \u0219i 0-100 km/h cu o marj\u0103 de eroare de 50 ms, folosind datele de vitez\u0103 instantanee de la procesorul telefonului \u0219i vehiculul dumneavoastr\u0103."},hardware:{title:"COMPATIBILITATE HARDWARE",content:"Este recomandat ELM327 Bluetooth. Este posibil ca unele coduri avansate s\u0103 nu func\u021bioneze pe hardware de calitate slab\u0103 cu versiunea v2.1 CLONE. Ob\u021bine\u021bi cea mai rapid\u0103 vitez\u0103 cu adaptoare premium precum vLinker \u0219i OBDLink."},warnings:{title:"AVERTIZ\u0102RI IMPORTANTE",content:"\u2022 Aprinderea trebuie s\u0103 fie PORNIT \u0219i motorul OPRIT \xeen timpul procesului de \u0219tergere a codului de eroare sau al func\u021biei de resetare ECU. \u2022 Nu trimite\u021bi o resetare unui vehicul care ruleaz\u0103. \u2022 Nu toate vehiculele pot suporta to\u021bi senzorii, senzorii neaccepta\u021bi vor afi\u0219a \u201e--\u201d."},onboarding:{title:"PERMISIUNI LEGALE \u0218I TELEMETRIE ANONIM\u0102",content:"Pentru a \xeembun\u0103t\u0103\u021bi calitatea aplica\u021biei \u0219i compatibilitatea vehiculelor; Parametrii motorului complet anonimi \u0219i codurile de eroare generate \xeen timpul diagnostic\u0103rii defec\u021biunii pot fi analizate pe serverele noastre securizate. Continu\xe2nd, sunte\u021bi de acord cu ace\u0219ti termeni anonimi de telemetrie. Permisiunile Bluetooth \u0219i loca\u021bie sunt necesare pentru a comunica cu ECU-ul motocicletei dvs."},featureCoding:{title:"DEBLOCAREA FUN\u021aIILOR ASCUSCATE \u0219i CODARE UDS",content:"Alimentat de motorul nostru de protocol ISO 14229 UDS, comuta\u021bi \xeen siguran\u021b\u0103 func\u021bii precum luminile de parcare din SUA, m\u0103turarea acului, blocarea claxonului, geamurile confortabile \u0219i set\u0103rile DRL pentru vehiculele VAG, BMW, Renault \u0219i Dacia."},multiEcu:{title:"SCANARE MULTI-ECU TOATE MODULELE",content:"Scana\u021bi \u0219i \u0219terge\u021bi codurile de eroare dincolo de ECU al motorului - inclusiv ABS, airbag, transmisie automat\u0103, grup de instrumente, control climatic \u0219i module de control al caroseriei."},advancedDiagnostics:{title:"ADAPTARE DCT, DPF \u0219i INDICATOR DE PUTERE HP",content:"\u2022 DCT / DSG Clutch Kiss Point Learning & Adaptation Reset\n\u2022 Monitorizarea \xeenc\u0103rc\u0103rii cu funingine DPF \u0219i a temperaturii de regenerare a gazelor de evacuare\n\u2022 Trimuri de combustibil pe termen scurt/lung \xeen timp real \u0219i analiz\u0103 Lambda\n\u2022 Grafic de telemetrie dinamic\u0103 a cailor putere \u0219i a cuplului."},demoMode:{title:"MOD DEMO",content:"Testa\u021bi \u0219i explora\u021bi aplica\u021bia f\u0103r\u0103 hardware OBD2 fizic. Experimenta\u021bi func\u021biile complete de diagnosticare CAN-Bus \u0219i UDS cu simularea realist\u0103 a telemetriei \xeen timp real."}},reconfigurePermissions:"Reafi\u0219eaz\u0103 permisiunile \u0219i condi\u021biile legale",shareWithFriend:"TRIMITE UNUI PRIETEN",shareMessageText:"Descoper\u0103 codurile de eroare ECU ale vehiculului \u0219i telemetria \xeen timp real cu Cortex OBD2 Diagnostic Scanner! Descarc\u0103 acum: iOS: https://apps.apple.com/app/id6764052240 Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.ismail.motocortexv2 Web Portal: https://motocortex-telemetry.vercel.app/"},report:{title:"\u2550\u2550\u2550 RAPORT DE DIAGNOSTIC CORTEX OBD2 \u2550\u2550\u2550",vehicleIdentity:"ID VEHICUL",vin:"Num\u0103r \u0219asiu",odometer:"Distan\u021b\u0103",milDist:"Lumina motorului aprins",distSinceCleared:"Eroare \u0219tears\u0103",dtcCount:"FAULT CODES ({{count}})",sensorData:"DATE LIVE DE LA SENZOR",noData:"Nu s-au putut citi datele",proApp:"Scanat cu Cortex OBD2 Diagnostic Scanner v7 PRO.",date:"data",vinNotFound:"Nedetectat",noDtcs:"F\u0102R\u0102 CODURI DE EROARE - CURAT",speed:"viteza",coolant:"Temperatura motorului",throttle:"gaz",engineLoad:"Sarcina motorului",intakeAir:"Aer de admisie",voltage:"Tensiunea bateriei",shareMessage:"Urm\u0103re\u0219te starea motocicletei tale din buzunar cu aplica\u021bia de diagnosticare Motocortex OBD2! Desc\u0103rca\u021bi: https://cortexobd2.app",manifold:"Manifold",subtitle:"Diagnosticare cuprinz\u0103toare la m\xe2na a doua \u0219i inspec\u021bie de telemetrie",vehicleInfo:"Identificarea vehiculului \u0219i metadatele ECU",healthScore:"Scorul general de s\u0103n\u0103tate ECU",dtcSection:"Coduri de diagnosticare a erorilor",telemetrySection:"Telemetrie live \u0219i instantaneu senzor",maintenanceSection:"Istoricul de service \u0219i \xeentre\u021binere Ak\u0131ll\u0131 Garaj",aiSection:"Analiza general\u0103 a st\u0103rii AI Doctor",noFaults:"Nu exist\u0103 coduri de eroare active sau istorice stocate \xeen memoria ECU.",noMaintenance:"Nu exist\u0103 intr\u0103ri de servicii \xeenregistrate \xeen Ak\u0131ll\u0131 Garaj.",disclaimer:"Disclaimer: Acest raport este generat de software-ul de diagnosticare MotoCortex. Se recomand\u0103 inspec\u021bia fizic\u0103 de c\u0103tre un tehnician autorizat \xeenainte de achizi\u021bionarea vehiculului.",shareTitle:"Distribui\u021bi raportul de evaluare MotoCortex"},battery:{title:"BATERIE \u0218I TEST DE PORNIRE",ready:"Gata pentru a \xeencepe testarea.",restingStatus:"Contactul pus, motorul oprit... Se cite\u0219te tensiunea bateriei...",crankingStatus:"\xceNCEPE ACUM!",chargingStatus:"Motorul este la ralanti... Se cite\u0219te tensiunea de \xeenc\u0103rcare...",doneStatus:"Testarea s-a \xeencheiat!",voltageError:"Tensiunea nu a putut fi citit\u0103. Verifica\u021bi conexiunea.",start:"\xceNCEPE TESTUL",retry:"REPE\u021aI TESTUL",procedure:"PROCEDURA DE TESTARE",steps:{1:"1. Contactul pus, motorul oprit \u2192 Se m\u0103soar\u0103 tensiunea de repaus",2:"2. C\xe2nd apare mesajul \u201eSTART NOW\u201d, porni\u021bi motorul.",3:"3. Cea mai sc\u0103zut\u0103 tensiune \xeenregistrat\u0103 timp de 5 secunde",4:"4. Tensiunea de \xeenc\u0103rcare/regulator este m\u0103surat\u0103 \xeen timp ce motorul func\u021bioneaz\u0103"},warning:"Nu deconecta\u021bi conexiunea Bluetooth \xeen timpul test\u0103rii.",resting:"REST",cranking:"IMNUL",charging:"\xceNC\u0102RCARE",instantV:"TENSIUNE INSTANTAN\u0102",evaluation:"EVALUARE",verdicts:{full:"Baterie: Complet \xeenc\u0103rcat\u0103",good:"Baterie: Stare bun\u0103",weak:"Bateria: Sl\u0103bire",empty:"Bateria: slab\u0103/ moart\u0103",crankNormal:"\xcenceput: declin normal",crankLow:"Starter: tensiune joas\u0103",crankCritical:"Imnul: Sc\u0103dere critic\u0103",regNormal:"\xcenc\u0103rcare: Regulator normal",regLow:"\xcenc\u0103rcare: \xeenc\u0103rcare sc\u0103zut\u0103",regHigh:"\xcenc\u0103rcare: supra\xeenc\u0103rcare",regFail:"\xcenc\u0103rcare: Regulatorul este defect"},verdictLocked:"Face\u021bi upgrade la PRO pentru a vedea raportul detaliat de evaluare a bateriei \u0219i graficul de analiz\u0103 a pornirii."},freeze:{title:"\xcenghe\u021ba\u021bi cadru",snapshot:"MEMORIA E\u015eECURILOR",desc:"Cite\u0219te parametrii motorului c\xe2nd se aprinde ledul Check Engine. Aceste date ofer\u0103 informa\u021bii critice \xeen diagnosticarea defec\u021biunilor.",noDtcs:"Nu este \xeenregistrat niciun cod de eroare. Este posibil s\u0103 nu existe date \xeenghe\u021bate cadru.",read:"CITI\u021aI DATE \xceNGHE\u021aATE",loading:"Modul 02 este pus sub semnul \xeentreb\u0103rii...",noData:"Nu s-au g\u0103sit date \xeenghe\u021bate. Este posibil ca vehiculul s\u0103 nu accepte aceast\u0103 caracteristic\u0103.",error:"Eroare de citire a datelor",values:"VALORI SALVATE LA MOMENTUL E\u0218ECULUI",retry:"CITE\u0218TE DIN NOU",techInfo:"INFORMATII TEHNICE",techDesc:"\u2022 Modul OBD-II 02: \xcenghe\u021ba\u021bi datele cadru \u2022 PID 020C00: RPM \xeen eroare \u2022 PID 020D00: Viteza defect \u2022 PID 020500: Temperatura apei de r\u0103cire \xeen momentul defec\u021biunii Aceste date apar\u021bin ultimului cod de eroare. C\xe2nd codurile de eroare sunt \u0219terse, datele din cadru \xeenghe\u021bat sunt, de asemenea, \u0219terse.",throttle:"Throttle",mapPressure:"Map Pressure",stft:"Stft",trimUnit:"Trim Unit"},perf:{title:"TEST DE PERFORMAN\u021a\u0102",seconds:"SECONDE",speed:"KM/H",idle:"Ap\u0103sa\u021bi butonul \u0219i preg\u0103ti\u021bi-v\u0103 s\u0103 lua\u021bi m\u0103suri.",ready:"GATA! \xcencepe\u021bi s\u0103 conduce\u021bi vehiculul...",readyDesc:"Contorul porne\u0219te c\xe2nd viteza > 0.",measuring:"SE M\u0102SUR\u0102...",done:"TESTARE TERMINAT\u0102",start:"\xceNCEPE TESTUL",stop:"STOP",reset:"RESET",howItWorks:"CUM FUNCTIONEAZA?",howDesc:"1. Ap\u0103sa\u021bi butonul \u201eStart Test\u201d. 2. Vehiculul trebuie s\u0103 fie sta\u021bionat 3. Chrono porne\u0219te c\xe2nd \xeencepe\u021bi s\u0103 v\u0103 mi\u0219ca\u021bi 4. Se \xeenregistreaz\u0103 timpi de trecere de 60 km/h \u0219i 100 km/h Face\u021bi acest test \xeentr-o zon\u0103 sigur\u0103!",sec:"sec"},dtc:{P0102:"Senzor de debit de aer - Intrare sc\u0103zut\u0103",P0113:"Senzor de temperatur\u0103 a aerului de admisie - \xeenalt\u0103 tensiune",P0171:"Sistem de combustibil sc\u0103zut",P0300:"Eroare de aprindere aleatorie/cu mai multe cilindri",P0420:"Sistem convertizor catalitic - Eficien\u021b\u0103 sc\u0103zut\u0103",P0700:"Sistemul de control al transmisiei - Defec\u021biune",P0715:"Senzor de vitez\u0103 a turbinei - Defec\u021biune a circuitului",P0560:"Tensiune sistem - Defec\u021biune",P0562:"Tensiune sistem - sc\u0103zut\u0103",U0100:"Comunicare pierdut\u0103 cu modulul de control al motorului",U0121:"Comunicare pierdut\u0103 cu modulul sistemului antiblocare de fr\xe2nare.",C0035:"Defec\u021biune a circuitului senzorului de vitez\u0103 a ro\u021bii din fa\u021b\u0103 st\xe2nga",B0001:"Circuitul de control al implement\u0103rii etapei 1 a \u0219oferului din fa\u021b\u0103",P0750:"Defec\u021biune a solenoidului de schimbare A",P0814:"Defec\u021biune a circuitului de afi\u0219are a intervalului de transmisie",U0140:"Comunicare pierdut\u0103 cu modulul de control al corpului",C0040:"Defec\u021biune a circuitului senzorului de vitez\u0103 a ro\u021bii din fa\u021b\u0103 dreapta",C0110:"Defec\u021biune a circuitului motorului pompei ABS",C0121:"Defec\u021biune a circuitului senzorului de presiune a fr\xe2nelor",B0010:"Controlul de desf\u0103\u0219urare a pasagerilor din fa\u021ba etapei 1",B0020:"Controlul declan\u0219\u0103rii airbag-ului lateral st\xe2ng",B1000:"Eroare hardware la modulul de control al caroseriei.",B1325:"Tensiune joas\u0103 a circuitului de alimentare a dispozitivului",generalFault:"General Fault"},vehicleSelect:{title:"ALEGE\u021aI VEHICULUL PENTRU A M\u0102R\u0218TE PRECIZI\u021aIA DIAGNOSTICULUI",subtitle:"V\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 furniza\u021bi detalii despre vehicul pentru diagnosticare precis\u0103 \u0219i potrivire a protocolului.",brand:"MARCA",selectBrand:"Alege marca...",searchBrand:"C\u0103utare de m\u0103rci...",customBrandPlaceholder:"Ex: Triumph, CFMoto, Kia...",model:"MODEL",selectModel:"Selecta\u021bi modelul...",searchModel:"C\u0103utare model...",customModelPlaceholder:"Ex: CBR600, Golf, Focus...",year:"AN MODEL",selectYear:"Selecta\u021bi Anul...",customYearPlaceholder:"Ex: 2018",disconnect:"DECONECTA\u021aI",confirm:"CONTINUA",errorBrand:"V\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 selecta\u021bi sau s\u0103 introduce\u021bi o marc\u0103.",errorModel:"V\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 selecta\u021bi sau s\u0103 introduce\u021bi un model.",errorYear:"V\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 selecta\u021bi sau s\u0103 introduce\u021bi un an valabil.",noResults:"Nu s-au g\u0103sit rezultate",selectVehiclePrompt:"V\u0102 RUG\u0102M S\u0102 SELECTA\u021aI MAI \xceNT\xc2I VEHICULUL",selectedVehicle:"VEHICUL SELECTAT",changeVehicle:"SCHIMB\u0102",newVehicle:"Adaug\u0103 un vehicul nou",titleMenu:"Vehicul & Conexiune",registeredVehiclesLabel:"VEHICULE \xceNREGISTRATE",viewRegisteredList:"Vezi vehiculele \xeenregistrate",registeredVehicles:"VEHICULELE MELE \xceNREGISTRATE",deleteConfirm:"Sigur dori\u021bi s\u0103 \u0219terge\u021bi acest vehicul din vehiculele \xeenregistrate?",noRegisteredVehicles:"Nu s-au g\u0103sit vehicule \xeenregistrate.",selectVehicle:"SELECTA\u021aI",mismatchTitle:"Neconcordan\u021b\u0103 Vehicul",mismatchDesc:"Produc\u0103torul vehiculului conectat este detectat ca fiind \"{{make}}\" din VIN. Cu toate acestea, vehiculul selectat este \"{{selected}}\". Dori\u021bi s\u0103 anula\u021bi selec\u021bia curent\u0103 \u0219i s\u0103 o redefini\u021bi cu marca corect\u0103?",operations:{clearDtc:"Coduri de eroare \u0219terse",fuelAdaptation:"Resetare adaptare combustibil",ecuReset:"Resetare ECU"},searchLanguage:"C\u0103uta\u021bi limba...",connectionSection:"Conexiune dispozitiv OBD",noVehicleTitle:"DETEC\u021aIA VEHICULULUI NECESAR\u0102",noVehicleDesc:"Identitatea vehiculului va fi descoperit\u0103 automat prin conexiunea OBD-II. V\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 asocia\u021bi \u0219i s\u0103 v\u0103 conecta\u021bi la dispozitivul dvs. de mai jos.",registeredVehiclesButton:"VEHICULELE MELE \xceNREGISTRATE",connectDevice:"CONECTARE LA DISPOZITIVUL OBD2"},brands:{audi:"Audi",bajaj:"bajaj",benelli:"benelli",bmw_car:"BMW",bmw_moto:"BMW",chery:"Chery",cupra:"Cupra",dacia:"Dacia",fiat:"fiat",ford:"vad",hero:"erou",honda_car:"Honda",honda_moto:"Honda",hyundai:"hyundai",indian:"indian",jeep:"jeep-ul",kawasaki:"kawasaki",kia:"Kia",ktm:"KTM",kuba:"Cuba",kymco:"Kymco",land_rover:"land rover",lexus:"Lexus",mazda:"Mazda",mg:"MG",mondial:"mondial",mv_agusta:"MV Augusta",opel:"opel",peugeot_car:"Peugeot",peugeot_moto:"Peugeot",porsche:"porsche",rks:"RKS",seat:"Scaun",skoda:"Skoda",suzuki_car:"Suzuki",suzuki_moto:"Suzuki",sym:"sim",tesla:"Tesla",togg:"togg",triumph:"Triumf",tvs:"TVS",vespa:"vespa",volvo:"volvo",yuki:"yuki",other:"Altele",alfa_romeo:"Alfa Romeo",aprilia:"Aprilia",aston_martin:"Aston Martin",cfmoto:"CFMoto",chevrolet:"Chevrolet",citroen:"Citro\xebn",ducati:"Ducati",harley:"Harley-Davidson",husqvarna:"Husqvarna",mercedes:"Mercedes-Benz",mitsubishi:"Mitsubishi",nissan:"Nissan",peugeot:"Peugeot",renault:"Renault",subaru:"Subaru",toyota:"Toyota",volkswagen:"Volkswagen",bmw:"BMW / MINI",gm:"GM / Chevrolet / GMC",dodge:"Dodge / RAM / Jeep",byd:"BYD EV",stellantis:"Stellantis / Fiat"},permissions:{headerSubtitle:"PANOUL DE PERMISIUNE",cardTitle:"Acces hardware necesar",cardDesc:"Pentru a \xeembun\u0103t\u0103\u021bi calitatea aplica\u021biei \u0219i compatibilitatea vehiculelor, parametrii motorului \u0219i codurile de eroare complet anonimizate colectate \xeen timpul diagnosticului pot fi analizate pe serverele noastre securizate. Continu\xe2nd, sunte\u021bi de acord cu ace\u0219ti termeni de telemetrie anonim\u0103.",btSub:"Este folosit doar pentru a asocia cu adaptorul dvs. ELM327/OBD2 \u0219i pentru a transmite \xeen direct date CAN-bus/K-Line.",locLabel:"Permisiune de loca\u021bie",locSub:"Este obligatoriu de c\u0103tre arhitectura sistemului Android s\u0103 g\u0103si\u021bi dispozitive Bluetooth cu consum redus de energie din apropiere. Nu v\u0103 urm\u0103rim conducerea.",grantBtn:"PERMITE\u021aI \u0218I CONTINUA\u021aI",skipBtn:"Sari\u021bi pentru moment",deniedDesc:"Unele permise au fost refuzate. Este posibil ca Cortex OBD2 Diagnostic Scanner s\u0103 nu scaneze sau s\u0103 nu se conecteze cu succes la dispozitivele OBD2.",proceedAnyway:"Continu\u0103 oricum",openSettings:"Deschide Set\u0103ri",btLabel:"Bluetooth",langTitle:"Selecta\u021bi limba",nextBtn:"CONTINU\u0102",langDesc:"V\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 selecta\u021bi limba preferat\u0103 pentru a v\u0103 personaliza experien\u021ba de diagnosticare.",langSelectSub:"PORTAL LIMB\u0102",telemetryLabel:"Telemetrie de diagnosticare",telemetrySub:"Partaja\u021bi protocolul anonim \u0219i jurnalele de erori pentru a \xeembun\u0103t\u0103\u021bi compatibilitatea vehiculului.",restartOnboarding:"Reporne\u0219te configurarea ini\u021bial\u0103"},disclaimer:{subtitle:"Read carefully before writing configuration to vehicle ECU.",p1:"ECU coding and parameter writing directly modifies your vehicle's Electronic Control Unit configuration memory. MotoCortex executes multi-stage journal backups, but failure to comply with safety rules can risk module lockouts.",check1:"I confirm that the vehicle battery is stable (>= 12.4V) and ignition is ON.",check2:"I understand that incorrect coding may require a factory reset and accept all liability.",proceed:"WRITE PARAMETERS"},hiddenFeatures:{title:"FUNC\u021aII ASCUNSE",btnLabel:"DEBLOCHEAZ\u0102 FUNC\u021aII ASCUNSE",unsupported:"Acest adaptor OBD2 nu suport\u0103 deblocarea func\u021biilor ascunse.",unsupportedDesc:"Este necesar ELM327 original v2.1 sau superior. Adaptatoarele clone nu sunt suportate.",notConnected:"V\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 v\u0103 conecta\u021bi mai \xeent\xe2i la un vehicul.",notConnectedDesc:"Un dispozitiv OBD2 trebuie s\u0103 fie conectat.",warning:"Aceste modific\u0103ri pot afecta garan\u021bia vehiculului dvs.",confirmTitle:"Confirmare necesar\u0103",confirmMsg:"Schimbarea acestei func\u021bii afecteaz\u0103 set\u0103rile ECU. Continua\u021bi?",confirmOk:"Continua\u021bi",confirmCancel:"Anula\u021bi",categoryLighting:"ILUMINARE",categorySound:"SUNET \u0218I AVERTIZ\u0102RI",categoryDisplay:"TABLOU DE BORD",categoryDriving:"CONDUCERE",featureDrl:"Lumini de Zi",featureRearFog:"Override Lumin\u0103 Cea\u021b\u0103 Spate",featureDoorChime:"Dezactivare Sonerie U\u0219\u0103",featureParkingAlert:"Alert\u0103 Sonor\u0103 Fr\xe2n\u0103 de M\xe2n\u0103",featureRpmWarning:"Avertizare Limit\u0103 RPM",featureFuelSensitivity:"Sensibilitate Indicator Combustibil",featureStartStop:"Start-Stop Implicit Dezactivat",featureSportMemory:"Memorie Mod Sport",enabled:"ACTIVAT",disabled:"DEZACTIVAT",writeSuccess:"Func\u021bie actualizat\u0103 cu succes.",writeError:"Eroare de scriere. V\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 \xeencerca\u021bi din nou.",simulationBanner:"MOD SIMULARE \u2014 Scrierea real\u0103 a ECU nu este \xeenc\u0103 activ\u0103",closeBtn:"\xceNCHIDE",unsupportedOk:"OK",disclaimerTitle:"RENUN\u021aAREA RESPONSABILIT\u0102\u021aII",disclaimerFeature:"Caracteristic\u0103",disclaimerBody:"Modificarea acestei func\u021bii afecteaz\u0103 direct set\u0103rile din fabric\u0103 ale vehiculului \u0219i software-ul ECU. V\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 citi\u021bi cu aten\u021bie urm\u0103toarele riscuri: \u2022 Aplicarea incorect\u0103 poate anula garan\u021bia vehiculului dumneavoastr\u0103.\n\u2022 Unele modific\u0103ri pot cauza defec\u021biuni permanente sau erori electrice nea\u0219teptate.\n\u2022 \xcen timp ce operarea poate fi reversibil\u0103, unele module ECU pot necesita o resetare din fabric\u0103.\n\u2022 Utilizatorul este singurul responsabil pentru orice daune materiale sau imateriale rezultate din utilizarea acestei caracteristici.\n\u2022 Scanerul de diagnosticare Cortex OBD2 nu poate fi f\u0103cut responsabil pentru nicio defec\u021biune sau daune cauzate de aceste modific\u0103ri. Trebuie s\u0103 confirma\u021bi c\u0103 a\u021bi citit \u0219i \xeen\u021beles acest avertisment.",checkboxTitle:"CONFIRMARE NECESAR\u0102",check1:"Am citit acest avertisment \u0219i am \xeen\u021beles c\u0103 garan\u021bia vehiculului meu poate fi afectat\u0103.",check2:"Recunosc c\u0103 Cortex OBD2 Diagnostic Scanner nu este responsabil pentru nicio defecte sau daune rezultate din aceast\u0103 opera\u021biune.",check3:"Doresc s\u0103 fac aceast\u0103 schimbare cu bun\u0103 \u0219tiin\u021b\u0103 \u0219i din propria mea voin\u021b\u0103, accept\xe2nd toate riscurile.",disclaimerCancel:"ANULAREA",disclaimerContinue:"CONTINUA",unsupportedTitle:"Nu este acceptat",unsupportedMsg:"Dispozitivul OBD2 conectat nu accept\u0103 \xeenc\u0103 aceast\u0103 caracteristic\u0103. Este necesar un adaptor compatibil ELM327 v2.1+ pentru scrierea caracteristicilor ascunse. Adaptoarele clonate sau standard nu pot procesa aceste comenzi."},disconnectShort:"DECON.",obdTerminal:{title:"OBD HEALTH & TERMINAL",terminalTitle:"TERMINAL OBD",terminalPlaceholder:"Introdu comanda de mai jos pentru a trimite la ECU",inputPlaceholder:"Introdu comanda...",sendButton:"TRIMITE",statsTitle:"STATISTICA DE S\u0102N\u0102TATE OBD",connectionProtocol:"Protocol de conectare:",none:"Niciuna",hardwareQualityScore:"Scorul de calitate hardware:",original:"Original",clone:"Cloneaz\u0103",requestResponseCount:"Num\u0103r de solicit\u0103ri/r\u0103spunsuri:",timeoutCount:"Timeout Count:",recoveryCount:"Num\u0103r de recuperare:",diagnosticLogTitle:"Jurnalul de diagnostic",clearButton:"CLEAR",shareButton:"SHARE",noLogs:"Nu s-au g\u0103sit jurnalele de diagnosticare.",noShareSupport:"Func\u021biile de partajare nu sunt disponibile pe acest dispozitiv."},dtcContext:{powertrain:"Aceast\u0103 defec\u021biune poate afecta economia de combustibil \u0219i performan\u021ba motorului. Debloca\u021bi diagnosticarea complet\u0103",cooling:"Pericol critic de r\u0103cire detectat. Vede\u021bi pa\u0219ii de repara\u021bii detalia\u021bi",ignition:"S-a detectat o problem\u0103 la sistemul de aprindere. Vede\u021bi pa\u0219ii de repara\u021bii detalia\u021bi",chassis:"Alert\u0103 privind sistemul de siguran\u021b\u0103 al \u0219asiului. Debloca\u021bi PRO pentru o analiz\u0103 complet\u0103",body:"Defec\u021biunea electronic\u0103 a caroseriei a fost g\u0103sit\u0103. Upgrade pentru diagnosticare complet\u0103",network:"Eroare de re\u021bea de comunica\u021bie. PRO deblocheaz\u0103 depanarea complet\u0103",fallback:"Debloca\u021bi analiza detaliat\u0103 a defec\u021biunilor, costurile de repara\u021bie \u0219i evaluarea riscurilor"},perfTeaser:{limitTitle:"Limita zilnic\u0103 atins\u0103",limitDesc:"Ai atins limita zilnic\u0103 de 3 teste gratuite 0-60 km/h. Face\u021bi upgrade la PRO pentru teste nelimitate \u0219i m\u0103sur\u0103tori 0-100 km/h."},sandbox:{title:"Controlul telemetriei Sandbox",connectionStatus:"Starea conexiunii:",ecuStatus:"Stare ECU:",fps:"Performan\u021ba interfe\u021bei de utilizare: {{fps}} FPS",stressBtnStart:"\xcencepe\u021bi stresul de 20 Hz",stressBtnStop:"Opri\u021bi bucla de telemetrie",stopDisconnect:"Oprire/Deconectare",discoveredDevices:"DISPOZITIVE DEscoperite",connect:"CONECTA\u021aI",scanning:"Se scaneaz\u0103...",scan:"Dispozitive de scanare",rpm:"RPM motor",speed:"Viteza vehiculului",coolant:"Temp. lichid de r\u0103cire",throttle:"Pozi\u021bia accelera\u021biei",notConnected:"Nu este conectat",connected:"Conectat",connecting:"Se conecteaz\u0103...",error:"Eroare",openSandbox:"DIAG",advancedTerminal:"Terminal de conectare avansat",terminalTitle:"Monitor live terminal \u0219i autobuz",pause:"PAUZ\u0102",resume:"RELUARE",share:"SHARE",clear:"CLEAR",clearDtcs:"\u0218TERGE DTC",dtcTitle:"DIAGNOSTIC\u0102 DTC \u0219i CODURI DE DEFECT",noDtcs:"NU S\u0102 G\u0102SIT CODURI DTC \xceN ECU",readDtcs:"CITE\u0218TE DTC",sendDtcs:"TRIMITE"},health:{titleMenu:"S\u0102N\u0102TATE \u0218I CAPABILIT\u0102\u021aI OBD2",adapterQuality:"CALITATE \u0218I PERFORMAN\u021a\u0102 ADAPTOR",excellent:"EXCELENT",good:"BUN",clone:"INCOMPATIBIL / CLON",firmware:"Versiune firmware:",capScore:"Scor capabilit\u0103\u021bi",latency:"Laten\u021b\u0103",protocol:"Protocol activ",featureSupport:"MATRICE FUNC\u021aII APLICA\u021aIE",matrixReadCodes:"Citire \u0219i \u0219tergere coduri de eroare",matrixLiveSensors:"Monitorizare senzori \xeen timp real",matrixBattery:"Test baterie / tensiune",matrixHighSpeed:"Telemetrie de \xeenalt\u0103 vitez\u0103",matrixCoding:"Codare \u0219i adapt\u0103ri ECU",active:"Activ",degraded:"Degradat",locked:"Blocat",warning:"BLOCARE SECURITATE:",lockExplain:"Adaptorul dvs. a fost marcat ca un cip clonat/fals. Deoarece adaptoarele clon nu au precizie de sincronizare \u0219i pot deteriora vehiculul \xeen timpul opera\u021biunilor de scriere, func\u021biile de codare \u0219i adaptare sunt blocate. Ob\u021bine\u021bi un dispozitiv original ELM327 v2.1 sau vLinker pentru codare sigur\u0103.",vehiclePids:"LIST\u0102 DE CONTROL SENZORI VEHICUL",checklistPrompt:"Parametrii de senzori standard suporta\u021bi de ECU-ul vehiculului dvs. sunt lista\u021bi mai jos. Senzorii f\u0103r\u0103 bif\u0103 nu sunt raporta\u021bi de vehiculul dvs.",supportedBadge:"ACCEPTAT",unsupportedBadge:"NEACCEPTAT",backToExpertise:"BACK TO DIAGNOSTICS",tabHardware:"HARDWARE",tabModes:"MODES",tabTopology:"ECU NETWORK",tabReadiness:"I/M READINESS",tabVehicles:"VEHICLES",chipType:"Detected Chipset:",atCommands:"AT Command Set Benchmark",mode01:"Mode 01: Live Sensor Stream",mode02:"Mode 02: Freeze Frame Snapshot",mode03:"Mode 03 & 07: Fault Codes",mode04:"Mode 04: Clear DTCs & Reset MIL",mode06:"Mode 06: On-Board & Misfire Tests",mode08:"Mode 08: Bi-Directional Actuator Control",mode09:"Mode 09: Vehicle Identity",mode0A:"Mode 0A: Permanent Emission DTCs",modulePcm:"Powertrain / Engine",moduleTcm:"Transmission Control",moduleAbs:"ABS / ESP Brake Control Module",moduleBcm:"Body Control Module",moduleSrs:"Airbag & Safety System",moduleIpc:"Instrument Panel & Gateway",readinessStatus:"I/M Emission & Inspection Readiness",readinessReady:"READY FOR INSPECTION",readinessComplete:"COMPLETE",readinessIncomplete:"INCOMPLETE",monMisfire:"Misfire Monitor",monFuel:"Fuel System Monitor",monComponent:"Comprehensive Components",monCatalyst:"Catalyst Monitor",monEvap:"EVAP System Monitor",monO2:"Oxygen Sensors",monO2Heater:"O2 Sensor Heaters",monEgr:"EGR & VVT Variable Timing",catPassenger:"Passenger & Light Commercial",catMotorcycle:"Motorcycle",catTruck:"Heavy-Duty Commercial & Truck",catEv:"Electric & Hybrid Vehicles"},sensor:{oilTemp:"Temperatura uleiului de motor",boost:"Presiune Turbo Boost",widebandAfr:"Raportul O2/AFR \xeen band\u0103 larg\u0103",transTemp:"Temperatura de transmisie",catalystTemp:"Temperatura catalizatorului",ethanol:"etanol combustibil %",timingAdvance:"Avans de sincronizare a aprinderii",baro:"Presiunea barometric\u0103",rpm:"Tura\u021bie motor",speed:"Viteza vehiculului",coolant:"Temperatura lichidului de r\u0103cire",throttle:"Pozi\u021bia clapetei de accelera\u021bie",voltage:"Tensiunea modulului de control",maf:"Debit aer MAF",iat:"Temperatura aerului de admisie",load:"Sarcina calculat\u0103 a motorului",fuel:"Nivel combustibil"},secretDebug:{title:"MOTO CORTEX DEV PANEL",logFileSize:"Cutie neagr\u0103 / Dimensiune fi\u0219ier:",dtcCloudSync:"SINCRONIZARE CLOUD DTC",lastSync:"Ultima sincronizare",syncNow:"Sincronizeaz\u0103 acum",developerTools:"INSTRUMENTE PENTRU DEZVOLTATOR",trialResetSuccess:"Contorul de \xeencercare gratuit\u0103 a resetat cu succes!",crashTestTitle:"Test de accident",crashTestDesc:"Aplica\u021bia se va bloca acum inten\u021bionat. Confirma\u021bi pentru a verifica integrarea Crashlytics.",crashButton:"Pr\u0103bu\u0219ire",crashTest:"Test de accident"},features:{title:"UNLOCK HIDDEN FEATURES & UDS CODING",subTitle:"ISO 14229 UDS Long Coding & Adaptation Engine",batteryVoltage:"BATTERY VOLTAGE",voltageReady:"Safe",voltageLocked:"Low Voltage",locked:"LOCKED",ready:"READY",allMarks:"ALL MARKS",writeBtn:"WRITE",catLighting:"LIGHTING",catSound:"SOUND & ALERTS",catDisplay:"INSTRUMENTS",catComfort:"COMFORT",catSafety:"SAFETY",safetyAlertTitle:"Low Battery Voltage Alert",safetyAlertMsg:"Minimum 12.2V battery voltage required for coding.\nPlease connect a charger or start the engine.",items:{vag_staging_needle_sweep:{name:"Gauge Staging / Needle Sweep",desc:"Sweeps instrument needles to maximum upon ignition start."},vag_acoustic_lock_confirmation:{name:"Acoustic Lock Confirmation Chirp",desc:"Emits a short horn confirmation chirp upon key fob locking."},vag_american_parking_lights:{name:"US Style Parking Lights",desc:"Illuminates front turn signals continuously at 20% dimming with parking lights."},vag_drl_menu_toggle:{name:"Daytime Running Lights Menu Toggle",desc:"Enables DRL ON/OFF checkbox in infotainment vehicle settings menu."},vag_tear_wiping:{name:"Windshield Tear Wiping",desc:"Executes an additional final wipe 5 seconds after windshield washer use."},vag_emergency_brake_flashing:{name:"Emergency Brake Hazard Flashing",desc:"Rapidly flashes brake lights and hazards under heavy emergency braking."},vag_cornering_lights:{name:"Cornering Fog Lights",desc:"Illuminates cornering fog light on steering wheel rotation side."},vag_comfort_mirror_folding:{name:"Key Fob Comfort Mirror Folding",desc:"Automatically folds side mirrors when lock button is held on key fob."},vag_lap_timer:{name:"Instrument Cluster Lap Timer",desc:"Unlocks track lap timer display tab in instrument cluster screen."},vag_refuel_quantity:{name:"Refuel Quantity Display",desc:"Displays exact volume in liters required for a full fuel refuel."},bmw_start_stop_memory:{name:"Auto Start-Stop Memory Mode",desc:"Remembers last Auto Start-Stop state across vehicle restarts."},bmw_digital_speedometer:{name:"Digital Speedometer Display",desc:"Adds instant digital speed numerical display option to cluster screen."},bmw_sport_displays:{name:"Sport Displays",desc:"Enables live horsepower and torque dynamic dials in iDrive screen."},bmw_acoustic_lock_sound:{name:"Acoustic Lock/Unlock Sound",desc:"Emits alarm system chirps when locking or unlocking the vehicle."},bmw_mirror_fold_delay_zero:{name:"Instant Mirror Folding",desc:"Folds side mirrors instantly upon lock button press without holding delay."},bmw_tpms_tire_temperature:{name:"Tire Pressure & Temperature Display",desc:"Displays real-time tire temperature alongside pressure in TPMS screen."},renault_trip_computer_enable:{name:"On-Board Trip Computer Enable",desc:"Unlocks average fuel consumption and range trip computer displays."},renault_external_temp_display:{name:"External Temperature Display",desc:"Enables ambient outdoor temperature reading in instrument cluster."},renault_automatic_tailgate:{name:"Key Fob Trunk Release",desc:"Fully pops trunk latch mechanism upon holding key fob trunk button."},renault_alarm_chirp:{name:"Alarm Lock Confirmation Chirp",desc:"Sounds horn confirmation chirp upon vehicle door locking."},renault_shift_indicator:{name:"Gear Shift Indicator",desc:"Activates eco-driving shift UP/DOWN arrows in instrument cluster."},ford_double_horn_honk_disable:{name:"Disable Double Horn Honk on Door Close",desc:"Disables double horn honk when closing door with engine running."},ford_auto_door_locking:{name:"Auto Door Locking at 20 km/h",desc:"Automatically locks all doors when vehicle speed exceeds 20 km/h."},ford_tpms_psi_display:{name:"Numerical Tire Pressure Display",desc:"Displays exact numerical PSI/BAR pressure per tire in instrument screen."},ford_sync_climate_screen:{name:"SYNC Screen Climate Controls",desc:"Adds climate control and seat heating touchscreen menu to SYNC display."},stellantis_power_windows_remote:{name:"Key Fob Remote Window Roll Up/Down",desc:"Rolls up or down all power windows when holding lock/unlock buttons."},stellantis_cornering_fogs:{name:"Cornering Fog Lights Enable",desc:"Illuminates cornering fog lamp during low-speed turns."},vag_traffic_sign_recognition:{name:"Traffic Sign Recognition",desc:"Displays camera-detected speed signs in instrument cluster and HUD."},vag_ambient_color_palette_30:{name:"30-Color Ambient Lighting Palette",desc:"Unlocks 30 RGB interior lighting color picker in MIB infotainment menu."},vag_seatbelt_warning_mute:{name:"Seatbelt Chime Deactivation",desc:"Disables unbuckled seatbelt acoustic chime in instrument cluster."},bmw_alpina_cluster_theme:{name:"Alpina Digital Dash Layout",desc:"Applies blue Alpina signature theme to digital instrument cluster."},bmw_video_in_motion:{name:"Video In Motion",desc:"Unlocks USB video playback on iDrive screen while driving."},bmw_sport_plus_mode_unlock:{name:"Sport+ Driving Mode Enable",desc:"Enables Sport+ high-performance dynamic driving mode in DEC selector."},mercedes_amg_menu_unlock:{name:"AMG Performance Telemetry Menu",desc:"Displays AMG oil temp, transmission temp, lap timer, and G-meter."},mercedes_agility_mode_enable:{name:"Agility Transmission Mode",desc:"Unlocks ultra-responsive Agility shift program in 7G/9G-Tronic transmission."},mercedes_drl_brightness_boost:{name:"Daytime Running Lights 100% Intensity",desc:"Increases LED daytime running lights output to 100% full brightness."},mercedes_alarm_lock_chirp:{name:"Acoustic Locking Horn Chirp",desc:"Emits short horn chirp notification when central locking is engaged."},mercedes_dpf_adblue_gauge:{name:"DPF Soot & AdBlue Level Gauge",desc:"Displays exact DPF soot mass percentage and remaining AdBlue range in IC."},renault_rs_monitor_enable:{name:"Renault Sport RS Monitor Telemetry",desc:"Enables live G-force, turbo boost, and oil temp telemetry on R-Link."},renault_duster_mirror_fold:{name:"Duster Auto Mirror Folding on Lock",desc:"Folds side mirrors automatically via BCM central locking command."},ford_bambi_mode_fog_light:{name:"Bambi Mode",desc:"Allows fog lights to remain ON when high beam headlights are activated."},ford_st_rs_boot_animation:{name:"ST/RS Performance SYNC Boot Screen",desc:"Changes SYNC touchscreen startup splash animation to ST / RS logo."},toyota_reverse_beep_mute:{name:"Reverse Gear Continuous Cabin Beep Mute",desc:"Mutes continuous reverse gear chime inside cabin to a single beep."},toyota_remote_window_drop:{name:"Key Fob Remote Window Roll Down",desc:"Rolls down all power windows when holding key fob unlock button."},toyota_auto_lock_shift_p:{name:"Auto Lock Doors on Gear Shift",desc:"Automatically locks all doors when shifting out of Park position."},peugeot_icockpit_theme_unlock:{name:"Peugeot 3D i-Cockpit Performance Theme",desc:"Unlocks Copper and Track Red color display themes on 3D digital cluster."},jeep_offroad_pages_enable:{name:"Jeep Uconnect Off-Road Pages",desc:"Enables pitch/roll angle gauges, wheel articulation, and 4x4 lock status."},hyundai_smart_welcome_mirror:{name:"Smart Key Approach Welcome Mirror Unfold",desc:"Automatically unfolds side mirrors when approaching vehicle with smart key."},hyundai_one_touch_turn_7_flashes:{name:"One-Touch Lane Change Signal",desc:"Sets one-touch lane change blinker duration to 7 flashes."},hyundai_svm_camera_speed_extend:{name:"360\xb0 Surround Camera Speed Extension",desc:"Keeps 360-degree parking camera active up to 20 km/h forward speed."},hyundai_n_performance_exhaust_flap:{name:"N-Performance Exhaust Flap Default OPEN",desc:"Sets active exhaust valve default position to OPEN on engine start."},vag_rain_closing_sunroof:{name:"Rain Closing",desc:"Automatically closes sunroof and windows when rain is detected while parked."},bmw_launch_control_unlock:{name:"Launch Control Unlock",desc:"Unlocks factory launch control acceleration program in transmission ECU."},mercedes_ambient_64_multi_zone:{name:"64-Color Multi-Zone Ambient Profile",desc:"Unlocks dynamic multi-zone color cycle animation in MBUX interior lighting."},ford_trailer_brake_activation:{name:"Trailer Brake Controller Enable",desc:"Enables integrated trailer brake controller menu in instrument cluster."},gm_afm_dfm_cylinder_deactivation_disable:{name:"AFM/DFM V8 Cylinder Lock",desc:"Locks engine in 8-cylinder mode permanently to prevent V4 vibration."},gm_remote_start_time_extend:{name:"Remote Start Duration Extension",desc:"Extends factory key fob remote engine start run time from 10 to 20 minutes."},dodge_srt_performance_pages:{name:"SRT Performance Pages & Drive Modes",desc:"Unlocks Uconnect 0-100 acceleration timers, G-force meter, and launch control."},ram_bambi_mode_fog:{name:"RAM Truck Fog Lights with High Beam",desc:"Allows RAM fog lights to remain active alongside high beam headlights."},byd_avas_pedestrian_siren_mute:{name:"AVAS EV Low-Speed Siren Mute",desc:"Mutes low-speed artificial electric motor siren below 30 km/h."},chery_isa_overspeed_chime_mute:{name:"ISA Overspeed Warning Chime Deactivation",desc:"Disables continuous 80/120 km/h overspeed warning beep on Tiggo/MG models."},mg_ev_battery_preconditioning_toggle:{name:"EV Fast-Charge Battery Pre-Heating Manual Switch",desc:"Enables manual battery pre-heating switch before DC fast charging."},chery_dms_fatigue_camera_mute:{name:"Driver Monitoring Camera Sensitivity Reduction",desc:"Reduces over-sensitive eye-tracking fatigue warnings on steering column."},honda_walk_away_auto_lock:{name:"Walk-Away Auto Door Lock",desc:"Automatically locks all doors when driver steps 2 meters away with key fob."},subaru_avh_auto_hold_memory:{name:"Auto Vehicle Hold Memory Mode",desc:"Remembers AVH brake hold ON/OFF state across ignition cycles."},volvo_start_stop_default_off:{name:"Auto Start-Stop Default OFF Mode",desc:"Sets Start-Stop engine shutoff system default state to OFF upon vehicle start."},volvo_polestar_digital_theme:{name:"Polestar Blue Digital Cluster Theme",desc:"Unlocks Polestar signature blue dynamic gauge theme in Volvo driver display."},vag_virtual_cockpit_r_theme:{name:"Virtual Cockpit R / S / Cupra Performance Themes",desc:"Unlocks R-Line, S-Line, and Cupra central tachometer performance themes in digital cockpit."},vag_sound_symposer_mute:{name:"Sound Symposer Fake Engine Noise Deactivation",desc:"Deactivates cabin speaker fake engine sound generator for pure exhaust note."},vag_wireless_carplay_enable:{name:"Wireless Apple CarPlay & Android Auto Activation",desc:"Enables 5GHz Wi-Fi wireless Apple CarPlay and Android Auto on MIB2.5/MIB3 units."},vag_offroad_telemetry_menu:{name:"MIB Offroad Telemetry & Gauge Display",desc:"Displays steering angle, oil temp, coolant temp, and altitude gauges on MIB screen."},vag_easy_entry_driver_seat:{name:"Automatic Easy Entry Power Seat Back-step",desc:"Moves electric driver seat back 5 cm upon door opening for easy vehicle entry."},vag_hba_memory_state:{name:"High-Beam Assist Memory Retention",desc:"Remembers High-Beam Assist ON status across ignition restart cycles."},vag_battery_soc_display:{name:"Battery State of Charge Display",desc:"Shows exact battery charge percentage on instrument cluster when trip button is held."},bmw_idrive7_m_animation:{name:"iDrive 7 / 8 M-Performance Startup Animation",desc:"Changes iDrive screen boot graphic to M-Performance or M-GmbH logo animation."},bmw_bowers_wilkins_audio_profiles:{name:"Bowers & Wilkins 3D Sound Engine Unlock",desc:"Unlocks Bowers & Wilkins Concert, Studio, and Stage DSP audio profiles on HiFi systems."},bmw_hitch_zoom_camera:{name:"Reverse Camera Trailer Hitch Zoom Mode",desc:"Unlocks top-down trailer hitch alignment zoom mode on reverse camera view."},bmw_secure_idle_protection:{name:"Secure Idle Engine Shift-Lock Protection",desc:"Locks transmission in Park if driver leaves running vehicle with key fob."},bmw_seatbelt_handover_mute:{name:"Coupe Electric Seatbelt Handover Arm Deactivation",desc:"Disables motorized seatbelt extender arm on 4 Series and 2 Series Coupes."},bmw_auto_heat_threshold_5c:{name:"Automatic Seat & Steering Wheel Heating Temperature",desc:"Triggers automatic seat and steering wheel heating when ambient temp drops below 5\xb0C."},mercedes_amg_track_pace_unlock:{name:"MBUX AMG Track Pace Telemetry & Lap Timer",desc:"Unlocks lap timing, acceleration telemetry, and G-force graphs on MBUX screen."},mercedes_drive_mode_last_memory:{name:"Dynamic Select Last Drive Mode Memory",desc:"Remembers last selected Drive Mode across vehicle restart."},mercedes_proximity_360_camera_auto:{name:"Proximity Sensor Auto 360\xb0 Camera View",desc:"Automatically switches screen to 360 camera when front sensors detect obstacle < 50 cm."},ford_sync_climate_screen_unlock:{name:"SYNC3 / SYNC4 Touchscreen Climate Control Page",desc:"Enables climate control, heated seat, and airflow direction touchscreen page."},ford_turn_signal_5_flashes:{name:"One-Touch Lane Change Signal",desc:"Increases one-touch lane change turn signal duration from 3 to 5 flashes."},ford_auto_engine_shutdown_disable:{name:"30-Minute Idle Auto Engine Shutdown Override",desc:"Prevents automatic engine shutoff after 30 minutes idle."},ev_battery_preheat_manual_switch:{name:"EV Battery Pre-Heating Manual Switch",desc:"Allows manual battery pre-heating to 25\xb0C before DC fast charging without navigation route."},ev_v2l_power_output_expand:{name:"V2L 220V Outlet Power Expansion",desc:"Expands V2L external 220V AC household power outlet limit from 2.2 kW to 3.6 kW."},ev_one_pedal_regen_force_level3:{name:"One-Pedal Drive Maximum Regenerative Braking Default",desc:"Sets maximum regenerative braking as default on vehicle start."},byd_soc_max_charge_target_limit:{name:"BYD Battery Health Protection Max Charge Limit",desc:"Sets max AC/DC charge cutoff limit to 80% or 90% to extend Blade Battery lifespan."},byd_dmi_forced_pure_ev_speed_override:{name:"BYD DM-i Pure EV Mode Gasoline Engine Override",desc:"Inhibits gasoline engine start in EV mode up to 130 km/h even during full throttle acceleration."},byd_vtol_v2v_rescue_charge_mode:{name:"BYD VTOL Rescue Charge Mode",desc:"Unlocks external AC power output to charge stranded electric vehicles on road."},hyundai_ipedal_memory_lock:{name:"Hyundai / Kia i-PEDAL One-Pedal Drive Memory Lock",desc:"Prevents i-PEDAL one-pedal stop mode from dropping back to Level 3 after shifting to Reverse."},hyundai_utility_mode_12v_saver:{name:"Utility Camping Mode High-Voltage 12V Saver",desc:"Powers 220V V2L outlet directly from HV traction battery to prevent auxiliary 12V battery drain."},hyundai_phev_no_ice