c",desc:"Synchronizes seat, mirror, and climate presets automatically via Xiaomi phone Bluetooth."},xiaomi_su7_boost_mode_throttle_curve:{name:"Boost Mode 20-Second Overboost Power Unlock",desc:"Extends maximum electric motor overboost duration during full throttle acceleration."},xiaomi_su7_drift_mode_torque_vectoring:{name:"Drift Mode RWD Torque Vectoring Allocation",desc:"Allocates 100% motor torque to rear axle with traction control disengaged."},chery_isa_overspeed_warning_chime_off:{name:"ISA Intelligent Speed Assist Warning Chime Mute",desc:"Disables persistent acoustic chime when exceeding detected speed limit."},chery_driver_monitoring_camera_sensitivity:{name:"DMS Driver Fatigue Monitoring Camera Sensitivity",desc:"Reduces false-positive distraction alerts from interior monitoring camera."},retrofit_parking_sensor_coding:{name:"Retrofit Front/Rear Parking Distance Control Coding",desc:"Registers aftermarket or OEM parking sensor module in Gateway installation list."},retrofit_360_camera_activation:{name:"Retrofit 360\xb0 Area View Surround Camera System",desc:"Activates surround view camera controller and adds camera view to infotainment."},retrofit_led_license_plate_light_coding:{name:"Retrofit LED License Plate & Tail Light Error Cancel",desc:"Disables cold bulb check monitoring to prevent false lamp out warnings with LEDs."},retrofit_dash_cam_sentry_integration:{name:"Retrofit Dash Cam Continuous Ignition Power & Sentry Mode",desc:"Configures Body Control Module terminal 30 power line for continuous parking recording."},retrofit_heated_windshield_activation:{name:"Retrofit Heated Windshield Element Coding",desc:"Enables windshield defrost heater relay output and climatronic screen button."},retrofit_wireless_charger_module_coding:{name:"Retrofit Qi Wireless Smartphone Charging Pad Integration",desc:"Enables wireless charger status LED and phone left behind reminder popup."},retrofit_acc_radar_module_coding:{name:"Retrofit Adaptive Cruise Control Front Radar Module",desc:"Encodes retrofitted front distance radar unit into CAN bus vehicle network."},retrofit_traffic_sign_camera_activation:{name:"Retrofit Traffic Sign Recognition Windshield Camera Coding",desc:"Enables VZE sign recognition processing on retrofitted windshield camera."},retrofit_heated_steering_wheel_coding:{name:"Retrofit Heated Steering Wheel Module Activation",desc:"Enables steering wheel heating element output and auto-on temperature triggers."},retrofit_fatigue_camera_calibration:{name:"Retrofit Driver Fatigue Monitoring Camera Integration",desc:"Calibrates driver monitoring infrared camera sensor after steering column install."},retrofit_trailer_hitch_module_coding:{name:"Retrofit Tow Bar & Trailer Electrical Module Integration",desc:"Encodes trailer module into ESP stability system for trailer sway mitigation."},retrofit_power_tailgate_trunk_kit_coding:{name:"Retrofit Power Tailgate & Foot Gesture Sensor Integration",desc:"Enables electric trunk drive motors and bumper kick sensor coding."},easteregg_urban_joke_light_show:{name:"Urban Joke Alternating Rear Light Show",desc:"Configures tail lights and turn signals to flash alternately when locking vehicle."},easteregg_custom_boot_greeting_text:{name:"Custom Boot Greeting Text on Digital Cluster",desc:"Displays custom welcome message on instrument cluster screen upon ignition on."},easteregg_cluster_mini_game_mode:{name:"Instrument Cluster Hidden Mini-Game Menu",desc:"Unlocks steering-wheel button controlled retro mini-game on display when parked."},easteregg_custom_horn_melody_package:{name:"Custom Acoustic Horn Welcome Melody",desc:"Plays short rhythm chirp pattern on horn when unlocking car."},easteregg_welcome_lighting_door_sequence:{name:"Chasing LED Welcome Light Door Sequence",desc:"Executes progressive LED chasing animation on exterior door handles."},easteregg_developer_service_menu_shortcut:{name:"Developer & Service Diagnostic Screen Shortcut",desc:"Enables quick gesture shortcut to access hidden engineering diagnostic screens."},easteregg_seasonal_cluster_theme_effect:{name:"Seasonal Weather Cluster Theme Overlay",desc:"Adds animated snowflake or rain particle background to gauge cluster in winter."},easteregg_valet_mode_prank_warning_message:{name:"Valet Mode Prank Speed Limit Popup Warning",desc:"Displays humorously strict warning message on dashboard if valet mode is exceeded."},adas_lane_keep_assist_gentle_curve:{name:"Lane Keep Assist Gentle Steering Intervention Curve",desc:"Softens sudden steering wheel tugs by applying progressive torque intervention."},adas_lka_last_state_memory_mode:{name:"Lane Keep Assist Last State Memory Lock",desc:"Prevents LKA from automatically turning back ON every time ignition is restarted."},adas_acc_default_follow_distance:{name:"Adaptive Cruise Control Default Distance Preset",desc:"Sets default gap setting whenever ACC is powered on."},adas_acc_speed_step_adjustment:{name:"ACC Cruise Speed Increment Step Selector",desc:"Changes short-press steering wheel speed button step from 1 km/h to 5 km/h."},adas_matrix_led_glare_free_high_beam_unlock:{name:"Matrix LED Glare-Free Adaptive High-Beam Glare Shield",desc:"Unlocks European-spec adaptive beam-forming high beams on North American cars."},adas_traffic_jam_assist_follow_fine_tune:{name:"Traffic Jam Assist Stop-and-Go Resume Delay",desc:"Extends automatic stop-and-go restart window from 3 seconds to 15 seconds."},adas_rear_radar_blind_spot_zero_point_reset:{name:"Rear Blind Spot Radar Zero-Point Angle Calibration",desc:"Recalibrates rear bumper radar azimuth angle after bumper removal or repair."},adas_surround_camera_stitching_recalib:{name:"Surround View Camera Dynamic Image Stitching Alignment",desc:"Executes dynamic camera image stitching calibration while driving on road."},adas_steering_angle_sensor_zero_point_reset:{name:"Steering Angle Sensor Zero-Point Calibration",desc:"Resets steering center angle to 0.0\xb0 following wheel alignment service."},adas_