nal Audio Clicker Speaker Volume",desc:"Configures turn signal relay click chime volume."},toyota_smart_key_approach_lights:{name:"Smart Key Proximity Welcome Puddle Lights",desc:"Turns on mirror puddle lights when smart key approaches vehicle."},toyota_rear_hatch_behavior:{name:"Power Tailgate Liftgate Open/Close Operation Logic",desc:"Configures remote and dashboard power hatch button press duration."},toyota_open_windows_smart_key:{name:"Smart Key Remote Window Roll-Down Long Press",desc:"Allows opening all windows by holding remote unlock button."},toyota_interior_light_dim_timer:{name:"Interior Cabin Light Auto-Dimming Off Delay",desc:"Adjusts interior dome light shutdown timer after door closure."},toyota_panic_alarm_remote:{name:"Remote Key Fob Panic Alarm Siren Function",desc:"Enables or disables vehicle horn panic alarm via remote key hold."},toyota_eco_drive_indicator:{name:"ECO Drive Cluster Zone Indicator Light",desc:"Shows eco-friendly acceleration bar and indicator light on cluster."},hyundai_coming_home_duration:{name:"Escort Headlight Off Delay Timer",desc:"Keeps low beam headlights illuminated after vehicle exit."},hyundai_drl_menu_toggle:{name:"Daytime Running Lights Menu Control",desc:"Adds DRL ON/OFF setting to instrument cluster user options."},hyundai_welcome_sequence:{name:"Smart Key Proximity Welcome Light & Mirror Unfold",desc:"Unfolds power mirrors and lights up door handles upon approach."},hyundai_interior_light_delay:{name:"Cabin Interior Room Lamp Auto-Cut Delay",desc:"Sets timer before interior lights automatically turn off to save battery."},hyundai_heat_pump_efficiency:{name:"EV Climate Heat Pump Thermal Efficiency Mode",desc:"Optimizes EV heat pump energy consumption in cold winter weather."},tesla_track_mode_params:{name:"Track Mode Stability & Torque Bias Profile",desc:"Configures front/rear motor drive bias and stability intervention."},tesla_regen_brake_strength:{name:"Regenerative Braking Power Profile",desc:"Adjusts accelerato