olds side mirrors automatically upon pressing lock button on key fob."},stell_cornering_fog_lights:{name:"Cornering Fog Light Illumination",desc:"Activates corresponding front fog lamp when turn signal is on or steering angle > 30\xb0 below 40 km/h."},stell_needle_sweep_cluster:{name:"Instrument Needle Sweep",desc:"Performs gauge sweep on startup for analog/hybrid instrument clusters."},stell_acoustic_lock_chirp:{name:"Acoustic Horn Chirp on Remote Lock",desc:"Gives a short horn tap confirmation when vehicle doors successfully lock."},stell_rear_scandinavian_drl:{name:"Rear Scandinavian DRL Tail Lights",desc:"Illuminates rear tail lamps in conjunction with daytime running lights in Auto/0 mode."},stell_lane_assist_memory_default:{name:"Lane Keeping Assist Last State Memory",desc:"Remembers the last ON/OFF state of Lane Keeping Assist instead of re-activating at every start."},stell_sport_steering_weight_calibration:{name:"Dynamic Electric Power Steering Weight Curve",desc:"Increases steering wheel resistance and centering feel for a firmer, sportier feedback."},stell_digital_speedo_unit_toggle:{name:"Digital Speedometer km/h & mph Dual Display",desc:"Shows numeric speed readout in both km/h and mph simultaneously in the center LCD."},ford_apim_ambient_multi_colors:{name:"SYNC 3/4 Multi-Color Ambient Lighting Theme",desc:"Unlocks full 7-color ambient lighting palette slider in SYNC touchscreen interface."},ford_lincoln_auto_fold_mirrors:{name:"Lincoln Style Auto-Fold Mirrors on Lock",desc:"Folds power mirrors when locking vehicle and automatically unfolds upon closing driver door."},ford_bambi_mode_fog_with_highbeam:{name:"Bambi Mode",desc:"Prevents fog lights from turning off automatically when high beams are activated."},ford_double_honk_disable:{name:"Disable Double Horn Honk on Keyless Exit",desc:"Disables loud double horn honk when driver exits running vehicle with key fob in pocket."},ford_global_windows_remote_open_close:{name:"Global Window Roll Up & Down via Key Fob",desc:"Opens or closes all power windows by holding unlock or lock button on factory key fob."},ford_cluster_digital_tpms_readout:{name:"Individual Tire Pressure Bar/PSI Display",desc:"Displays exact individual tire pressure numerical readouts on the instrument cluster screen."},ford_sync_boot_splash_st_raptor:{name:"SYNC Performance Boot Splash Theme",desc:"Changes SYNC infotainment boot logo animation to Ford Performance / ST / Raptor styling."},renault_rlink_video_in_motion:{name:"Video in Motion Playback Unlock",desc:"Allows USB/video playback on R-Link 2 / EasyLink touchscreen while vehicle is in motion."},renault_rs_monitor_telemetry_unlock:{name:"RS Monitor Performance Telemetry App",desc:"Enables Renault Sport Monitor app displaying live turbo boost, torque, oil temp, and G-force meters."},renault_acoustic_lock_chirp:{name:"Acoustic Horn Chirp on Hands-Free Walkaway Lock",desc:"Emits a brief beep when vehicle automatically locks upon walking away with key card."},renault_rear_scandinavian_drl:{name:"Scandinavian Daytime Running Tail Lights",desc:"Keeps rear 3D LED signature tail lamps active simultaneously with front DRL strips."},renault_cornering_fog_lamps:{name:"Static Cornering Fog Light Illumination",desc:"Lights up the relevant front fog light during turning maneuvers below 40 km/h."},renault_seatbelt_buzzer_mute:{name:"Seatbelt Warning Buzzer Sound Mute",desc:"Mutes acoustic beeping for unfastened seatbelts."},hyundai_ev_charge_limit_ui_unlock:{name:"Manual EV AC/DC Charge Limit Setting UI",desc:"Unlocks 50% to 100% target SoC slider controls in infotainment for battery longevity."},hyundai_isg_start_stop_memory:{name:"ISG Last State Memory",desc:"Retains the last selected state of the Start-Stop button across vehicle restarts."},hyundai_approach_auto_unlock_distance:{name:"Smart Key Approach Auto-Unlock Sensitivity",desc:"Adjusts proximity radar detection sensitivity for automatic welcome door unlocking."},hyundai_lead_vehicle_departure_alert:{name:"Lead Vehicle Departure Notification Sensitivity",desc:"Enhances front camera sensitivity when alerting that the front vehicle has started moving in traffic."},hyundai_welcome_escort_lighting_timer:{name:"Headlamp Escort / Follow-Me-Home Delay Timer",desc:"Extends headlamp illumination duration from 15s to 30s or 60s after locking vehicle."},byd_battery_preconditioning_manual_toggle:{name:"Blade Battery Manual Pre-Heating / Pre-Conditioning",desc:"Enables manual battery thermal pre-heating before DC fast charging in cold weather."},byd_vess_pedestrian_sound_customization:{name:"VESS Low-Speed Pedestrian Acoustic Warning Themes",desc:"Unlocks alternative synthesized engine / futuristic tone profiles for low-speed pedestrian alert."},byd_ambient_sound_rhythm_sync:{name:"Music Rhythm Pulse Ambient Lighting Sync",desc:"Synchronizes cabin ambient LED brightness and color shifting with music bass rhythm."},chery_auto_window_rain_close:{name:"Automatic Window & Sunroof Rain Closing",desc:"Closes all open windows and panoramic sunroof when rain sensor detects rainfall while parked."},mg_ev_one_pedal_drive_memory:{name:"One-Pedal Driving Mode Retention",desc:"Remembers the last selected regenerative braking intensity across starts."},porsche_needle_sweep_staging:{name:"Porsche Tachometer Needle Sweep on Start",desc:"Sweeps central analog tachometer needle to redline on ignition power up."},porsche_sport_exhaust_valve_manual_mode:{name:"PSE Sport Exhaust Flaps Permanently Open",desc:"Keeps dual active exhaust valves 100% open across all RPM ranges when PSE button is active."},porsche_rear_spoiler_manual_speed_threshold:{name:"Active Rear Aerodynamic Wing Deployment Speed",desc:"Adjusts automatic rear spoiler deployment speed threshold."},porsche_matrix_highbeam_unlock:{name:"PDLS+ Matrix LED Adaptive Anti-Glare High Beam",desc:"Enables European-spec variable anti-glare high beam light distribution."},porsche_acoustic_chirp_lock:{name:"Acoustic Siren Beep on Central Lock",desc:"Gives a quick chirp confirmation when locking with Porsche smart key."},actros_rsl_fleet_speed_limit:{name:"Road Speed Limiter",desc:"Configures maximum vehicle road speed limiter calibration for fleet operation policy."},actros_idle_shutdown_timer:{name:"Automatic Engine Idle Shutdown Timer",desc:"Automatically shuts down engine after specified idle time while stationary with parking brake set."},volvo_pto_engine_rpm_preset:{name:"PTO Engine RPM Preset",desc:"Sets predefined constant engine idle speed when PTO is engaged for hydraulic pump and tipper operation."},volvo_ppc_eco_roll_hysteresis:{name:"I-See / PPC Topographical Speed Tolerance",desc:"Adjusts GPS predictive cruise control speed hysteresis tolerance window for maximum rolling fuel economy."},scania_retarder_jake_brake_aggressiveness:{name:"Retarder & Jake Brake Downshift Aggressiveness",desc:"Adjusts retarder torque blending curve and automatic transmission downshifting response under braking."},man_ecas_dock_level_memory:{name:"ECAS Air Suspension Loading Dock Height Memory",desc:"Stores and recalls customized pneumatic air suspension height level presets for loading docks."},daf_stationary_dpf_regen_trigger:{name:"Stationary DPF Forced Soot Regeneration",desc:"Initiates stationary diesel particulate filter thermal soot burn routine in parked position."},ford_trucks_reverse_buzzer_night_mode:{name:"Reverse Acoustic Alarm Night Quiet Mode",desc:"Attenuates reverse backup horn alarm volume for quiet night distribution in residential areas."},cummins_ecm_fleet_speed_limiter:{name:"Cummins Engine Road Speed Limiter",desc:"Programs maximum allowable road vehicle speed in Cummins ECM parameter tables."}},codeBtn:"CODE",removeBtn:"REMOVE",unsupportedTitle:"Vehicle Not Supported",unsupportedMsg:"This feature is not supported by your vehicle's ECU hardware or software version.",selectBrand:"Select Vehicle Brand",selectCategory:"Select Category",selectMakeTitle:"SELECT VEHICLE BRAND",selectCategoryTitl