nce",desc:"Plays dynamic light choreography upon vehicle unlocking."},audi_mmi_startup_screen:{name:"MMI Touch Screen Boot Graphic Theme",desc:"Customizes MMI central screen boot animation."},audi_drive_select_efficiency:{name:"Efficiency Driving Profile in Audi Drive Select",desc:"Enables fuel-saving Efficiency mode in Drive Select options."},audi_laptimer_boost_display:{name:"Lap Timer & Turbo Bar Pressure Gauge Overlay",desc:"Displays track lap timer and real-time turbo boost gauge on Virtual Cockpit."},audi_needle_sweep_gauge:{name:"Sport Gauge Needle Sweep Verification",desc:"Performs full tachometer and speedometer needle sweep test on start."},skoda_coming_home_lights:{name:"Leaving Home / Coming Home Lighting Timer",desc:"Configures headlight illumination timer after vehicle exit."},skoda_comfort_turn_signal:{name:"Comfort Indicator Pulse Count Adjustment",desc:"Sets one-touch turn signal blink count between 3 and 5 flashes."},cupra_sport_display_menu:{name:"Cupra Performance Instrument & G-Meter Menu",desc:"Unlocks G-force meter, kW power gauge, and oil temp display."},cupra_virtual_cockpit_copper:{name:"Copper Theme Dashboard Accent Graphics",desc:"Applies signature Cupra copper metallic accent theme to gauge cluster."},vag_brake_disc_drying:{name:"Brake Disc Wiping / Drying Function in Rain",desc:"Periodically applies minimal pad pressure in wet weather to dry rotors."},vag_tourist_mode_lights:{name:"Tourist Mode Headlight Beam Pattern",desc:"Switches headlight beam pattern between LHD and RHD for driving abroad."},vag_hood_warning_mute:{name:"Bonnet Open Instrument Chime Mute",desc:"Suppresses persistent instrument warning chime when hood is unlatched."},vag_emergency_brake_hazard:{name:"Emergency Braking Automatic Hazard Flasher",desc:"Flashes hazard lights rapidly during hard ABS emergency stops."},vag_sunroof_comfort_open:{name:"Sunroof Tilt / Open Remote Comfort Key Fob Logic",desc:"Configures remote key hold action to either tilt or fully open sunroof."},bmw_ecopro_display_variant:{name:"ECO PRO Instrument Cluster Gauge Styling",desc:"Customizes blue ECO PRO efficiency gauge graphic theme."},bmw_volume_bar_hud:{name:"Head-Up Display Audio Volume Level Bar Overlay",desc:"Shows volume change bar directly on HUD projection."},bmw_anti_dazzle_mirror:{name:"Electrochromic Anti-Dazzle Mirror Dimming Sensitivity",desc:"Adjusts automatic rearview mirror dimming photo-sensor threshold."},bmw_camera_pdc_warning_mute:{name:"PDC & Surround View Speed Cut-off Speed Adjustment",desc:"Adjusts vehicle speed threshold at which parking cameras turn off."},toyota_pcs_distance_preset:{name:"Pre-Collision System Default Alert Distance",desc:"Sets initial radar forward collision warning distance sensitivity."},toyota_bsm_timing:{name:"Blind Spot Monitor Warning Warning Timing",desc:"Adjusts blind spot side mirror warning light illumination timing."},toyota_ac_noise_reduction:{name:"A/C Compressor Blower Noise Reduction Mode",desc:"Limits maximum air conditioning blower fan speed for cabin quietness."},toyota_sflow_control:{name:"S-Flow Smart Climate Single-Occupant Mode",desc:"Directs A/C airflow exclusively to occupied seats based on weight sensors."},toyota_relock_timeout:{name:"Automatic Re-Lock Delay Timer after Remote Unlock",desc:"Adjusts seconds before doors auto-relock if no door is opened."},lexus_mark_levinson_audio_profile:{name:"Mark Levinson Surround Sound DSP Audio Profile",desc:"Optimizes 3D spatial acoustic tuning for Mark Levinson premium speakers."},lexus_ev_mode_beeper_mute:{name:"Low-Speed Pedestrian EV Acoustic Alert Beeper Mute",desc:"Suppresses low speed electric mode synthetic exterior chime."},lexus_easy_access_seat:{name:"Easy Access Steering Wheel & Power Seat Slide-Back",desc:"Slides driver seat back and tilts steering wheel away for easy entry/exit."},nissan_epower_regen_mode:{name:"e-POWER One-Pedal Regenerative Braking Mode",desc:"Sets default e-Pedal regenerative braking deceleration level."},nissan_