, Studio, and Stage DSP audio profiles on HiFi systems."},bmw_hitch_zoom_camera:{name:"Reverse Camera Trailer Hitch Zoom Mode",desc:"Unlocks top-down trailer hitch alignment zoom mode on reverse camera view."},bmw_secure_idle_protection:{name:"Secure Idle Engine Shift-Lock Protection",desc:"Locks transmission in Park if driver leaves running vehicle with key fob."},bmw_seatbelt_handover_mute:{name:"Coupe Electric Seatbelt Handover Arm Deactivation",desc:"Disables motorized seatbelt extender arm on 4 Series and 2 Series Coupes."},bmw_auto_heat_threshold_5c:{name:"Automatic Seat & Steering Wheel Heating Temperature",desc:"Triggers automatic seat and steering wheel heating when ambient temp drops below 5\xb0C."},mercedes_amg_track_pace_unlock:{name:"MBUX AMG Track Pace Telemetry & Lap Timer",desc:"Unlocks lap timing, acceleration telemetry, and G-force graphs on MBUX screen."},mercedes_drive_mode_last_memory:{name:"Dynamic Select Last Drive Mode Memory",desc:"Remembers last selected Drive Mode across vehicle restart."},mercedes_proximity_360_camera_auto:{name:"Proximity Sensor Auto 360\xb0 Camera View",desc:"Automatically switches screen to 360 camera when front sensors detect obstacle < 50 cm."},ford_sync_climate_screen_unlock:{name:"SYNC3 / SYNC4 Touchscreen Climate Control Page",desc:"Enables climate control, heated seat, and airflow direction touchscreen page."},ford_turn_signal_5_flashes:{name:"One-Touch Lane Change Signal",desc:"Increases one-touch lane change turn signal duration from 3 to 5 flashes."},ford_auto_engine_shutdown_disable:{name:"30-Minute Idle Auto Engine Shutdown Override",desc:"Prevents automatic engine shutoff after 30 minutes idle."},ev_battery_preheat_manual_switch:{name:"EV Battery Pre-Heating Manual Switch",desc:"Allows manual battery pre-heating to 25\xb0C before DC fast charging without navigation route."},ev_v2l_power_output_expand:{name:"V2L 220V Outlet Power Expansion",desc:"Expands V2L external 220V AC household power outlet limit from