ks Hans Zimmer acoustic M-Performance electric acceleration sound profiles on i4 and iX."},bmw_phev_max_edrive_140kmh:{name:"PHEV MAX eDrive Pure Electric Speed Ceiling",desc:"Increases max pure electric speed ceiling on 330e / 530e Plug-in hybrids to 140 km/h."},bmw_ac_charging_current_limit_menu:{name:"AC Home Charger Maximum Current Limit Selector",desc:"Adds AC home charging current limiter to prevent home circuit overload."},toyota_hybrid_ev_mode_override:{name:"Toyota / Lexus EV Mode Throttle Override Suppression",desc:"Prevents gasoline engine from forced start during acceleration when EV mode button is active."},toyota_hybrid_battery_fan_speed_boost:{name:"Toyota / Lexus High-Voltage Battery Cooling Fan Boost",desc:"Increases hybrid traction battery cooling fan speed by +30% to prevent thermal degradation in hot climates."},tesla_sentry_high_bitrate_video:{name:"Tesla Sentry Mode High-Bitrate Continuous Dashcam Recording",desc:"Increases Sentry Mode camera video recording bitrate for crystal-clear license plate visibility."},tesla_cabin_overheat_threshold_30c:{name:"Tesla Cabin Overheat Protection Temperature Threshold",desc:"Lowers cabin overheat protection climate trigger temperature from 40\xb0C to 30\xb0C for interior preservation."},bmwmotorrad_quickshifter_pro_readapt:{name:"Shift Assistant Pro Re-Adaptation",desc:"Resets shift sensor learning parameters and initiates quickshifter recalibration."},bmwmotorrad_esa_zero_point_calib:{name:"Dynamic ESA Suspension Zero-Point Calibration",desc:"Calibrates electronic suspension load and travel sensors to factory zero."},bmwmotorrad_abs_pro_cornering_toggle:{name:"ABS Pro Cornering Mode Intervention Threshold",desc:"Adjusts lean-angle dependent ABS intervention sensitivity for track use."},bmwmotorrad_service_interval_reset:{name:"Annual & Distance Service Reminder Reset",desc:"Resets instrument cluster service indicator and sets custom interval."},bmwmotorrad_headlight_pro_cornering:{name:"Headlight Pro Adaptive Cornering Light Sensitivity",desc:"Adjusts lean angle threshold for adaptive cornering headlight activation."},bmwmotorrad_keyless_ride_range_extend:{name:"Keyless Ride Fob Detection Range Extension",desc:"Optimizes transponder signal range for keyless ignition sensing."},bmwmotorrad_reverse_assist_sensitivity:{name:"Electric Reverse Assist Motor Sensitivity",desc:"Fine-tunes reverse drive electric starter motor speed and torque limit."},ducati_riding_mode_custom_profile:{name:"Riding Mode Custom Profile Creator",desc:"Unlocks custom combinations for Race, Sport, Touring, and Urban profiles."},ducati_ohlins_suspension_mapping:{name:"\xd6hlins Smart EC 2.0 Semi-Active Suspension Mapping",desc:"Fine-tunes damping curve and stiffness presets for electronic suspension."},ducati_dashboard_lap_timer_gps:{name:"TFT Dashboard Lap Timer & GPS Sector Splits",desc:"Unlocks track lap timer and sector split display on instrument cluster."},ducati_engine_brake_control_ebc:{name:"Engine Brake Control Level Adjustment",desc:"Adjusts rear wheel deceleration torque during hard corner entry braking."},ducati_cruise_control_retrofit_enable:{name:"Cruise Control Retrofit Activation",desc:"Enables ECU software flag for retrofitted electronic cruise control switches."},ducati_exhaust_valve_sound_map:{name:"Exhaust Servo Valve Opening RPM Map",desc:"Adjusts acoustic exhaust valve opening threshold for enhanced exhaust note."},ducati_pit_lane_limiter_config:{name:"Pit Lane Speed Limiter Threshold",desc:"Enables 60 km/h pit lane speed limiter toggle on handlebar switches."},ducati_desmo_service_light_reset:{name:"Oil & Desmo Valve Service Light Reset",desc:"Clears Desmodromic valve service reminder warning on instrument cluster."},ktm_quickshifter_plus_delay_tuning:{name:"Quickshifter+ Shift Cut Time & Delay Fine-Tuning",desc:"Customizes ignition cut duration per gear for seamless up/down shifts."},ktm_rally_offroad_abs_tc_unlock:{name:"Rally / Off-Road ABS & TC Mode Unlock",desc:"Disables rear ABS and unlocks 9-stage slip adjustment in Rally mode."},ktm_my_ktm_connectivity_unlock:{name:"My KTM / Husqvarna Connectivity Module Activation",desc:"Enables Bluetooth navigation and turn-by-turn routing on TFT display."},ktm_cruise_control_retrofit_enable:{name:"Cruise Control Retrofit Software Unlock",desc:"Activates cruise control function after installing handlebar switch kit."},ktm_clutch_pull_map_switch_gesture:{name:"Clutch-Pull Gesture Map Switching",desc:"Enables rapid map switching by executing clutch lever gesture on startup."},yamaha_quickshifter_cut_time_adjust:{name:"Quickshifter Ignition Cut-Time & Sensitivity",desc:"Adjusts quickshifter sensor load threshold and spark interruption delay."},yamaha_ride_by_wire_throttle_map:{name:"Ride-by-Wire Throttle Map Preset Selector",desc:"Switches between A-Mode, STD, and B-Mode throttle maps."},yamaha_tft_track_theme_unlock:{name:"TFT Track Display Layout & Shift Light Unlock",desc:"Unlocks R1/MT-09 SP track cluster layout and programmable shift RPM lights."},yamaha_launch_control_sensitivity:{name:"Launch Control System Rev Ceiling",desc:"Configures launch control holding RPM."},yamaha_heated_grips_accessory_enable:{name:"Genuine Heated Grips TFT Menu Integration",desc:"Enables heated grip controls and temperature gauge on TFT screen."},honda_hstc_wheelie_control_fine_tune:{name:"HSTC Traction & Wheelie Control Fine-Tuning",desc:"Adjusts Honda Selectable Torque Control slip ratio and front wheel lift tolerance."},honda_bi_directional_quickshifter_enable:{name:"Bi-Directional Quickshifter Retrofit Unlock",desc:"Enables auto-blipper and up/down quickshifter coding in ECU memory."},honda_service_reminder_custom_interval:{name:"Oil Service Reminder Distance Customizer",desc:"Sets custom oil change mileage interval on digital dash."},honda_track_abs_rear_disable:{name:"Track ABS Rear-Wheel Deactivation",desc:"Disables rear wheel ABS channel while retaining front cornering ABS for track days."},honda_cold_