ect Mode Memory Retention",desc:"Retains last active Drive Select profile upon restart."},audi_virtual_cockpit_themes:{name:"Audi Virtual Cockpit S/RS Sport Graphic Layout",desc:"Unlocks S/RS central tachometer layout options on Virtual Cockpit."},vag_scandinavian_drl:{name:"Scandinavian DRL Mode",desc:"Keeps rear tail lights illuminated continuously alongside front DRLs."},vag_mirror_dip_reverse:{name:"Passenger Mirror Dip in Reverse",desc:"Tills passenger side mirror downward when reverse gear is engaged."},vag_dynamic_turn_signal:{name:"Dynamic / Sequential Turn Signal Mode",desc:"Enables sweeping dynamic LED blinker pattern on compatible rear light modules."},vag_seatbelt_warning_duration:{name:"Seatbelt Warning Chime Duration Adjustment",desc:"Shortens or suppresses repetitive seatbelt warning chime timer."},vag_sunroof_remote:{name:"Sunroof Remote Comfort Control",desc:"Allows opening and tilting panoramic sunroof via remote key fob hold."},vag_acc_distance_preset:{name:"ACC Adaptive Cruise Default Following Distance",desc:"Sets default radar following distance profile on ignition start."},vag_infotainment_startup_logo:{name:"Infotainment Boot Graphic Logo",desc:"Customizes infotainment startup splash screen logo."},vag_ambient_color_cycle:{name:"Interior Ambient Light Color Spectrum Unlock",desc:"Expands ambient lighting palette options in vehicle settings menu."},vag_service_interval_custom:{name:"Custom Inspection & Service Distance Threshold",desc:"Configures custom km and day targets for next service warning."},vag_door_handle_lights_reverse:{name:"Exterior Door Handle Lights ON in Reverse",desc:"Illuminates door handle LED puddle lights when reversing for ground visibility."},bmw_msport_exhaust_burble:{name:"M-Sport Exhaust Burble & Pop Intensity",desc:"Adjusts overrun burble sound aggressiveness in Sport mode."},bmw_welcome_light_sequence:{name:"Welcome Light Sequence Animation",desc:"Customizes LED headlight and Angel Eyes welcome greeting sequence."},